  <para style="h">Mateyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Anwodelɛnli Mateyu Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Anwodelɛnli Mateyu Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ɛhye mɔ a le Gyisɛse Kelaese, mɔɔ vi Belemgbunli Devidi nee Ebileham abusua ne anu la ɔ nla mɔ:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ebileham ara a le Ayezeke; Ayezeke ara a le Gyekɔbo; Gyekɔbo amra a le Dwuda nee ɔ mediema ne mɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Dwuda amra a le Pɛlɛze nee Zila (bɛ nli a le Teema) Pɛlɛze ara a le Hɛzelɔn; Hɛzelɔn ara a le Relam;<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Relam ara a le Amenadabe; Amenadabe ara a le Nahyɔn; Nahyɔn ara a le Salemɔn;<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salemɔn ara a le Bowaze mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ɔ nli Releehabe la; Bowaze ara a le Obɛde. Ɔ nli bɛfɛlɛ ye Wulutu; Obɛde ara a le Gyɛsi;<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Gyɛsi ara a le Belemgbunli Devidi. Devidi ara a le Sɔlɔmɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Sɔlɔmɔn ɔ nli a le Yulaya kunlavolɛ raalɛ la.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sɔlɔmɔn ara a le Rilihɔbowam; Rilihɔbowam ara a le Abaegya; Abaegya ara a le Esa;<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Esa ara a le Gyɛhɔhyafate; Gyɛhɔhyafate ara a le Gyɛholam; Gyɛholam ara a le Ɛzaya;<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Ɛzaya ara a le Dwotam; Dwotam ara a le Ehaze; Ehaze ara a le Hɛzikaya;<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hɛzikaya ara a le Manasɛ; Manasɛ ara a le Amɔn; Amɔn ara a le Dwosaya;<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Dwosaya amra a le Gyɛhɔyakɛn nee ɔ mediema ne mɔ (bɛwole bɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛvale Dwuuma ne bɛhɔle amanvoa wɔ Babelɔn la). <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Amanvoahɔlɛ ne anzi: Gyɛhɔyakɛn wole Hyealeteɛle; Hyealeteɛle ara a le Zɛlɛbabɛle;<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zɛlɛbabɛle ara a le Abayude; Abayude ara a le Yilayakem; Yilayakem ara a le Ezɔ;<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Ezɔ ara a le Zeedɔko; Zeedɔko ara a le Ekem; Ekem ara a le Yilayɛde;<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Yilayɛde ara a le Ɛlieza; Ɛlieza ara a le Matan; Matan ara a le Gyekɔbo;<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Gyekɔbo ara a le Dwosefi mɔɔ ɔ ye a le Male, mɔɔ le Gyisɛse Kelaese, Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɔ nli ne la.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ɛhye mɔ a le abusua eku eku bulu nee nna ne mɔɔ vi Ebileham anwo zo kɔdwu Belemgbunli Devidi anwo zo a; yɛɛ bulu nee nna noko vi Belemgbunli Devidi mekɛ zo kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛvale Dwuuma ne bɛhɔle amanvoa la; yɛɛ bulu nee nna noko vi amanvoahɔlɛ ne anzi kɔkpula Kelaese mekɛ zo.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakula ne awolɛ ɛwɔkɛbɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ɛhye mɔ a le nɔhalɛ edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ fale Kelaese Gyisɛse ye awolɛ ne anwo a. Bɛvale ɔ nli Male bɛmaanle Dwosefi agyalɛ. Na mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee Male tɛde belamunli, anzɛɛ ɛnee ɔtɛnwunle nrenyia fee ɛlɛ la, ɔlua Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne anwo zo ɔnrenzɛle. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Na Dwosefi mɔɔ le ɔ hu ne, mɔɔ le nrenyia mɔɔ di pɛlepɛle la, yɛle ye adwenle kɛ ɔbɔ ye ewuole wɔ fealera nu, kɛmɔ yeangulo kɛ ɔkɛgua ɔ nyunlu nyiane aze wɔ bagua nu la ati.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Na mɔɔ ɔla ye ɛsokpa ne azo ɔlɛdwenledwenle ɛhye mɔ anwo la, ɔhanle ɛlalɛ ɔnwunle kɛ anwumabɔvolɛ bie gyi ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne. Na anwumabɔvolɛ ne vɛlɛle ye zele ye kɛ, “Dwosefi, Devidi ara, mmasulo kɛ ɛkɛva Male ɛkɛyɛ ɛ ye! Ɔluakɛ, ɔlua Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne anwo zo a bɛnrenzɛ kakula anzɛɛ adɔma ne mɔɔ la ɔ kunlu la a. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Na ɔbawo ralɛ nrenyia, mɔɔ bɛbado ye duma Gyisɛse, mɔɔ ɔ bo a le Ngoanedievolɛ la, ɔluakɛ, yemɔ a ɔbakpɔne ye menli yeavi bɛ ɛtane nu a. <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Na ɛhye a bamaa Nana Nyamenle nrɛlaleɛ ne mɔɔ ɔvale ɔzoanle ye ngapezoma ne mɔ la ali munli a.<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“‘Tie! Belamunli raalɛ ne banrenzɛ adɔma. Ɔbawo ralɛ nrenyia, na bɛbavɛlɛ ye “Yemanoɛle” mɔɔ ɔ bo a le kɛ “Nana Nyamenle nee yɛ de” la.’” <verse eid="MAT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Na mɔɔ Dwosefi anye dele la, ɔyɛle mɔɔ anwumabɔvolɛ ne zele ye kyengye kɛ ɔyɛ la, na ɔvale Male ɔ nee ye rale ye aako nu na ɔvale ye ɔyɛle ɔ ye, <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />na yeannwu nrenyia too kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔwole ɔ ra ne la; na Dwosefi donle ye duma “Gyisɛse.”<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛwo kakula Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Bɛwole Gyisɛse wɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm mɔɔ wɔ Dwudiya la, wɔ Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo mekɛ zo. Melɛ zɔhane anu menli bie mɔɔ bɛnea nwɔlɛra nee anwomanyunlu bɛka edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bazi la vi sɛnzɛnduduleɛ maanle ne anu rale Gyɛlusalɛm na bɛbizale kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />“Nienwu a Dwuuma Belemgbunli fofolɛ ne mɔɔ bɛwo ye la wɔ a? Ɔluakɛ yɛnwu ye ɛwɔlɛra ne wɔ sɛnzɛnduduleɛ maanle ne anu moamoa nehane, na yɛra kɛ yɛbayeyɛ ye.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Na Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo dele ɛhye la ye adwenle yɛle ye tendaanwo somaa ne ala wɔ bɛ kpuyia ne anwo, na Gyɛlusalɛm amuala yɛle huhuhuhu zɛhae. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ɛhye maanle Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo vɛlɛle Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ayia. Na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Ngapezoma ne mɔ hilele yɛ ɛleka mɔɔ bɛbawo Ngoanedievolɛ ne la ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Na bɛbuale ye kɛ “Ɛhɛe, wɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm, ɔluakɛ kapezonli Maeka hɛlɛle kɛ:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“‘O Bɛtelɛhɛm sua ekyi, ɛnle Dwudiya maanle nu namule mɔɔ nvasoɛ biala ɛnle ɛ nwo zo a, ɔluakɛ Amɛnlado ko vi wɔ nu bavinde na yeazie me menli Yizilayɛma.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Na akee Hɛlɔdo dole nwɔlɛra nwo deɛsukoavoma ne mɔ nrɛlaleɛ kɛ bɛrɛla bɛranwu ye; na wɔ zɛhae ayia ne anu a ɔnwunle mekɛ fɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ nwɔlɛra nwo deɛsukoavoma ne mɔ lumuale nwunle ɛwɔlɛra ne la. Akee ɔhanle ɔhilele bɛ kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />“Bɛhɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm na bɛhɔkpondɛ kakula ne. Na saa bɛnwu ye a, bɛzia bɛrɛla na bɛraha bɛhile me amaa medame noko meahɔ meahɔyeyɛ ye bie!” <verse eid="MAT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Belemgbunli ne dendɛle wiele la nwɔlɛra nwo deɛsukoavoma ne mɔ zile nu hɔle bieko. Na nea! Ɛwɔlɛra ne yele ɔ nwo hilele bɛ bieko, na eza ɔlile bɛ nyunlu ɔ nee bɛ hɔle Bɛtelɛhɛm hɔgyinlanle ɛleka kpɔkyee ne mɔɔ kakula ne wɔ la. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Bɛ fɛlɛkolilɛ ne yɛle totohyia kpole mɔɔ ɔnle ye nzuzulɛ a.<verse eid="MAT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Bɛdwule sua ne mɔɔ Male nee adɔma ne wɔ nu la anu la, bɛ muala bɛhotohotole na bɛyeyɛle ye. Akee bɛtulutulule bɛ awɔlɛ ne mɔ anu na bɛhyɛle ye nvutuke, ɛyɛlɛ nee alufuanlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Na mɔɔ bɛsia bɛahɔ bɛ sua zo la, bɛampe Gyɛlusalɛm bɛangɔmbɔ Hɛlɔdo amaneɛ, ɔluakɛ ɛnee Nana Nyamenle ɛbɔ bɛ kɔkɔ wɔ ɛlalɛ nu kɛ bɛva adenle gyɛne zo bɛhɔ sua nu.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Na nzinlii mɔɔ ɛnee bɛhɔ la, Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛ ko yele ɔ nwo hilele Dwosefi wɔ ɛlalɛ nu, na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Dwazo na fa kakula ne nee ɔ nli nriandi kɔ Yigyibiti, na tɛnla ɛkɛ ne kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔze wɔ kɛ ɛzia ɛ nzi la ɔluakɛ, Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo bakpondɛ adenle bie yealua zo yeahu kakula ne.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Nɔe ko ne ala ɔ nee Male nee kakula ne bɛdule bɛ bo bɛhɔle Yigyibiti, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />na bɛdɛnlanle Yigyibiti dedee ɔhɔkpulale mekɛ mɔɔ Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo wule la. Na ɛhye noko maanle edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ Awulae lua ngapezoma ne mɔ anwo zo hanle la rayɛle Zɔ bɔkɔɔ kɛ, “Mevɛlɛ me Ra ne mevi Yigyibiti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Mɔɔ Hɛlɔdo nwunle kɛ nwɔlɛra nwo deɛsukoavoma ne mɔ ɛdu ɔ nloa ɛdo la ɔnyianle ɛya kpole. Ɔzoanle azogya wɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm, na ɔmaanle bɛ tumi kɛ bɛhu ralɛ nrenyia biala mɔɔ ɛli ɛvolɛ nwiɔ mɔɔ ba aze la wɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm sua ne azo nee namunamu mɔɔ zuozua Bɛtelɛhɛm la, ɔluakɛ nwɔlɛra nwo deɛsukoavoma ne mɔ hanle hilele ye kɛ ɛwɔlɛra ne lumuale yele ɔ nwo hilele bɛ la ye ɛvolɛ nwiɔ ɛne. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Zɛhae amumuyɛ nyɛleɛ ne mɔɔ Hɛlɔdo yɛle la maanle kapezonli Gyɛlɛmaya edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle la lile munli kɛ,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Nyane nee ɛzunlɛ kpole vindele Releema, ɛzunlɛ nee awolɛyelɛ kpole rale; Relahyɛle zunle ɔ mra, na yeangulo kɛ bɛkyekye ɔ rɛle, ɔluakɛ bɛwuwu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Na mɔɔ Hɛlɔdo wule la, Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛ yele ɔ nwo hilele Dwosefi wɔ ɛlalɛ nu wɔ Yigyibiti, na ɔzele ye kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />“Dwazo na fa kakula ne nee ɔ nli sia kɔ Yizilayɛ, ɔluakɛ ahenle mɔɔ ɛnee kpondɛ kakula ne ahu ye la mumua ne ɛwu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ɔti ndɛndɛ ne ala ɔ nee Gyisɛse nee ɔ nli bɛziale bɛhɔle Yizilayɛ maanle nu. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Na mɔɔ bɛlua adenle nu la, ɛzulolɛ hanle ye, ɔluakɛ ɔdele ye kɛ amuanrɛɛ belemgbunli fofolɛ ne le Hɛlɔdo ara nrenyia, Aakɛleeyɛse. Na wɔ ɛlalɛ bieko anu, bɛbɔle ye kɔkɔ kɛ ɔmmakɔ Dwudiya, ɛhye ati bɛhɔle Galeli, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />na bɛdɛnlanle Nazalɛte. Ɛhye maanle ngapezoma ne mɔ edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ bɛhanle mɔɔ fale Ngoanedievolɛ ne anwo la lile munli kɛ, “Bɛbavɛlɛ ye Nazalɛtenli.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛbɔ ye gyima bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ Nazalɛte la, Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne bɔle ye Nyamedwɛkɛ ɛhanlɛ ne abo wɔ Dwudiya fiemgbole ne azo. Ye edwɛkɛ kpɔkɛ mɔɔ ɔgyinlanle zolɛ ɛsesebɛ la a le kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛvi bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anu, bɛnlu bɛ nwo, na bɛkpondɛ Nyamenle abo zo, ɔluakɛ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ɛnrɛhyɛ biala na ara.”<verse eid="MAT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ayezaya kapezonli ne hanle Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne Nyamenle gyimayɛlɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ wɔ ɛvolɛ pemgbenlamgbe mɔɔ ɛze ɛhɔ la anu. Ɔhɛlɛle kɛ, “Mete ɛdeanlɛ bie vi fiemgbole ne azo kɛ, ‘Bɛziezie Awulae adenle ne anu na bɛdenrɛdenrɛ ndenle ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔbalua nu la.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Dwɔn tɛladeɛ ne mɔɔ ɔwula la bɛvale ɛkpɔnwɔ nwo enrinli a bɛnwonle a, yɛɛ nwoma bɛlɛte noko a hye ɔ nze a; ye aleɛ a le aabɛ nee ɛhoayelɛ nu wolɛ ala. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Menli vi Gyɛlusalɛm nee Dwɔdan Awoka ne azo amuala rale, na nɔhalɛ nu, bɛvi Dwudiya ɛleka biala na bɛrale ɛsɛlɛ ne azo kɛ bɛbadie Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ngilehilenu ne, <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />na mɔɔ bɛhanle bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ la ɔzɔnenle bɛ wɔ Azule Dwɔdan ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Na melɛ mɔɔ ɔnwunle kɛ Falasiima nee Sadusiima dɔɔnwo ɛlɛba bɛamaa yeazɔne bɛ la, ɔkpole bɛ. Ɔdeanle bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛmɛ nwɔlɛ amra! Nwane a zele bɛ kɛ bɛnriandi bɛvi Nana Nyamenle ɛyavalɛ kpole ne mɔɔ ɛlɛba la anu a?”<verse eid="MAT 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />“Bɛhile kɛ amgba noko bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛvi ɛtane nu, na akee bɛlɛbɔ ɛbɛla kpalɛ kolaa na bɛazɔne bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Mmamaa bɛ adwenle yɛ bɛ kɛ, ‘Yɛmɛ yɛle Dwuuma, yɛle Ebileham abo zo amra, yemɔti bɛdi munli.’ Ɛhye ɛngile ɛhwee. Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle kola kakyi awolɛ ɛhye mɔ yɛ bɛ Dwuuma!<verse eid="MAT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />“Na kɛkala bɔbɔ, Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ anwomoalɛ ɛwie. Ye akuma ne la baka ne abo, na baka biala mɔɔ anzo ma la Ɔbabu ye. Bɛbapepɛ bɛ na bɛayela bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />“Mefa nzule mgbane a mesɔne menli mɔɔ kɛnlu bɛ nwo wɔ bɛ ɛtane nwo la a; na awie bie ɛlɛba, mɔɔ ɔlɛ tumi kpole ɔtɛla me a, na ɔlua ye kpole ti, ye mgbɔlaboa ne bɔbɔ memfɛta ye ɛzoalɛ! Na yemɔ ɔbava Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne nee senle a yeazɔne bɛ a. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Ɔbakpogya ma ne yeavi abonle ne anwo, na yeayela bɛ wɔ ɔnlɛ-awieleɛ senle ne mɔɔ ɛlɛsɔ la anu, na akee yeava ma kpalɛ ne yeagua ye bonwole ne azo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Gyisɛse vi Galeli maanzinli nu rale Azule Dwɔdan ne anloa wɔ Dwɔn anwo ɛkɛ ne kɛ ɔzɔne ye. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Na Dwɔn hanle kɛ “Menfɛta kɛ menwɔzɔne wɔ. Wɔmɔ a ɔwɔ kɛ ɛsɔne me a, na duzu ati a wɔra kɛ menzɔne wɔ ɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Maa ɔyɛ zɔhane kɛkala. Ɔluakɛ ɔle kpalɛ kɛ yɛfa zɛhae adenle zo yɛyɛ mɔɔ Nyamenle kpondɛ kɛ yɛyɛ la.” Zɔhane ati Dwɔn kponlenle zolɛ na ɔzɔnenle ye. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Mɔɔ bɛzɔnenle Gyisɛse bɛwiele la, ɔvi azule ne anu ɔvole file zo ndɛndɛ ne ala. Anwuma bukele na ɔnwunle kɛ Nyamenle Sunsum ne ɛlɛdwu kɛ abubule la na ɔrazinzele ɔ nwo zo. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Na ɛnelɛ bie vi anwuma zele kɛ, “Ɛhye a le me Ra mɔɔ mekulo ye la, Me nye die ɔ nwo kpole.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne vale Gyisɛse hɔle fiemgbole ne azo, amaa ɔlua zo Abɔnsam azɔ ye anlea wɔ ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ɔhyele ɛhɔne ewiazo nee nɔɔzo too kenle abulanla, na ɛhye maanle ɛhɔne hunle ye kpole kpalɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Na Abɔnsam zɔle ye nleanle kɛ ɔhakyi kpanwo dolɔfo dɔɔnwo na ɔva ɔyɛ ye aleɛ. Na Abɔnsam zele kɛ, “Ɛhye bahile kɛ amgba ɛle Nyamenle Ra ne.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ! Ɔluakɛ Ngɛlɛlera ne ka kile yɛ kɛ kpanwo angomekye ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛyɛ menli ngɛla aleɛ: na emomu, Nyamenle edwɛkɛ biala azo ɛlilɛ a le debie mɔɔ yɛhyia nwo a.”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Akee Abɔnsam vale Gyisɛse hɔle Asɔne Sua ne tawa ne azo. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Wulu pe, na kile kɛ wɔmɔ a le Nana Nyamenle Ra ne a; ɔluakɛ Ngɛlɛlera ne kile kɛ, ‘Nana Nyamenle bazoa ye anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ yeamaa bɛazinza wɔ wɔ munzule biala anu,’ na bɛnrɛmaa ɛnrɛbubu dwɔkɔdwɔkɔ wɔ awolɛ ne mɔɔ gua aze la azo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Gyisɛse buale ye ndɛndɛ ne ala ɔzele kɛ, “Ngɛlɛlera ne noko eza se yɛ kɛ, Mmasɔ wɔ Awulae Nyamenle ne ɛnea wɔ sɔnea mgbane mgbane nu!”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Eza Abɔnsam vale ye hɔle boka tendendenlenle bie ati zo na ɔhilele ye ewiade maanle ne amuala nee bɛ anyunlunyia kosooti. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Na ɔzele Gyisɛse kɛ. “Saa ɛkɛhoto na ɛkɛzonle me ɛdeɛ a anrɛɛ mebava ɛhye mɔ kosooti meamaa wɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Ɛvi ɛke kɔ, Abɔnsam. Ngɛlɛlera ne se kɛ, ‘Sonle Awulae Nyamenle ne angomekye ala. Tie ɔdaye ɔ ngomekye ala.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Akee Abɔnsam gyakyile ye ɛkɛ ne hɔle, na anwumabɔvolɛma rale razonlenle Gyisɛse.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛbɔ ye Nyamedwɛkɛ ɛhanlɛ bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12-13" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse dele kɛ bɛhye Dwɔn la, ɔvile Dwudiya na ɔrale ye sua zo, Nazalɛte, mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la; na yeangyɛ biala ɔdule ɔhɔdɛnlanle Kapɛnayɛm, mɔɔ zua Galeli Tandane ne mɔɔ zua Zɛbulɛn nee Nafetalae la. <verse eid="MAT 4:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Ɛhye maanle kapezonli Ayezaya edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle la lile munli:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15-16" />“Zɛbulɛn azɛlɛ nee Nafetalae azɛlɛ ne mɔɔ zua Tandane ne, nee namunamu mɔɔ wɔ Azule Dwɔdan anzi, nee Galeli Sɔlɔ nehane mɔɔ maanle gyɛne zo amra dɔɔnwo de nu la ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ menli mɔɔ dɛnlanle awozinli nu la ɛnwu Kɛnlaneɛ kpole a; bɛdɛnlanle ewule azɛlɛ zo, na Kɛnlaneɛ kpole ne dale bɛ nwo zo.” <verse eid="MAT 4:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ɔvi mekɛ ɛhye anu, Gyisɛse bɔle ye Nyamedwɛkɛ ɛhanlɛ ne abo kɛ, “Bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛvi ɛtane nu, bɛnlu bɛ nwo, na bɛkpo Nana Nyamenle abo zo, ɔluakɛ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ɛbikye.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Kenle ko bie ɔlua ɛnweazo wɔ Galeli Tandane ne anloa la ɔnwunle mediema nwiɔ, Saemɔn, mɔɔ ɔdaye ko ye ala bɛfɛlɛ ye Pita, nee Andelu, kɛ bɛwɔ ɛlɛne nu bɛlɛto avonle bɛahye edwɛne, ɔluakɛ bɛle adwɛnekɔvolɛma; yɛɛ bɛ gyima noko mɔɔ bɛyɛ ala ɛne. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Gyisɛse vɛlɛle bɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛgyakyi bɛ avonle ne mɔ na bɛrali me nzi na mebayɛ bɛ menli mɔɔ kpondɛ ngɛla bo zo la.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ɛkɛ ne ala bɛgyakyile bɛ avonle ne mɔ na bɛdoale ye bɛ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Bɛhɔle bɛ nyunlu ekyii wɔ ɛnwea ne azo la ɔnwunle mediema nwiɔ bieko, Gyemise nee Dwɔn, kɛ bɛ nee bɛ ze Zɛbɛdi de ɛlɛne nu bɛlɛsa bɛ avonle ne mɔ; na ɔvɛlɛle bɛdabɛ noko kɛ bɛrɛla. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Na ndɛndɛ ne ala, bɛgyakyile bɛ gyima ne nee bɛ ze, na bɛdoale ye bɛ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Gyisɛse kpɔsale Galeli amuala na ɔhilele debie wɔ Dwuuma ayiasua ne mɔ anu wɔ ɛleka biala, na ɔhanle Nyamenle Edwɛkpa ne mɔɔ fale Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ɛralɛ ne anwo la wɔ ɛleka biala. Na ɔyɛle wuliravolɛma nee ewule ngakyile ngakyile dɔɔnwo ayile. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ye nwanwanendeɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ zandele hɔle moa ɔdɛlale Galeli ɛweɛne ne. Ɔlua ɛhye ati wuliravolɛma mɔɔ vi Selea moamoa la rale maanle bɛyɛle bɛ ayile. Na bɛ anwodolɛ nee bɛ anwofofolɛ biala, anzɛɛ saa awozonle ɛva bɛ, anzɛɛ bɛbɔ ɛlane, anzɛɛ saa bɛbubu bɛgua bɔbɔ a, ɔyɛle bɛ muala ayile ɔmaanle bɛ nwo zale. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Na menli ekpunli ekpunli dɔɔnwo ne ala mɔɔ bɛvi Galeli, nee Azua mgbole Bulu ne azo, nee Gyɛlusalɛm, nee mɔɔ vi Dwudiya ngameɛ ngameɛ la kosooti, nee mɔɔ vi Azule Dwɔdan anzi lɔ bɔbɔ la doale ye.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Boka ne azo Nyamedwɛkɛhanlɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1-2" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee menli dɔɔnwo ɛlɛyɛ ayia la, ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hɔdɛnlanle aze wɔ boka ne azo na ɔhilehilele bɛ debie wɔ ɛkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, Menli mɔɔ bɛlɛ bɛ nwo aze la anwo ɛyɛ moavolɛ kpole, ɔluakɛ bɛva Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne bɛhyɛ bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Menli mɔɔ di nyane la anwo ɛyɛ moavolɛ kpole! Ɔluakɛ bɛbakyekye bɛ rɛle. <verse eid="MAT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Bɛlɛvoma anwo ɛyɛ moavolɛ! Ɔluakɛ ewiade azɛlɛ tɛtɛtɛlɛlɛ ne le bɛ deɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nwo dedɔ pɛpɛlilɛ nee kpalɛyɛlɛ la, ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ a bɛbamaa bɛ ko ayi a. <verse eid="MAT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Nyilalɛ ɛha atiakunlukpalɛyɛvoma nee anwunvɔnesevoma, ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ a bɛbaze bɛ anwunvɔne a. <verse eid="MAT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ahonle ne mɔ anu te la, ɔluakɛ bɛbanwu Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="MAT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛpele anzondwolɛ nwo la, bɛmɛ a bɛbavɛlɛ bɛ Nana Nyamenle amra a. <verse eid="MAT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɔlua bɛ kpalɛyɛlɛ ti bɛyɛ bɛ ayɛkayɛkadeɛ la, ɔluakɛ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le bɛ deɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11-12" />Saa ɔlua me ɛdoalɛ ti, bɛbɔ bɛ aholoba, bɛyɛ bɛ ayɛkayɛkadeɛ, na bɛfa edwɛkɛ ɛtane muala bɛto bɛ nwo zo adalɛ nu a bɛli fɛlɛko maa ɔyɛ nwanwane. Bɛnyia ahomeka! Bɛli fɛlɛko wɔ nwolɛ! Ɔluakɛ ahatualɛ kpole kpalɛ bie ɛlɛkendɛ bɛ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle nu lɔ. Na bɛhakye kɛ, zɔhane ala a bɛyɛle ngapezoma ne mɔ mɔɔ lumuale la a.<verse eid="MAT 5:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Bɛmɛ a bɛle ewiade anzɛɛ azɛlɛ ye azo ngyenle a; na saa bɛ ngyenle ne minli ye fɛlɛko ne a, duzu a bazi ewiade a? Nvasoɛ biala ɛnrɛra zo bieko, na emomu, bɛbavuandi bɛagua ye lɔ, na menli atietia bɛ nwo zo kɛ ewula la. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Bɛmɛ a bɛle ewiade kɛnlaneɛ ne a, Sua mɔɔ gyi boka zo la ɛngola ɛnvea, na nɔɔzo bɔbɔ awie biala nwu ye. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15-16" />Bɛmmafea bɛ kɛnlaneɛ ne! Bɛmaa ɔda ɔmaa awie biala; bɛmaa menli ɛnwu bɛ ɛbɛla kpalɛ ne mɔɔ bɛbɔ la, amaa bɛaye bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Bɛnyia me maleɛ ne anwo ndelebɛbo; Bɛmmadwenle kɛ membale kɛ mebazɛkye Mosisi mɛla ne nee ngapezoma ne mɔ ngakyelɛ kɔkɔ ne mɔɔ bɛbɔle la. Kyɛkyɛ, membale kɛ mebazɔ zolɛ, na meamaa ye kosooti ali munli. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, Mɛla biala mɔɔ wɔ Buluku Nwuanzanwuanza ne anu la bahɔ zolɛ too kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ mɛla ne bodane mɔɔ ɔgyi zolɛ la kɛyɛ ɛkɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ɛhye ati awie biala mɔɔ kɛbulu mɛla ne ekyi ne bɔbɔ azo, na ɔkɛhilehile awie mɔ gyɛne noko zɔhane la, ɔbayɛ kakula wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu. Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkilehile Nana Nyamenle mɛla ne na bɛdi zolɛ la a bayɛ mgbole wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a.<verse eid="MAT 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />“Na mese bɛ kɛ, kyesɛ bɛ tenleneyɛlɛ ne di munli kpole kpalɛ tɛla Falasiima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ, anrɛɛ yemɔ bɛnrɛhola Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu dwu fee zɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Wɔ Mosisi mɛla ne anu ɔwɔ nu kɛ, ‘Saa ɛku sonla a, ɔwɔ kɛ ɛwu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Na mesi zo bieko kɛ saa ɛfa ɛya mgbane bɔbɔ, bɔbɔ wɔ wɔ sua nu a bɛbabua wɔ ndɛne! Saa ɛfɛlɛ ɛ gɔnwo kɛ ɔle koasea a, bɛ nee wɔ kɛhɔ ndɛnebualɛ ɛleka bɛkɛhɔbua wɔ ndɛne. Yɛɛ saa ɛwa ye amonle noko a ɛbahɔ abɔnsam senle ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />“Ɛhye ati saa ɛgyi azukponle ne anyunlu wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, na ɛlɛfa azubɔdeɛ biala wɔamaa Nyamenle, na arɛlevilɛ nu ala ɛkakye kɛ agɔnwolɛ bie lɛ edwɛkɛ bie tia wɔ a, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />gyakyi wɔ azubɔdeɛ ne wɔ azukponle ne azo, na kɔ kɔkpɔda ye na ɛ nee ye ɛbɔ nu, na akee sia babɔ wɔ azu ne maa Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Ɛ nee wɔ kpɔvolɛ ne ɛbɔ nu ndɛndɛ ne ala na mekɛ ne amkpa nwo, ammaa kenle bie wɔ kpɔvolɛ ne anye wɔ anwula ndɛnebuavolɛ ne asa, na ndɛnebuavolɛ ne noko anva wɔ anwula kakɛdavolɛ asa anu maa yeando wɔ efiade, <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />ɔluakɛ ɛbala efiade ne kɔkpula kɛ ɛkɛdua kapɛle ko biala mɔɔ ɛtua ye la.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mosisi mɛla ne se, ‘Mmasɛkye agyalɛ.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Na mame mese: Awie biala mɔɔ kɛnlea sonla raalɛ huhunli nu la ɛnee ɔ nee ye ɛyɛ zɛhae ɛtane ne wɔ ye ahonle nu ɛwie. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ɔti saa ɛ nye fema ne bɔbɔ maa ɛbɔ zɛhae huhunli ɛbɛla ne a tu ye na to ye lɔ. Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ wɔ ebule kɛzɛkye ɔkɛdɛla kɛ wɔ sonla baka mumua ne kɛhɔ abɔnsam senle nu la. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Na saa ɛ sa fema ne bɔbɔ maa ɛyɛ ɛtane a, pɛ ye ko! na fuandi to ye lɔ. Ɔle kpalɛ zɔhane ɔtɛla kɛ ɛkɛva wɔ sonla baka mumua ne ɛkɛhɔ abɔnsam senle nu la.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Mosisi mɛla ne se, ‘Saa awie biala kpondɛ kɛ ɔbɔ ɔ ye ewuole a, ɔkola ɔkɛlɛ aliyelɛ kɛlata ɔmaa ye.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Na mese bɛ kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ ɔkɛbɔ ɔ ye ewuole wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔtɛbɔle adwɔmane ɛbɛla biala la maa ɔto agyalɛ ɛzɛkyelɛ mɛla. Yɛɛ awie biala mɔɔ kɛgya ye la ɔdaye ɔto zɛhae agyalɛ ɛzɛkyelɛ mɛla ne.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Bieko, Mosisi mɛla ne se, ‘Ɔnle kɛ ɛbu ɛ nye ɛgua wɔ ɛwɔkɛ biala mɔɔ ɛkɛbɔ Nana Nyamenle la azo, na emomu, ɔwɔ kɛ ɛdi bɛ muala azo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Na Mame mese: ‘Mmaka ndane biala! Anzɛɛ bɔbɔ kɛ ɛkɛha kɛ Meka Anwuma!’ ɔle Nana Nyamenle ndane kpole, ɔluakɛ Anwuma maanle ne le Nana Nyamenle Ye Belemgbunli Ebia. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Na saa ɛka kɛ ‘Meka azɛlɛ ye!’ a, ɔle ndane kpole, ɔluakɛ azɛlɛ ye le Nana Nyamenle ɔ gyakɛ abo Ebia. Na mmaka ndane kɛ, ‘Meka Gyɛlusalɛm!’ ɔluakɛ Gyɛlusalɛm a le Belemgbunli kpole ne Ye suakpole a.<verse eid="MAT 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />“Mmaka ndane bɔbɔ ɛka kɛ, ‘Meka me ti!’ Ɔluakɛ ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛhakyi enrinli ko bɔbɔ fufule anzɛɛ bile. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ka ye sikalɛ kɛ, ‘Ɛhɛe, mebayɛ’ anzɛɛ ‘Kyɛkyɛ, menrɛyɛ.’ Wɔ edwɛkɛ kpɔkɛ ko ne ala le kpalɛ. Saa ɛfa ndane ɛsua wɔ ɛwɔkɛ nzi a ɛnee ɔkile kɛ debie bie tɔ sinli.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mosisi mɛla ne se, ‘Saa awie tu ɔ gɔnwo anye a, ɔwɔ kɛ bɛtu ye deɛ ne noko bɛsie ɔ bo zo. Saa awie tu ɛ nye a tu ahenle noko ɔdaye ye deɛ ne.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Na akee mese bɛ kɛ: Bɛ nee amumuyɛvoma mmadwudwu! <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Saa awie nee wɔ kɔ edwɛkɛlilɛ ɛleka ne, na bɛdie wɔ anwuma tɛladeɛ ne a kpolo wɔ kootu ne noko boka nwo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Saa sogyama se kɛ ɛzoa bɛ mbulalɛndeɛ ne mɔ ɛ nee bɛ ɛhɔ mayɛlɛ ko bɔbɔ a, soa ɛ nee bɛ ɛhɔ mayɛlɛ nwiɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Mɔɔ sɛlɛ wɔ debie la fa maa ye, na mmakakyi ɛ nzi ɛsi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ bosea bɛavi wɔ lɔ la.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mɛla bie wɔ ɛkɛ mɔɔ se, ‘Kulo ɛ gɔnwo mɔ na kyi wɔ kpɔvolɛma.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Na mame mese: Kulo wɔ kpɔvolɛma! Sɛlɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ wɔ ayɛkayɛkadeɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Na saa bɛyɛ ɛhye mɔ a yɛɛ ɛnee ɔkile kɛ amgba bɛle bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ Anwuma la amra a. Ɔluakɛ ɔfi ewia ɔmaa ɛtaneyɛvoma nee anwodelɛma amuala, na ɔtɔ ezule ɔmaa pɛpɛdivoma nee amumuyɛvoma noko. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Saa ɛkulo bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo wɔ la angomekye ala a, duzu nvasoɛ a wɔ zo a? Adwuledievolɛma ne mɔ bɔbɔ a yɛ ɛhye kpalɛ a. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Na saa ɛkulo ɛ gɔnwo mɔ angomekye ala a, duzu ngakyile a wɔ wɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛha la avinli a? Menli mɔɔ ɛnzonle Nana Nyamenle la bɔbɔ yɛ zɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Na bɛmɛ mɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdi munli, kɛmɔ bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la di munli la.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Bɛnlea boɛ! Bɛmmayɛ bɛ atiakunlukɛnlɛma ne bagua nu, amaa bɛahanvo bɛ, ɔluakɛ anrɛɛ bɛ sa ɛnrɛha bɛ ahyɛlɛdeɛ ne biala bɛnrɛvi bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la lɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Saa ɛfa ahyɛlɛdeɛ ɛmaa sɛlɛzɛlɛvolɛ bie a, mmayɛ nwolɛ dede kɛmɔ mɛlɛbɛlavoma ne mɔ yɛ la, bɛbɔ aweɛne wɔ ayia ɛleka ne mɔ nee awɔlɔne ne mɔ azo bɛtwe menli adwenle bɛba bɛ atiakunlukpalɛyɛlɛ ne azo! Nɔhalɛ nu meka meahile bɛ kɛ, bɛ sa ɛha ahatualɛ biala mɔɔ anrɛɛ bɛkɛnyia ye kenle bie la. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Na emomu saa ɛyɛ atiakunlukɛnlɛma wɔamaa awie a, yɛ ye fealera nu, na mmamaa ɛ sa bɛne ne bɔbɔ nwu deɛ mɔɔ ɛ sa fema ne ɛlɛyɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Na ɛ Ze ne mɔɔ ze fealera nu edwɛkɛ biala la badua wɔ kakɛ wɔ nwolɛ wɔ bagua nu.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ nee ɛhɔnehyelɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Mɔɔ fale nzɛlɛlɛ nwo la ɛne. Saa bɛyɛ asɔne a, bɛmmayɛ kɛmɔ mɛlɛbɛlavoma ne mɔ yɛ la, ɔluakɛ, bɛkulo kɛ bɛgyinla awɔlɔne ne mɔ anloa, nee ayiasua ne mɔ anu nee bagua nu bɛsɛlɛ, amaa awie biala ahola anwu bɛ. Nɔhalɛ nu, ɛhye a le ahatualɛ mɔɔ anrɛɛ bɛ sa kɛha ye la. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Na saa ɛyɛ asɔne a, ɛdawɔ ɛ ngomekye fi ɛlɔne ne anu te ɛ nwo, na to ɛ nwo anlenkɛ nu na yɛ wɔ nzɛlɛlɛ ne fealera nu kile ɛ Ze ne mɔɔ ze wɔ fealera nu edwɛkɛ la, na ɛ sa baha wɔ ahatualɛ ne.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7-8" />“Mmafunla nzɛlɛlɛ ko ne ala anu fane dɔɔnwo kɛmɔ maanle gyɛne nu amra mɛlɛbɛlavoma ne mɔ yɛ ye la, ɔluakɛ bɛdwenle kɛ saa bɛsi nzɛlɛlɛ ko ne ala azo fane dɔɔnwo a yɛɛ bɛ sa ka bɛ mualɛ a. Kakye kɛ, ɛ Ze ne ze deɛ mɔɔ ɛhyia nwo la kofee, kolaa na ɛdawɔ mumua ne wɔabiza ye!<verse eid="MAT 6:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />“Ɛhye ati bɛnlea nzɛlɛlɛ ɛhye azo na bɛzɛlɛ: ‘Yɛ Ze mɔɔ wɔ anwuma, yɛyeyɛ wɔ duma nwuanzanwuanza ne. <verse eid="MAT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Yɛsɛlɛ kɛ, wɔ Belemgbunlililɛ ne ɛrɛla. Maa wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ ɛyɛ ɛkɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo, kɛmɔ bɛyɛ ye wɔ anwuma lɔ la. <verse eid="MAT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Maa yɛ ɛnɛ dahuu aleɛ kɛmɔ ɛyɛ ye dahuu biala la, <verse eid="MAT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />na fa yɛ ɛtane kyɛ yɛ, kɛmɔ yɛfa yɛkyɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ ɛtane bɛtia yɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Mmafa yɛ ɛkɔ munzule nu, na ye yɛ fi Munzuvolɛ ne asa anu. Ɔyɛ ɛkɛ.’ <verse eid="MAT 6:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14-15" />Saa ɛfa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfo wɔ la ɛtane ɛkyɛ bɛ a, ɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la ɔdaye noko ɔbava wɔ deɛ ne yeahyɛ wɔ; na saa wɔamkponle bɛ ɛtanefakyɛ deɛ ne azo a ɔdaye noko ɔnrɛva wɔ deɛ ne ɔnrɛhyɛ wɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Mɔɔ fale ɛhɔnehyelɛ nwo la noko ɛne. Saa ɛkye ɛhɔne wɔagyakyi wɔ aleɛ ɔlua sunsum nu gyimalilɛ bie ati a, mmayɛ ye bagua nu kɛmɔ maanle gyɛne nu amra mɛlɛbɛlavoma ne mɔ yɛ ye la, ɔluakɛ bɛmunlomunla bɛ nyunlu, na bɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛyɛ bɛ nwo alɔbɔlɛ alɔbɔlɛ, na eza bɛnziezie bɛ nwo amaa menli ali nyane amaa bɛ. Nɔhalɛ nu, ɛhye a le ahatualɛ ala mɔɔ bɛ sa baha ye kenle bie la. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Na wɔmɔ saa ɛkye ɛhɔne a, siezie ɛ nwo kpalɛ, na wula tɛladeɛ kɛnlɛma, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ammaa awie biala annwu ɛ nzi kɛ ɛlɛkye ɛhɔne, kyesɛ ɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma mɔɔ ze fealera nu edwɛkɛ biala la ala. Na Yemɔ a badua wɔ kakɛ a.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Bɛmmafa agyapandeɛ biala bɛsie azɛlɛ ye azo ɛke mɔɔ nrɛlana nee nlɛtɛba kola sɛkye ye, na nwule noko kola kɔwua la. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Bɛkpondɛ agyapandeɛ ne bɛzie bɛ Anwuma Belemgbunli maanle ne anu na ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ bɛnrɛminli bɛ bolɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle la, na eza bɛ nwo kɛyɛ kɔlɔɔnwo kɛvi awulema asa anu a. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Na saa wɔ nvasoɛ kosooti wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a ɛnee wɔ ahonle ne ɔdaye ɔbawa ɛkɛ ne bie.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Saa ɛ nye zo te wienyi a, wɔ ɛkɛla ne anwo bade saanwu. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Na saa adwenle ɛtane ɛtane nee atiakunluwɔzo ɛtane ɛtane ɛva ɛ nye a, ɛnee ɛde awozinli kabii kpalɛ nu wɔ sunsum nu!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Awie biala ɛngola ɛnzonle menli nwiɔ: Nana Nyamenle nee ezukoa. Ɔluakɛ ɛbahyi ko na wɔahulo ɛhendeɛ ne, anzɛɛ, kɛ ɛbahulo ko na wɔahyi ko ne.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Ɔti me folɛdulɛ a le kɛ: Bɛmmadwenle ninyɛne mɔɔ le kɛ aleɛ, nzule anzɛɛ nza, ezukoa nee ndanlɛ nwo. Ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ bɛlɛ ngoane nee nwonane dɛba, na bɛhyia ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ kpole kpalɛ bɛtɛla aleɛ mɔɔ bɛbali nee ndanlɛ mɔɔ bɛbaheda la. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Bɛnlea anwomanyunlu nloma bɔbɔ! Bɛndwenle aleɛ mɔɔ bɛbali la anwo, bɛngyia kɛ bɛkɛlua anzɛɛ bɛkɛbu anzɛɛ bɛkɛzie aleɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la a maa bɛ aleɛ a. Na bɛmɛ noko bɛ nwo lɛ nvasoɛ kpole kpalɛ wɔ ɔ nye zo tɛla nloma ne mɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Na asoo bɛ adwenledwenle ɛhye mɔ kosooti bava dɔnehwele ko bɔbɔ azɔ bɛ ngoane zo ɔ?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Na duzu ati a ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdwenle bɛ ndanlɛ nwo a? Bɛnlea ɛya nu silikoko ne mɔ bɔbɔ. Bɛndwenle bɛ deɛ ne anwo bɔbɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Noko akee Belemgbunli Sɔlɔmɔn bɔbɔ, wɔ ye anyunlunyia kpole ne anu anziezie ɔ nwo kɛnlɛma nee bɛ anzɛ ɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛ diedi le ekyi a! Saa Nana Nyamenle nea felawɔse bɔbɔ mɔɔ fi ɛnɛ a ɛhyema ɛnee bɛnle ɛkɛ ne bieko la a, ɛnee duzu ati a ɔnrɛhola ɔnrɛnlea bɛdabɛ noko a?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31-32" />“Ɛhye ati bɛmmadwenle aleɛ nee ndanlɛ dɔɔnwo ɛnyianlɛ nwo. Duzu ati a bɛyɛ bɛ nwo kɛ menli mɔɔ ɛnze Nana Nyamenle a? Ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ bɛdi fɛlɛko wɔ ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ anwo na bɛdwenle nwolɛ ɛsesebɛ noko kpalɛ. Na bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la noko ze ye kofee kɛ bɛhyia ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ anwo. <verse eid="MAT 6:31-32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Na saa bɛdumua bɛkpondɛ Ye belemgbunli maanle ne nee Ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne wɔ bɛ ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu, na bɛtɛnla ahomeka nu kɛmɔ ɔkpondɛ kɛ bɛyɛ la a ɔbava ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ amuala yeamaa bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />“Ɛhye ati bɛmmadwenle ɛhyema ɛdeɛ ne anwo, na mɔɔ bazi ɛhyema la wɔ Nyamenle sa nu. Dwenle ɛnɛ angome anwo na gyakyi ɛhyema.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Mmabua ɛ gɔnwo ndɛne, ammaa bɛambua ɛdawɔ noko ndɛne. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Ɔluakɛ kɛ ɛsi ɛbua menli ndɛne la yɛɛ menli babua ɛdawɔ noko ndɛne a. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Na duzu ati a ɛdwenle mumunli mɔɔ la ɛ diema bie anye zo la anwo wɔ melɛ mɔɔ dosinli la wɔ deɛ mumua ne azo a? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ɛkɛha kɛ, ‘Agɔnwolɛ, maa memboa wɔ memaa ɛye mumunli ne mɔɔ la ɛ nye ne azo la,’ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɔlua dosinli ne mɔɔ la ɛ nye zo la ati ɛnnwu aze la ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Wɔmɔ adalɛ nabalabanli! Dumua ye dosinli ne mɔɔ la wɔ deɛ ne azo la kolaa na saa ɛnwu aze a wɔaboa ɛ diema ne.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Bɛmmafa ninyɛne mɔɔ anwo te la bɛmaa ahwea. Bɛmmafuandi bɛ anwonyiandeɛ bɛgua agbolike nyunlu ammaa bɛanva bɛ gyakɛ bɛantietia zolɛ na eza bɛanzia bɛamba bɛ nwo zo.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Bɛbiza, na bɛbava mɔɔ bɛbiza la bɛamaa bɛ. Bɛkpondɛ, na bɛbanwu ye. Bɛbɔ nu, na bɛbabuke bɛ anlenkɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ɔluakɛ awie biala mɔɔ biza la, asa ka ye. Awie biala mɔɔ kpondɛ la, nwu ye. Ɔti saa bɛkɛbɔ nu ɛdeɛ a, anlenkɛ ne noko babuke amaa bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Saa kakula biza ɔ ze kpanwo dolɔfo ko a, ɔbava bolɛ yeamaa ye anzɛɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Saa ɔbiza fɛlɛ a, ɔbava ɛwɔlɛ ayidane a yeamaa ye anzɛɛ? Kyɛkyɛ! <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Na saa bɛmɛ menli ahonle ɛsesebɛvoma, ɛtaneyɛvoma bɔbɔ ze kɛ bɛsi bɛfa ahyɛlɛndeɛ kpalɛ bɛmaa bɛ mra a, ɛnee duzu ati a bɛ Ze mɔɔ wɔ Anwuma la amgba ala ɛnrɛva ahyɛlɛndeɛ kpalɛ ne ɛnrɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbiza bɛfi ye lɔ la ɛ?<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Yɛ mɔɔ ɛkulo kɛ menli yɛ maa wɔ la maa bɛdabɛ noko. Ɛhye a le Mosisi mɛla ne nee ngapezoma ne mɔ ngilehilenu ne sikalɛ a.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anwuma belemgbunli maanle adenle ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Adenle ɛdenraa bie anu a bɛdua nu bɛkɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a. Adenle ne mɔɔ kɔ Abɔnsam sua zo la le kpolomgbolo zɛhae, yɛɛ ye anlenkɛ ne noko le wanaanwo kpalɛ maa ɛlɔne pemgbenlamgbe ne mɔɔ kɛva zɛhae adenle ne mɔɔ nuhua ɛvalɛ ɛnyɛ se la anu. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Emomu Ngoane Adenle anlenkɛ ɛdeɛ ne le ekyi, yɛɛ ye adenle ne le feɔɔ, na menli ekyi bie ala a kola nwu zɛhae adenle ne a.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ wɔ ahilehilevolɛ adalɛma mɔɔ bɛfa mboane nwoma bɛkpolo, noko akee bɛle mbedi, na bɛkɛtete bɛ nu nzokɛnzoka la anwo. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Bɛbahola bɛava bɛ nyɛleɛ ne mɔ bɛanwu bɛ sonla holɛ, kɛmɔ bɛkola bɛfa baka ma bɛnwu ye baka holɛ ko la pɛ, ɔluakɛ kukue ɛngola ɛnzo amango ma ɛmmaa ɔnyɛ boɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Bɛnea ma ne mɔ mɔɔ mbaka ngakyile ne mɔ so la azo a bɛkola bɛnwu bɛ mbaka holɛ ko ndɛndɛ a. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Baka mɔɔ so ma menlemenle la ɛnzo ma ɛnwonle ɛlɛ. Yɛɛ baka mɔɔ so ma ɛnwonle la noko ɛngola ɛnzo ma mɔɔ le kpalɛ la.<verse eid="MAT 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />“Ɔti mbaka biala mɔɔ bɛnzo ma kpalɛ la bɛpepɛ bɛ bɛgua, na bɛfuandi bɛ bɛgua senle nu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Ɛhɛe, adenle mɔɔ yɛdua nu yɛnwu baka anzɛɛ sonla ye sonla holɛ la a le ye ma ne mɔɔ ɔkɛzo la.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Tɛ menli ne amuala mɔɔ bɛyɛ bɛ nwo Nyamezonlenlɛma la a amgba kile kɛ bɛle Nyamenle menli a. Bɛbahola bɛavɛlɛ me kɛ ‘Awulae’, noko akee bɛnrɛdwu Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu, kyesɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ Egya mɔɔ wɔ Anwuma la ɛhulolɛdeɛ ne la. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ mekɛ ne, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala baze me kɛ ‘Awulae, Awulae, yɛhanle ɛ nwo edwɛkɛ yɛhilele menli ne bie, na yɛluale wɔ duma nu yɛdule sunsum ɛtane na eza yɛyɛle nwanwanendeɛ mgbole dɔɔnwo.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Na mebaze bɛ kɛ, ‘Menze bɛ bɔbɔ. Bɛvi me nwo ɛke bɛhɔ, ɔluakɛ bɛ nyɛleɛ muala le evinli anzɛɛ ɛtane ngome’.<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtie me edwɛkɛ na bɛdi zo na bɛtoa me la ze nrɛlɛbɛ kɛ nrenyia mɔɔ si ye sua wɔ bolɛ ketekete zo la. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ɔle zɔ kɛ ezule ne tɔ bilididi, na azundenle ɛyiyilɛ ba, na ahumu tu bɔ sua ne ɛdeɛ, noko akee ɔmbu ɔngua aze ɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛzile ye wɔ bolɛ ketekete zo.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛte me edwɛkɛ ne na bɛnva la le ahoasea, kɛ nrenyia mɔɔ si ye sua wɔ ɛnwea nu la. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ɔluakɛ saa fɔsɛlɛ ne nee nzuyilɛ ne ba, na ahumu noko tu bɔ sua ne a ɔbabu yeagua aze gulogɔlɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Gyisɛse Ye Nyamedwɛkɛ ɛhanlɛ ne yɛle menli dɔɔnwo ne ala azibɛnwo, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />ɔluakɛ ɔhilehilele kɛ awie bie mɔɔ lɛ tumi kpole bie la, na ɔnle kɛ bɛ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ la.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛyɛ ewule ngakyile ayile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Menli ekpunli ekpunli dɔɔnwo bie lile Gyisɛse anzi wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔvi boka ne azo foa ko ɔdwu aze la.<verse eid="MAT 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Na nea! Kokobɛvolɛ bie yiale ye na ɔhotole ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ, na ɔzonlenle ye. Kokobɛvolɛ ne bodole ye na ɔzele kɛ, “Awulae, saa ɛkulo a, ɛbahola wɔamaa me nwo aza.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Gyisɛse dendenle ɔ sa zɔle nrenyia ne na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Mekulo, te kpɔkɛ.” Na ɛkɛ ne ala, ye kokobɛ ne minlinle minlimenla bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Mmagyinla adenle nu ɛtendɛ ɛkile awie biala; kɔ ndɛndɛ ne ala kɔnwu sɛlɛvolɛ maa ɔnlea wɔ; na fa azubɔdeɛ ne mɔɔ Mosisi mɛla ne ka mɔɔ fale kokobɛvolɛma mɔɔ kɛde kpɔkɛ la anwo la, ɔluakɛ ɛhye yɛɛ le bagua nu daselɛlilɛ mɔɔ wɔ kpɔkɛdelɛ ne anwo a.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5-6" />Mekɛ mɔɔ Gyisɛse dwule Kapɛnayɛm la, sogya kpanyinli bie rale na ɔrazɛlɛle ye kɛ ɔ nee ye ɛhɔ ye sua nu na ɔhɔyɛ ye sonvolɛ nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛbubu ɛgua ɛkpa zo na anwofofolɛ ɛbɔ ye kpɔkɛ twe la ayile.<verse eid="MAT 8:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Gyisɛse kponlenle zo na ɔzele kɛ, “Wioo, mebara mearayɛ ye ayile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8-9" />Na sogya kpanyinli ne zele kɛ “Yɛmenle, menfɛta kɛ ɛkɛra me sua nu; yɛɛ ɔngyia kɛ ɛkɛra bɔbɔ. Saa ɛbagyinla ɛke bɔbɔ ala na wɔaha kɛ, ‘Te kpɔkɛ’ a, anrɛɛ me sonvolɛ ne anwo baza! Meze, ɔboalekɛ mele sonla mɔɔ melɛ tumi na mesie menli a, na saa mese ko kɛ, ‘Kɔ’ a, ɛnee yehɔ; yɛɛ mese bieko noko kɛ ‘Bɛla’ a ɛnee yera; na saa mese me akɛlɛ noko kɛ ‘Yɛ ɛhye anzɛɛ ɛyeka’ a, ɔyɛ. Ɔti meze kɛ ɛlɛ tumi mɔɔ ɛkola ɛka ɛkile ye anwodolɛ ne kɛ ɔhɔ a, ɔkɛhɔ a!” <verse eid="MAT 8:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Gyisɛse dele ɛhye la ɔyɛle ye azibɛnwo! Ɔhakyile ɔ nye wɔ menli ekpunli dɔɔnwo ne anwo na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, metɛnwunle diedi mɔɔ le zɛhae la bie ɛlɛ wɔ Yizilayɛ maanle ye anu!<verse eid="MAT 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />“Na mese bɛ kɛ, menli mɔɔ ɛmboka Dwuuma ekpunli ne anwo la dɔɔnwo mɔɔ le kɛ sogya kpanyinli ɛhye la vi ewiade anu ɛleka biala bara na bɛ nee Ebileham, Ayezeke nee Gyekɔbo adɛnla aze wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Na Yizilayɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛzieziele belemgbunli maanle ne bɛmaanle bɛ la, bɛbavuandi bɛ bɛagua alie nwo awozinli kpole ne anu wɔ ɛleka ne mɔɔ ɛzunlɛ nee awolɛyelɛ nee nyanelilɛ wɔ la.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Akee Gyisɛse zele sogya kpanyinli ne kɛ, “Kɔ. Wɔ diedi ne mɔɔ ɛnyianle ye la ɛyɛ zɔ!” Na kakula nrenyia ne anwo zale wɔ dɔnehwele ko ne ala anu.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse dwule Pita sua nu la, ɛnee ɛyɛlɛyɛlɛ ɛhye Pita azebɛla na ɔla ɛkpa zo. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse zɔle ɔ sa la, ɛyɛlɛyɛlɛ ne vile ɔ nwo; na akee ɔdwazole foa ɔdonle aleɛ ɔmaanle bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nɔsolɛ ko ne ala bɛvale menli dɔɔnwo mɔɔ awozonle ɛva bɛ la bɛrɛlɛle Gyisɛse; na mɔɔ ɔbukele ɔ nloa ɔhanle edwɛkɛ kpɔkɛ ko ala la, awozonle ne mɔ amuala minlinle; na wuliravolɛma ne mɔ amuala anwo zale. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ɛhye maanle Ayezaya kapezonli ne edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle la yɛle zɔ, kɛ “Yemɔ a ɔvale yɛ anwodolɛ anwodolɛ ne mɔ na ɔzoale yɛ ewule ewule ne mɔ a.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azule tandane ne foa ko nee ye foa ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle kɛsi mɔɔ menli ne ɛlɛsi azo dɔɔnwo la, ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛboɔboa bɛ nwo bɛmaa bɛpɛ tandane ne bɛhɔ ɔ nzi nehane.<verse eid="MAT 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala, Dwuuma Nyamedwɛkɛ kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ ko zele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, mebadoa wɔ me nee wɔ ahɔ ɛleka biala mɔɔ ɛbahɔ la!”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Nane ɛzonlɛ lɛ ye tunli, yɛɛ nloma noko lɛ bɛ sane, na mame Sonla Ra ne ɛdeɛ, menlɛ me ti anwo aako biala, menlɛ ɛleka mɔɔ meto me ti a.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko noko hanle kɛ, “Awulae, maa menumua mengɔnzie me ze kolaa na mearadoa wɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Na Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Toa me kɛkala! Maa sunsum nu mɔwuamra ɛzie bɛdabɛ bɛ avunli.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Na ɔvole ɛlɛne nu na ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛpɛ tandane ne. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Na arɛlevilɛ nu ala, ahumu ɛzulolɛ bie dule wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɛnee Gyisɛse ɛla la; na tandane ne bule azɛlɛkye mgbole bie mɔɔ hedale ɛlɛne ne anwo zo a.<verse eid="MAT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hɔle ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na bɛdunwuele ye; bɛdeanle nu bɛzele ye kɛ, “Awulae, die yɛ! Yɛlɛnoma!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Na Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “O bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛ diedi le ekyi a! Duzu ati a ɛzulolɛ ɛha bɛ zɛhae a?” Na ɔdwazole na ɔdeanle anwoma ne nee azɛlɛkye ne mɔ, na ahumu ne gyakyile ɛdulɛ na akee bɛ muala bɛyɛle dii. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Azibɛnwo kpole hanle ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ, na bɛbizale bɛ nwo kɛ, “Nwane a le ɛhye, mɔɔ anwoma bɔbɔ nee nyevile tie ye a?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule tandane ne anzi nehane, wɔ Gadala maanle nu la, mrenyia nwiɔ bie mɔɔ sunsum evinli wɔ bɛ nu la yiale ye. Mrenyia nwiɔ ɛhye mɔ de azie zo na ɔlua bɛ nwo ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ ɔyɛ la ati awie biala ɛngola bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne ɛleka ne kɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛteɛdea nu bɛagua Gyisɛse anwo zo. Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu debie a ɛkpondɛ wɔavi yɛ ɛkɛ a, O Nyamenle Ra? Wɔra kɛ ɛbagyegye yɛ ɔ? Ɛnlɛ tumi biala kɛ ɛkɛgyegye yɛ kɛkala.”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Agbolike kpolane bie noko ɛnee wɔ adidi wɔ foa ko nehane, <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />ɛhye ati sunsum evinli ne mɔ kpale Gyisɛse kyɛlɛ kɛ, “Saa ɛtu yɛ a, fa yɛ kɔ agbolike kpolane ne anu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Gyisɛse kponlenle zolɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Wioo! Bɛhɔ!” Na bɛvile mrenyia nwiɔ ne mɔ nu na bɛrawolole agbolike ne mɔ anu, na agbolike kpolane ne mɔ dule twi bɛwulule pemgbɛne ne na bɛguale nyevile ne anu bɛwule. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Agbolike neazovolɛma ne mɔ dule hɔle suakpole ne mɔɔ zua bɛ la azo na bɛvale edwɛkɛ mɔɔ zile la bɛbɔle bɛ amaneɛ, <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />na ezuavolɛ ne kosooti nriandinle ranleanle Gyisɛse, na bɛkpale ye kyɛlɛ kɛ ɔhɔ ye ɛleka bie na ɔgyakyi bɛ koonwu.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Me azɛlɛ ye azo gyima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Ɔti Gyisɛse vole ɛlɛne nu na bɛpɛle tandane ne bɛhɔle Kapɛnayɛm, mɔɔ le ɔdaye ye sua zo la.<verse eid="MAT 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Na yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ mrenyia bie vale kakula nrenyia bie mɔɔ ɛbubu la ɛkpa zo la rɛlɛle ye a. Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle bɛ diedi ne la, ɔzele kakula nrenyia wuliravolɛ ne kɛ, “Bɔzɔ ɛ nwo, me ra nrenyia. Ɔluakɛ bɛva wɔ ɛtane bɛhyɛ wɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Na Asɔne mgbanyima ne bie mɔ deanle nu zele bɛ nwo kɛ, “Munzusɛm! Nrenyia ɛhye ɛleka kɛ ɔle Nyamenle!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Gyisɛse ze deɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛlɛdwenle nwolɛ a, yemɔti ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛlɛdwenle adwenle ɛtane ɛhye ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Mame Ngoanedievolɛ ne, melɛ tumi wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo kɛ mefa ɛtane mekyɛ.” Na mebiza bɛ kɛ: ɛtanefakyɛ ne ɛhanlɛ ye se tɛla ayileyɛle ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Amaa yeahile kɛ ɔlɛ tumi ɔfa ɛtane ɔkyɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la, ɔhakyile ɔ nye ɔnleanle kakula nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛbubu la na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Dwazo foa, nyenya wɔ ɛkpa ne na kɔ, ɔluakɛ ɛ nwo ɛza!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Na kakula nrenyia ne dwazole foa na ɔhɔle.<verse eid="MAT 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Mɔɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne nwunle ɛhye bɛ nye zo la ɛzulolɛ hanle bɛ na bɛyele Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ kpole kpalɛ kɛ yeva tumi zɛhae yemaa sonla dasanli a!<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse dɔle adenle zo kɛ ɔkɔ ɔ nyunlu la, ɔnwunle Mateyu, adwuledievolɛ ne, kɛ ɔde adwulelielɛ kpɔda bo. Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Bɛla na bayɛ me ɛdoavolɛ.” Na amgba noko Mateyu dwazole ɔdoale ye, na ɔ nee ye bɛhɔle.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Nzinlii mɔɔ Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɛkpula bɛ sa wɔ Mateyu sua nu la, adwuledievolɛma nee ɛtanevolɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala noko rale ɛkɛ ne bie kɛ asɛɛ bɛle nyɛvolɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Na Falasiima ne mɔ nyianle ɛya na bɛbizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛ kilehilevolɛ ne fa ɔ nwo bɔnlebɔnle menli mɔɔ le kɛ ɛhye mɔ la anwo a?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛte kpɔkɛ la ɛngyia dɔketa nwo! Na emomu wuliravolɛma yɛɛ ahyia ɔ nwo a!” <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Na ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ, “Akee bɛhɔ na bɛhɔzukoa edwɛkɛ kpɔkɛ ɛhye mɔɔ vi Buluku Nwuanzanwuanza ne anu la. ‘Tɛ bɛ azubɔndeɛ ne mɔ nee bɛ ahyɛlɛndeɛ ne mɔ a mekpondɛ a, emomu anwunvɔne mɔɔ bɛse la ɔ.’ Ɔluakɛ mera kɛ meba mearavɛlɛ ɛtaneyɛvoma, tɛ tenlenema, meamaa bɛazia bɛ nzi bɛanwu Nana Nyamenle.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Kenle ko Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛngye ɛhɔne kɛmɔ yɛ nee Falasiima ne mɔ yɛyɛ ye la ɛ?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Na Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne agɔnwo mɔ kɛli nyane na bɛkɛhye ɛhɔne wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔ nee bɛ de la ɔ? Na mese bɛ kɛ, mekɛ ne ɛlɛba mɔɔ medame mumua ne bɛbaye me bɛavi bɛ avinli a. Na mekɛ ɛhye anu a le melɛ mɔɔ akee bɛbakpo aleɛ a.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Na nwane ala a bava fuazinli ada ɛdanlɛ fofolɛ nu a? Ɔluakɛ, ɛleka mɔɔ bɛda la bade ahɔ amaa tokule ne ayɛ haanwu kpole. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Na nwane a bava nwanye fofolɛ agua nwanye kodoku dɛba nu a? Kodoku dɛba ne bakpuke ɔlua nwanye ne anu ɛsesebɛ mɔɔ ɔyɛ la ati, na nwanye ne noko agua aze ayɛ mgbane. Nwanye kodoku fofolɛ ngome ala a bɛfa nwanye fofolɛ bɛgua nu a; amaa nwanye ne nee kodoku ne amu nwiɔ anzɛkye.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Na mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo mɔɔ ɔlɛka ɛhye la, maanzinli ne anu ayialeka kilehilevolɛ ne rale na ɔrahotole ɔ nyunlu ɔzele kɛ, “Me ra raalɛ ekyi ne ɛwu kɛkala, na saa ɛba ɛbafa ɛ sa ɛka ye mgbane bɔbɔ a ɔbazia yeara ngoane nu bieko.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɛkɔ kilehilevolɛ ne sua nu la, <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20-21" />raalɛ bie mɔɔ mogya ɛdu ye dedee ɛvolɛ bulu nee nwiɔ la bikyele ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔzɔle ye tɛladeɛ ne anloa, ɔluakɛ ɔdwenlenle kɛ, “Saa me sa sɔ ye nu ala mgbane bɔbɔ a me nwo baza.”<verse eid="MAT 9:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Gyisɛse hakyile ɔ nye nleanle ye na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Me ra raalɛ, ɔ muala le kpalɛ! Wɔ diedi ɛyɛ wɔ ayile.” Na ɔvi zɔhane mekɛ ne anu raalɛ ne anwo zale bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse dwule kilehilevolɛ ne sua nu na ɔnwunle menli anwo alɛra ne, na eza ɔdele bɛ awolɛyelɛ nee bɛ agole edwɛne ne la, ɔzele kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />“Bɛha bɛ bɛvinde, ɔluakɛ kakula raalɛ ne ɛtɛwule; na ɔlɛda ala!” Na bɛ muala bɛzile ye amgbu, na bɛzelele ye!<verse eid="MAT 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Mɔɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne akee vindele alie nwo la, Gyisɛse wolole ekpumgbunli ne mɔɔ kakula raalɛ ekyi ne la nu la anu na ɔzɔle ɔ sa ɔmaanle ye zo, na kakula raalɛ ne wulule kyela, ɔgyinlanle na ɔyɛle ye kɛ ye dɛba ne ala la! <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Nwanwanedeɛ ɛhye anwo edwɛkɛ kpondenle hɔle ɛkɛ ne maanzinli ne anu ɛleka biala. <verse eid="MAT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse vile kakula ne sua nu la, anyezinliravolɛma nwiɔ bie lile ɔ nzi, na bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “O Devidi Ara, nwu yɛ anwunvɔne.”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Bɛhɔle sua ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse de nu la anu, na Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo bɛdie bɛdi kɛ mebahola meamaa bɛanwu debie ɔ?” Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, Awulae, yɛdie yɛdi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Akee ɔvale ɔ sa ɔhanle bɛ nye ne mɔ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “ɔlua bɛ diedi ne ati ɔbayɛ ɛkɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala bɛ nye ne mɔ bukebukele. Gyisɛse bɔle bɛ kɔkɔ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ kɛ bɛmmaka bɛkile awie biala, <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />noko akee bɛanli zo na bɛvale ye dumalielɛ ne bɛkpondenle sua ne azo ɛleka biala.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Gyisɛse vile ɛkɛ ne la ɔ nee nrenyia bie mɔɔ bozonle wɔ ye nu na ɔlua ɛhye ati ɔngola tendɛ la yiale. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Gyisɛse dule bozonle ne mɔɔ wɔ ye nu la, na ɛkɛ ne ala ɔholale tendɛ. Ɔyɛle menli dɔɔnwo ne ala azibɛnwo totohyia! Na bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛtɛnwunle nwanwanedeɛ mɔɔ le zɛhae la bie ɛlɛ wɔ Yizilayɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Na Falasiima ne zele kɛ, “Ɔdaye mumua ne ɔdua abɔnsam tumi nu a ɔkola ɔtu awozonle a.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyimayɛvoma Mɔɔ ɔhyianle bɛ nwo, na ɔvɛlɛle bɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Gyisɛse kpɔsale azua mgbole nee namunamu mɔɔ wɔ maanle ne anu la amuala azo na ɔhilehilele debie wɔ Dwuuma ayialeka ne mɔ na ɔlale Edwɛkpa ne mɔɔ fale Belemgbunli maanle ne anwo la ali. Na ɛleka biala noko mɔɔ ɔhɔle la ɔyɛle menli mɔɔ ɛlɛwu ewule ngakyile ngakyile la ayile. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Na ɔlile menli ne mɔ anwo nyane kpole kpalɛ, ɔboalekɛ, bɛ ngyianlɛdeɛ ne mɔ zonle, na eza bɛnze mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛyɛ anzɛɛ ɛleka mɔɔ bɛto bɛ ti bɛakpondɛ moalɛ bie a. Bɛyɛle kɛ mboane mɔɔ bɛnlɛ boaneneavolɛ la.<verse eid="MAT 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37-38" />Akee ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Egyinli ne anu aleɛbulɛ gyima ne le kpole, na gyimayɛvoma ne mɔ noko le ekyi. Ɛhye ati bɛzɛlɛ Awulae, mɔɔ le egyinli menle ne la bɛmaa ɔva gyimayɛvoma dɔɔnwo wɔ ye egyinli ne mɔ anu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:37-38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Gyisɛse vɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne ɔ nwo ɛkɛ, na ɔmaanle bɛ tumi kɛ bɛva bɛdu sunsum evinli evinli, na eza bɛyɛ anwodolɛ nee ewule biala ayile.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Gyisɛse ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne mɔ anluma ɛne: Saemɔn mɔɔ ɔdaye ko ye ala bɛfɛlɛ ye Pita la, Andelu mɔɔ le Pita adiema nrenyia ne la, Gyemise mɔɔ le Zɛbɛdi ara nrenyia ne la.<verse eid="MAT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Felepe, Baatɔlomiyu, Tɔmase, Mateyu adwuledievolɛ ne, Gyemise mɔɔ le Alefiyɛse ara nrenyia ne la, Tadease, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Saemɔn mɔɔ boka Dwuuma maamɔvo maanyɛlɛ fane ne anwo la, yɛɛ Dwudase Yesekaleɔto mɔɔ ɔyele ye ɔmaanle la.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdoavolɛma mɛla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Gyisɛse zoanle bɛ na ɔhyɛle bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmakɔ maanle gyɛne nu amra anzɛɛ Samɛleama ne mɔ lɔ, <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />na emomu, bɛhɔ Nyamenle mboane ne mɔɔ bɛminli la, Yizilayɛma ne mɔ angomekye anwo zo. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Bɛhɔ bɛhɔbɔ ye nolo bɛhile bɛ kɛ Anwuma Belemgbunli maanle ne ɛralɛ ne ɛbikye. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Bɛyɛ wuliravolɛma ayile, bɛdunwue mɔwuamra anzɛɛ avunli, bɛyɛ kokobɛvolɛma ayile, na bɛdu sunsum evinli evinli noko. Kɛmɔ bɛanva ezukoa bɛandɔ tumi ne la, zɔhane ala noko a saa bɛyɛ awie ayile a bɛmmadie ye ezukoa a.<verse eid="MAT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />“Bɛmmafa ezukoa biala bɛsie bɛ nwo; <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />bɛmmafa bɔlɛ biala mɔɔ bɛbava ɛdanlɛ bieko nee mgbɔlaboa bɛagua nu la bɛdɛ bɛ sa nu, anzɛɛ kpɔma bɔbɔ bɛdɛ bɛ sa nu; ɔluakɛ, menli mɔɔ bɛbaboa bɛ la bamaa bɛ aleɛ na bɛanlea bɛ gyɛlɛɛnye. <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Mekɛ biala mɔɔ bɛkɛdwu sua koatee zo anzɛɛ namule zo la bɛkpondɛ sonla mɔɔ Nyamezonlenlɛ wɔ ye nu la sua nu bɛdɛnla kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛvi ɛkɛ ne bɛkɛhɔ sua gyɛne zo la. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Saa bɛsɛlɛ adenle kɛ bɛ nee ahenle ne tɛnla a bɛyɛ agɔnwolɛ, <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />na saa bɛnwu kɛ aako ne le aako mɔɔ Nyamezulolɛ wɔ nu a, bɛyila ye; na saa tɛ ye zɔhane ɛdeɛ a, yemɔ bɛmmafa bɛ nyilalɛ ne bɛmaa ye; bɛye bɛzie. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Sua koatee biala anzɛɛ aako biala mɔɔ anlie bɛ awawatuu la, bɛkpokpo ɛkɛ ne munlutu ne bɛvi bɛ gyakɛ anwo kolaa na bɛavi ɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nɔhalɛ, amumuyɛ azua mgbole ɛhye mɔ, Sodɔm nee Gomɔla banyia ye boɛ wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ Mekɛ ne anu adɛla bɛ bɔbɔ.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Melɛsoa bɛ kɛ mboane mɔɔ wɔ mbedi avinli la. Bɛyɛ bɛ nye gyɛlɛmgbɛɛnye kɛ nwɔlɛ la, bɛmmayɛ gyegyeravoma, na bɛyɛ kɛ abubule la. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Emomu bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ! Ɔluakɛ bɛbahye bɛ na bɛali bɛ edwɛkɛ, na bɛabila bɛ empele wɔ ayialeka ne mɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Ɛhɛe, ɔlua me ti bɛbali bɛ edwɛkɛ wɔ amɛnladoma nee arelemgbunli anyunlu. Na ɛhye a bamaa bɛanyia adenle bɛaha me nwo edwɛkɛ bɛahile bɛ a, ɛhɛe, bɛbali daselɛ bɛahile ewiade amra.<verse eid="MAT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />“Saa bɛkye bɛ a bɛmmadwenle edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛbaha ye wɔ bɛ edwɛkɛlilɛ ne anu la, ɔluakɛ, mekɛ kpalɛ mumua ne dwu a bɛbava edwɛkɛ tagyee ne bɛamaa bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Ɔluakɛ tɛ bɛmɛ yɛɛ bɛbadendɛ a, bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la Ye Sunsum ne a balua bɛ nwo zo adendɛ a!<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Adiema baye adiema amaa yeahɔ ewule nu, na selɛma baye bɛdabɛ bɛ kunlu mralɛ bɛamaa. Na mbɛda badwazo bɛ awovolɛma anwo zo na bɛanlea bɛamaa bɛahu bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Awie biala bakpɔ bɛ wɔ me duma ti. Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛhola Sɔnea ɛhye mɔ anloa gyinla kpundii too kɔkpula awieleɛ mekɛ ne la bɛbalie bɛ ngoane.<verse eid="MAT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />“Saa bɛyɛ bɛ ayɛkayɛkadeɛ wɔ sua ko azo a, bɛvi ɛke ne bɛhɔ fofolɛ zo! Mebazia meara kolaa na bɛadwu bɛ kosooti bɛ nwo zo! <verse eid="MAT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Sukoavo ɛndɛla ye kilehilevolɛ ne. Akɛlɛ noko ɛndɛla ɔ menle kpole. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Akɛlɛ ne ɔdaye ɔnyia ɔ menle deɛ ne bie. Na saa bɛvɛlɛ medame mumua ne Gyisɛse mɔɔ mele aako menle ne la ‘Abɔnsam’ a, ɛnee akee bɛmɛ bɔbɔ ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Noko akee bɛmmasulo menli mɔɔ bɛnwunlowunla bɛ na bɛbɔ bɛ apo la. Ɔluakɛ mekɛ ne ɛlɛba mɔɔ nɔhalɛ ne bala ali a, na bɛ fealera nu maamɔvo ɛbɛla ne mɔ bala ali wɔ bagua nu.<verse eid="MAT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />“Mɔɔ meka mekile bɛ wɔ awozinli nu la, bɛbɔ ye nolo wɔ alehyenlɛ anzɛɛ wienyi nu. Yɛɛ mɔɔ bɛte ye bɛ nzo nu noko la, bɛbɔ ye nolo bɛvi azua ti zo!<verse eid="MAT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />“Bɛmmasulo menli mɔɔ kola ku bɛ sonla baka ne mɔ, na bɛngola bɛnva bɛ sa bɛnga bɛ ɛkɛla ne mɔ la. Sulo Nana Nyamenle angomekye, mɔɔ yemɔ a ɔkola ɔsɛkye ɛkɛla ne nee sonla baka ne wɔ abɔnsam senle ne anu la. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Kɛsanloma ko bɔbɔ ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛdɔ aze wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛ Ze ne ɛnze nwolɛ bie la. Na bɛto bolɛ ɛzɛ? Tɛ nwiɔ kapɛle ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Na bɛ ti enrinli ne mɔ bɔbɔ bɛdia ɔ muala. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ɛhye ati bɛmmasulo! Ɔluakɛ, bɛsonle bolɛ kpole kpalɛ bɛmaa ye bɛtɛla kɛsanloma dɔɔnwo ne ala.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Saa awie biala kile ye bagua nu kɛ ɔ gɔnwo a le me a, medame noko wienyi nu ala a mebahile kɛ ɔle me gɔnwo wɔ Egya anyunlu wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Na saa awie bagua nu ala se kɛ ɔnze me a, medame noko mebaze kɛ menze ye wɔ Egya anyunlu wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Bɛmmasuzu kɛ membale kɛ mebava anzondwolɛ meara azɛlɛ ye azo! Kyɛkyɛ, na emomu, adabɛlaka ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Mera kɛ mebamaa ralɛ nrenyia adwazo atia ɔ ze, na ralɛ raalɛ adwazo atia ɔ nli, na ralɛ nrenyia aye adwazo atia ɔ zebɛla. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Sonla ye kpɔvolɛma titili bayɛ ye aako nu amra. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Saa bɛkulo bɛ ze nee bɛ nli bɛtɛla me ɛhulolɛ deɛ a, ɛnee bɛmfɛta kɛ bɛkɛyɛ me deɛ; anzɛɛ saa ɛkulo ɛ ra nrenyia anzɛɛ ɛ ra raalɛ ɛtɛla me a ɛnee ɛmfɛta kɛ ɛkɛyɛ me deɛ a. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Saa bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛva bɛ meanubaka ne na bɛkɛdoa me a, ɛnee bɛmfɛta kɛ bɛkɛyɛ me deɛ.<verse eid="MAT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />“Saa ɛpele kɛ ɛkɛlie wɔ ngoane a ɛbaminli ye; na saa ɛfa ɛwula me sa a, ɛ sa kɛha wɔ ngoane ne.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Mɔɔ die bɛ awawatuu la die medame noko. Yɛɛ saa bɛdie me a ɛnee bɛdie Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ zoanle me la. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Saa bɛdie kapezonli kɛmɔ ɔle Nana Nyamenle sonla la ati a, bɛbanyia ahatualɛ ko ne ala mɔɔ kapezonli ne banyia ye la bie. Yɛɛ saa ɛdie atiakunlukɛnlɛmayɛvoma nee tenlenema ɔlua bɛ atiakunlukɛnlɛmayɛlɛ ne nee bɛ tenleneyɛlɛ ti a, ɛbanyia bɛ ahatualɛ ko ne ala bie.<verse eid="MAT 10:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />“Yɛɛ saa biala mɔɔ kɛmaa ngakula ngyikyi ngyikyi ɛhye mɔ anu ko nzule weɛlɛkɔkɔ kɔpo ko bɔbɔ wɔ sukoavo duma nu la, nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, ɔnreminli ye ahatualɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse wiele mɛla ɛhye mɔ fa maa ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne mɔ la, ɔhɔle azua mgbole ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛvale bɛziele bɛ nyunlu kɛ bɛkɔ zo la azo na ɔhanle Nyamenle edwɛke ne.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse maanle Dwɔn akɛnrazilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ, mɔɔ ɛnee la efiade la, dele Ngoanedievolɛ ne nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔlɛyɛ la amuala, ɔti ɔzoanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɔmaanle bɛrabizale Gyisɛse kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />“Amgba ala wɔmɔ a le ahenle ko ne mɔɔ yɛlɛkendɛ ye la ɔ, anzɛɛ yɛhɔ zo yɛnlea ahenle ne adenle ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛzia bɛ nzi bɛhɔha bɛhile Dwɔn wɔ nwanwane ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ bɛdabɛ bɛnwu ye kɛ melɛyɛ la <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />anyezinliravolɛma mɔɔ meyɛ bɛ ayile, ɔ nee abuburavolɛma mɔɔ ɛnɛ bɛkola tia mɔɔ bɛnva kpɔma la, nee kokobɛvolɛma mɔɔ bɛ nwo ɛza, nee anzodiliravolɛma mɔɔ bɛde edwɛkɛ, ɔ nee mɔwuamra mɔɔ medunwue bɛ memaa bɛra ngoane nu; na bɛha Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ mehilehile ehyiavolɛma na bɛde la bɛboka nwo. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Bɛva nrɛlaleɛ ɛhye bɛmaa ye kɛ: ‘Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie me bɛdi la.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Na nzinlii mɔɔ Dwɔn ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hɔle la, Gyisɛse bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔka Dwɔn anwo edwɛkɛ yeahile menli dɔɔnwo ne. “Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛvindele bɛhɔle kɛ bɛkanlea Dwɔn wɔ ɛsɛlɛ ne azo la, duzu a bɛ adwenle zele bɛ kɛ ɔkɛzɔho ye a? Ɛhonle mɔɔ anwoma ɛlɛbɔ ye amaa yeadeda la anzɛɛ? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Na duzu ati bɔbɔ yɛɛ bɛvindele a, kɛ bɛkanlea sonla mɔɔ heda selekye la anzɛɛ? Nea, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛheda selekye la wɔ suakunlu. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ɛnee duzu ati bɔbɔ a bɛhɔle a? Kɛ bɛkanlea Awulae Nyamenle kapezonli anzɛɛ? Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ ɔle kpole ɔtɛla kapezonli bɔbɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ɔluakɛ, Dwɔn a le nrenyia ne mɔɔ bɛha ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ dɛba wɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ Buluku ne anu a, ɛzoavolɛ mɔɔ balumua me nyunlu, na yeabɔ me maleɛ ne anwo nolo, na yeaziezie adenle ne anu yeamaa bɛalie me la.<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />“Nɔhalɛ nu, menli mɔɔ bɛwo bɛ la amuala ko bɔbɔ ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ le kpole tɛla Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne a. Noko akee Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu akɛlɛ bɔbɔ le kpole tɛla yemɔ! <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Na ɔvi mekɛ ne mɔɔ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne bɔle Nyamedwɛkɛ ɛhanlɛ nee menli ɛzɔnenlɛ bo mɔɔ ɛrakpula ɛnɛ la, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala anye ɛbolo kɛ bɛbikye Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne, <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />ɔluakɛ mɛla ne nee ngapezoma ne mɔ, amuala anye la Ngoanedievolɛ ne ade. Na akee Dwɔn yele ɔ nyunlu, <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />na saa bɛdie bɛto nu a ɛnee Dwɔn a le Yilaegya ne, mɔɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle kɛ ɔbara wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne mɔlebɛbo ne la. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Ɔti saa bɛyɛ anwomoalɛ na bɛkulo kɛ bɛdie bɛto nu ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee bɛdie ye kɛkala!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Duzu ɛdwɛkɛ a mebaha mɔɔ fale maanle ɛhye anwo a? Menli ɛhye mɔ le kɛ ngakula mɔɔ ɛlɛdi nwɔhoa wɔ gua zo, na bɛse bɛ gɔnwo mɔ kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Yɛliele atɔfolɛ, na bɛannyia nwole ahomeka, ɔti yɛyɛle ɛzɛne, noko bɛ rɛle ambɔ.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kɛmɔ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛnno nwanye bɔbɔ, na mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala ɔkye ɛhɔne la ati, bese ‘Ɔle abɔnsam.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Na Mame, Sonla Ra ne, yemɔ meto ɛkponle na meno nza, noko bɛse me kɛ mele ‘adidikpokuvo na eza mele nzanovo, na me nee ɛtanevolɛma yɛɛ atu a!’ Noko akee nrɛlɛbɛvolɛ biala nyɛleɛ a maa bɛkola bɛnwu ye sonla holɛ a!”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔkɔbɔlɛ nee ɛvɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Na akee ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔtea azua mgbole ne mɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ ye nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ dɔɔnwo wɔ zo la, ɔboalekɛ bɛangakyi bɛ sa anloa na bɛandoa Nana Nyamenle abo zo.<verse eid="MAT 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Munzule ɛha ɛdawɔ, Koleezen, munzule ɛha ɛdawɔ Bɛteseeyeda! Ɔluakɛ saa menyɛle nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔɔ menyɛle ye wɔ bɛ awɔlɔne ne mɔ azo la wɔ Taya nee Saedɛn amumuyɛ maanle ne mɔ anu a anrɛɛ menli ne nlunle bɛ nwo dɛbadɛba wɔ anyiemgba nee mɛlɛbɛnwoaze nu. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Nɔhalɛ nu, mese bɛ kɛ, wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ Kenle ne anu akɛvuanyi Taya nee Saedɛn! <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Kapɛnayɛm bɔbɔ, mɔɔ bɛwula ye anyunlunyia kpole la bahɔ abɔnsam senle ne anu! Ɔluakɛ, saa Sodɔm yɛɛ menyɛle nwanwane ninyɛne mgbole ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ menyɛle ye wɔ bɛ nu ɛke la wɔ a anrɛɛ ɛnɛ nee ɛnɛ ala ɔtɛbɔ ɛke. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Nɔhalɛ nu, ɔbavuanyi Sodɔm wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ Kenle ne anu yeadɛla bɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Na mekɛ ne anu Gyisɛse hanle kɛ: “O Egya, Anwuma nee aze bɛ Awulae, yɛyɛ wɔ mo kɛ wɔva nɔhalɛ ne Wɔvea bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdwenle kɛ bɛze nrɛlɛbɛ la, na emomu, wɔye wɔhile ngakula ngyikyi ngyikyi la. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ɛhɛe, Egya, ɔluakɛ, ɔzɔle ɛ nye kɛ ɛkɛyɛ ye zɛhae!”<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Me Ze ɛva debie biala ɛwula me sa. Selɛ ne angomekye yɛɛ aze Ralɛ ne a, yɛɛ ɔlua Ralɛ ne anwo zo noko a yɛnwu Selɛ ne a, yɛɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Ralɛ ne kɛye Selɛ ne kɛhile bɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Bɛ muala bɛrɛla me nwo ɛke, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛyɛ gyima na bɛvɛ, na bɛzoa bɛ adesoa ɛnlomboɛ a, na mebamaa bɛ ɛnwomenlelielɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29-30" />Bɛrɛla na bɛrazoa me adesoa ne ɔluakɛ, ɔle kpalɛ ɔmaa bɛ kɛ bɛkɛzoa, ɔboalekɛ medi me nwo eni na mebɛlɛ me nwo aze wɔ ahonle nu, na bɛbanyia ɛnwomenlelielɛ bɛamaa bɛ ɛkɛla ne mɔ; ɔluakɛ, me adesoa ɛdeɛ ne ɛnyɛ ɛnlomboɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 11:29-30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne amenle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Mekɛ ne anu, mɔɔ ɛnee Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɛlua abɛlɛ ɛya bie anu wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne, mɔɔ le Dwuuma ɛzonlenlɛ kenle ne la, ɛhɔne hunle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ; ɛhye ati bɛbubule abɛlɛ ne bie bɛlile.<verse eid="MAT 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Na Falasiima ne mɔ bie nwunle bɛ la, ɛya hunle bɛ na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɛyɛ mɔɔ ɛnva mɛla nu a. Bɛbubu aleɛ wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Na Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛtɛkengale deɛ mɔɔ Belemgbunli Devidi yɛle wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛhɔne hunle ɔdaye nee ɔ gɔnwo mɔ la ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Ɔhɔle Asɔne sua ne anu, na bɛlile kpanwo nwuanzanwuanza ne mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ ne mɔ angomekye ala a bɛmaa bɛ adenle kɛ bɛli la. Ɛhye noko tia mɛla ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Anzɛɛ bɛtɛkengale ye wɔ Mosisi mɛla ne anu kɛsi mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ gyima nu wɔ Asɔne sua ne anu la yɛ gyima wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne la ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Na nɔhalɛ nu, awie ko wɔ ɛke mɔɔ ɔle kpole ɔtɛla Asɔne sua ne a! <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Na saa bɛdele zɛhae Nyamedwɛkɛ kpɔkɛ ne mɔɔ se, ‘Mekulo kɛ bɛse anwunvɔne kpalɛ, bɛtɛla bɛ azubɔlɛ mɔɔ mekpondɛ la’ abo a, anrɛɛ bɛnrɛbua bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnli fɔlɛ la fɔlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Ɔluakɛ, Sonla Ra ne le Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne noko amenle.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Na ɔvile ɛkɛ ne ɔhɔle na akee ɔhɔle ayia sua ne anu, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Na ɔnwunle nrenyia ko mɔɔ asa ko ɛdwe la wɔ ɛkɛ. Na Falasiima ne mɔ bizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Ɔfa mɛla adenle zo kɛ bɛkɛyɛ ayile wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne ɔ?” Nɔhalɛ, ɛnee bɛlɛ anyelazo kɛ ɔkɛze kɛ, “ɛhɛe”, na bɛ sa aha ye bɛahye ye. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Na ye nyelebɛnloa mɔɔ ɔvale ɔmaanle bɛ la a le ɛhye: “Saa bɛ boane ko pɛ ala na ɔtɔ, bula nu wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne anu a, ɛnrɛyɛ gyima kenle ko ne ɔnrɛlie ye ngoane anzɛɛ ɛnrɛzɔ ye nu ɛnrɛmaa ye zo ɔ? Nɔhalɛ, ɛbaye. <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Anzɛɛ sonla ɛnzonle bolɛ ɛndɛla boane ɔ? Nɔhalɛ, ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛyɛ kpalɛ wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Akee ɔzele nrenyia ne kɛ, “Tenrɛ ɛ sa kpɔma ne.” Na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔyɛ la, ɔ sa ne yɛle kpalɛ kɛ ko ne ala la pɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Na akee Falasiima ne mɔ vɛlɛle ayia kɛ bɛfa Gyisɛse ɛhyelɛ nee ye ɛhunlɛ nwo akpame. <verse eid="MAT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Noko akee ɔnwunle bɛ adwenle, na ɔvile ayiasua ne anu, na menli dɔɔnwo ne ala doale ye. Ɔyɛle bɛ nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛnde kpɔkɛ la ayile, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />na ɔbɔle bɛ kɔkɔ, kɛ bɛmmafa nwanwanedeɛ ne mɔɔ yeyɛ la anwo edwɛkɛ bɛkponde. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Ɛhye maanle Ayezaya kapezonli ne edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle mɔɔ fale ɔ nwo la yɛle zɔ, kɛ: <verse eid="MAT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Nea me sonvolɛ ne mɔɔ meye ye la. Yemɔ a le me Ra ne mɔɔ mekulo ye na me ɛkɛla ne anye Sɔ ye a. Mebava me sunsum ne meagua ɔ nwo zo, na yeabua maanle maanle ndɛne. <verse eid="MAT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ɔnrɛho anzɛɛ ɔnredeɛdea nu na awie biala ade ɔ ne wɔ awɔlɔne ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="MAT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Ɔnrɛbubu menli mɔɔ anwo ɛbɛlɛ bɛ la, anzɛɛ ɔnrɛmaa bɛ anyelazo ekyi ne bɔbɔ ɛnrɛyɛ gyɛne; ɔbamaa mgbonde muala abɔ aze kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛmaa ndɛnebualɛ kɛli konim wɔ amozi kenle ne la anu; <verse eid="MAT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />na ye duma bayɛ ewiade amra kosooti bɛ anyelazo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Akee bɛvale nrenyia mumule, anyezinliravolɛ bie mɔɔ sunsum evinli ɛwolo ye nu la bɛrɛlɛle Gyisɛse, na Gyisɛse yɛle ye ayile ɔmaanle ɔdendɛle na ɔnwunle debie. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Na ɔyɛle menli dɔɔnwo ne ala azibɛnwo na bɛdeɛdeanle nu na bɛzele kɛ, “Wɔannea a ɔkɛyɛ kɛ, Gyisɛse yɛɛ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a.”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Na mɔɔ Falasiima ne mɔ dele nwanwanedeɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ la bɛzele kɛ, “Ɔkola ɔtu mbɔnsam ɔluakɛ ɔdaye mumua ne ɔle Biyɛlezɛbɛle, mbɔnsam bɛ kpanyinli.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Gyisɛse nwunle bɛ adwenle ne mɔ, na ɔbuale nwolɛ kɛ, “Belemgbunli maanle biala ko tia ɔ nwo a maanle ne ɛngola ɛngyinla; ɔbubu dwɔkɔdwɔkɔ, yɛɛ sua kpole anzɛɛ aako mɔɔ nuhua menli noko ko tia bɛ nwo la ɛngola ɛngyinla. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ɔti saa Abɔnsam tu ɔ gɔnwo Abɔnsam a, ɛnee ɔlɛko yeatia ɔ ngomekye ɔ nwo, na eza ɔlɛsɛkye ɔdaye ɔ ngome ye belemgbunli maanle. <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Na saa mame melua Biyɛlezɛbɛle anwo zo, anzɛɛ mbɔnsam tumi zo a metu mbɔnsam a, ɛnee duzu tumi a bɛ mra ne mɔ dua zo tu mbɔnsam a? Ɛhye ati bɛmɛ a bɛbayɛ bɛ ndɛnebuavolɛma a. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Na saa melua Nana Nyamenle Sunsum duma nu yɛɛ metu mbɔnsam a, ɛnee Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ɛnyia ɛra bɛ avinli. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na sonla ahola awolo sonla mɔɔ anwo yɛ se la sua nu ahɔwua ye ninyɛne ɛ? Kyesɛ ɔdumua ɔkyekye ye kolaa. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Awie biala mɔɔ ɛmboa me la ɛnee ɔtia me.<verse eid="MAT 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31-32" />“Awie biala mɔɔ kɛdendɛ kɛtia me bɔbɔ, anzɛɛ kɛyɛ ɛtane gyɛne biala la, bɛbava ye ɛtane bɛahyɛ ye; na emomu, awie biala mɔɔ kɛdendɛ kɛtia Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne la ɔnrɛnyia ɛtane fakyɛ ɛlɛ wɔ ewiade ɛhye anu anzɛɛ ewiade ne mɔɔ bara la anu.<verse eid="MAT 12:31-32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Bɛnea baka ye ma na bɛanwu ye baka holɛ. Baka mɔɔ vi mbaka ekpunli kpalɛ nu la so ma kpalɛ; na mbaka mɔɔ vi ekpunli ɛtane nu la ɛnzo ma kpalɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Nwɔlɛ mɔɔ le kɛ bɛmɛ! Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na bɛadendɛ boɛ, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛle ɛtanevolɛma la ɛ? Ɔluakɛ mɔɔ ɛbu zo wɔ sonla ye ahonle nu la, yemɔ a ɔ nloa ka a. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Sonla kpalɛ biala ye ɛdendɛlɛ a maa ye ninyɛne kpalɛ ne mɔɔ vea ye nu la da ali a. Sonla mɔɔ ye ahonle nu le evinli la, ayidane ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ, na ye ɛdendɛlɛ noko kile. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Na meka meahile bɛ kɛ, bɛbabu edwɛkɛ mgbane biala mɔɔ bɛhanle la anwo mgbonda wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ Kenle ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Bɛ ɛdendɛlɛ yɛɛ bahile bɛ gyinlabelɛ a; ɔboalekɛ wɔ edwɛkɛ zo, yɛɛ bɛbanlea nwo bɛabua wɔ benle a; yɛɛ wɔ edwɛkɛ zo noko yɛɛ bɛbanlea nwo bɛabua wɔ fɔlɛ a.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛ maa yɛnlea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Kenle ko bie Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ bie mɔɔ Falasiima bie mɔ boka nwo la rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, yɛ nwanwane debie maa yɛnlea.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39-40" />Gyisɛse noko buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Kyesɛ munzule maanle mɔɔ ɛnlɛ diedi la ala na akpondɛ sɛkɛlɛneɛ; na bɛnrɛhile bɛ nuhua biala sɛkɛlɛneɛ biala, kɛ kapezonli Dwona sɛkɛlɛneɛ ne angome! Na kɛsi Dwona lile kenle kɔkɔlɛ nsa alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ wɔ nyevizonle kunlu la, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ Mame Ngoanedievolɛ ne mebali kenle nsa alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye abo a. <verse eid="MAT 12:39-40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Nenɛvɛ maanlema ne badwazo maanle ɛhye anwo zo wɔ ndɛnebualɛ mekɛ na bɛabua bɛ fɔlɛ. Ɔluakɛ mekɛ mɔɔ Dwona hanle Nyamedwɛkɛ ne hilele bɛ la bɛnlunle bɛ nwo, na bɛliele Nyamenle bɛlile, na bɛhwenle bɛ nwo bɛvile bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anu. Na nea, mɔɔ le kpole tɛla Dwona la wɔ ɛke, noko akee bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛlie ye bɛkɛli. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Hyiba Belemgbunli Raalɛ ne badwazo maanle ɛhye anwo zo wɔ ndɛnebualɛ mekɛ ne, na yeabua bɛ fɔlɛ. Ɔluakɛ ɔvi maanle zo moamoa nehane ɔrale ɔradiele Sɔlɔmɔn nrɛlɛbɛ edwɛkɛ ne; na kɛkala bɔbɔ, mɔɔ le kpole tɛla Sɔlɔmɔn la wɔ ɛke noko akee bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛlie ye bɛkɛli.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43-45" />“Munzule maanle ɛhye le kɛ nrenyia bie mɔɔ sunsum evinli ɛwolo ye nu la. Ɔluakɛ saa sunsum evinli ne fi ye nu a zɔhane sunsum ko ne ala kɔ ɛsɛlɛ ne mɔ azo ɔkɔkpɔsa kɛ ɔkalie ɔ menle bie, na saa yeannyia ɛleka a akee ɔse kɛ, ‘Mebazia meahɔ nrenyia ne mɔɔ menvile ye lɔ membale la ɛkɛ.’ Ɔti ɔsia ɔba a, ɔbato ahonle ne mgbane, ɔluakɛ bɛkpoɔkpoa nu na bɛziezie nuhua! Akee sunsum evinli ne sia kɔ na ɔfɛlɛvɛlɛ sunsum gyɛne nsuu mɔɔ yɛ se tɛla ye la maa bɛba na bɛ muala bɛbatɛnla nrenyia ne nu. Na akee nrenyia ne tɛnlabelɛ nu yɛ ɛtane bo dɛba ne anwo zo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:43-45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46-47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46-47" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse wɔ zo mɔɔ ɔtendɛ yeahile menli dɔɔnwo bie wɔ sua bie anu la, ɛnee ɔ nli nee ɔ mediema ne mɔ gyi su ne anzi na bɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛ nee ye tendɛ. Na mɔɔ bɛzele kɛ ɔ nli nee ɔ mediema ne mɔ kpondɛ ye la <verse eid="MAT 12:46-47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />ɔzele kɛ, “Ɔmɔ a le nwane? Yɛɛ me mediema ne mɔ noko a le nwane mɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Akee ɔdendenle ɔ sa wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo zo, na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛnlea! ɛhye mɔ yɛɛ a le me nli nee me mediema a.” <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Akee ɔvale ɔzɔle zolɛ kɛ, “Awie biala mɔɔ yɛ me Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la ɛhulolɛdeɛ la le me diema nrenyia, me diema raalɛ nee ɔmɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nyamenle Maanle ne anwo adawu adawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Kenle ko ne ala, mɔɔ ɛnee melɛ ne ɛhɔ bie la, Gyisɛse vile sua nu na ɔhɔle ɛnweanloa lɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2-3" />Na yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ menli dɔɔnwo bie yiale ɛke ne a, Ɔvole ɔhɔle ɛlɛne nu na ɔhɔdɛnlanle aze wɔ nu na ɔhilehilele bɛ debie wɔ melɛ mɔɔ menli ne mɔ gyinlegyinlanle ɛnwea kpane ne azo bɛdiele ye la. Na ɔdendɛle dɔɔnwo ne ala ɔhilele bɛ wɔ mrɛlɛbulɛ nu ɔzele kɛ: “Ɛyazonlɛnli bie hɔluale ma wɔ ye ɛya nu. <verse eid="MAT 13:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Na melɛ mɔɔ ɔkponde ma ne wɔ ɛya ne anu la, bie mɔ guale adenle ne anloa, na nloma rale rasusole. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Bie noko guale awozaka nu, ɛleka mɔɔ azɛlɛ ekyi bie yɛɛ aheda awolɛ ne azo la; ma ne fifile nyinle wɔ azɛlɛ ɛhye azo, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />na ewia henlema ne bɔle bɛ maanle bɛnwosonle na bɛwule, ɔluakɛ bɛ ndinli ne mɔ anzo. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ma ne mɔ bie mɔ noko guale mbowule nu, na mbowule ne nyinle na ɔmiemianle bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Bie mɔ noko guale azɛlɛ kpalɛ zo, na bɛzole ma dɔɔnwo. Bɛzole abulasa, abulasia nee ɛya mɔnwo mɔnwo ne ala kɛmɔ ɔkpondenle bɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Mɔɔ lɛ ɛnzolɛ la ɛdie!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale na bɛrabizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a dahuu ɛtendɛ ɛkile bɛ wɔ mrɛlɛ zɛhae mɔ anu a?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Akee ɔhilele nu ɔhilele bɛ kɛ, bɛdabɛ ngomekye ala yɛɛ bɛmaa bɛ adenle kɛ bɛkɛde Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne abo a, na tɛ menli mɔɔ bɛha la ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12-13" />Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Mɔɔ lɛ bie la yemɔ a bɛbamaa ye bie dɔɔnwo a, na yeanyia ye molozo; na mɔɔ ɛnlɛ bie la, ekyi ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la, bɛbaza ye bɛalie. Ɛhye ati a metendɛ mekile bɛ wɔ mrɛlɛ nu la, amaa menli ade na bɛanwu ye, na emomu bɛnrɛde ɔ bo.<verse eid="MAT 13:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />“Ɛhye maa Ayezaya Kapezonli ne edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle la yɛ ɛkɛ kɛ, ‘Bɛte, na bɛnde ɔ bo; bɛnea, na bɛnnwu ye! <verse eid="MAT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Ɔluakɛ bɛ ahonle ne mɔ ɛtilitili na bɛyɛ ɛnlomboɛ ɛnlomboɛ, bɛ nzo ne mɔ ɛdi kɛ bɛkɛdie, na bɛmuomua bɛ nye wɔ nafelɛ nu, <verse eid="MAT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />ɛhye ati bɛnrɛnwu ye, na bɛade, na bɛanyia ndelebɛbo na bɛahakyi bɛ sa anloa bɛadoa Nana Nyamenle bieko, na bɛamaa meayɛ bɛ ayile.’ Emomu nyilalɛ ɛha bɛ nye ne mɔ, ɔluakɛ bɛnwu debie; ɔ nee bɛ nzo ne mɔ, ɔluakɛ bɛte edwɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Ngapezoma dɔɔnwo ne ala nee tenlenema dɔɔnwo ne ala hulole kɛ bɛkɛnwu mɔɔ bɛmɛ bɛnwu ye la, na bɛade mɔɔ bɛmɛ bɛde la, noko akee bɛannyia ye zɔ.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Kɛkala akee adawu ne mɔɔ membɔle mɔɔ fale ɛyazonlɛnli ne nee ye ma ɛlualɛ ne anwo la abo ɛne: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Adenle ketekete ne mɔɔ ma ne bie mɔ guale ye adehanle ne la gyi ɛkɛ ne maa sonla ahonle ne mɔɔ tie Adawu Kpalɛ ne mɔɔ fale Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo na ɔnde ɔ bo la; ɛhye ati akee Abɔnsam ba na ɔbasesa ma ne ɔfi ye ahonle ne anu. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Azɛlɛ awozaka sɛhɛlɛɛ ne gyi ɛkɛ ne maa nrenyia ne mɔɔ fa fɛlɛko tie Nyamedwɛkɛ ne la ahonle ne, <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />na kɛmɔ ɔdaye mumua ne ɔnzi pi wɔ ye ɛbɛla nu la ati, ma ne ɛnzɔ ndinli kpalɛ, ɔti saa nzinlii ɔnwu amaneɛ nee anwubɛnyunlu ɔlua ye diedi ti, na ye diedi wie a ɔtɔ, aze. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Azɛlɛ ne mɔɔ mbowule ne wɔ zo la, gyi ɛkɛ ne maa nrenyia ne mɔɔ tie Nyamedwɛkɛ ne, na ewiade anu ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nee ye ezukoakpondɛlɛ kakyi mbowule miemia Nyamenle Edwɛkɛ ne na ɔte ye Nyamenle ɛzonlenlɛ ne azo ngyikyi ngyikyi la. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Azɛlɛ kpalɛ ne gyi ɛkɛ ne maa nrenyia ne mɔɔ tie Nyamedwɛkɛ ne na ɔte ɔ bo, na ɔtwe menli mɔɔ kɛyɛ kɛ abulasa, abulasia anzɛɛ ɛya nee ɔ nzi ɔba belemgbunli maanle ne anu la.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Ɛrɛlɛ fofolɛ bieko mɔɔ Gyisɛse bule bɛ la ɛne: “Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ ɛyazonlɛnli mɔɔ ɛlɛdua ma kpalɛ wɔ ye ɛya nu la. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Na kenle ko nɔɔzo ɔla ala la, ye kpɔvolɛ rale na ɔraluale adua wɔ ye abɛlɛ ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Na mɔɔ abɛlɛ ne bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔnyi la, adua ne noko nyinle zɔhane ala.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />“Na ɛyazonlɛnli ne gyimayɛvoma ne rale razele ye kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, ɛya ne mɔɔ ɛluale ma kpalɛ ne nu la adua ngome ɛva ye bɔkɔɔ zɛ!’<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />“Ɔhilele nu ɔzele kɛ, ‘Kpɔvolɛ bie yɛɛ ɛye ɛhye a.’ Na bɛbizale ye kɛ, ‘Ɛnee yɛkɛdudu adua ne mɔ yɛkɛgua ɔ?’<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />“Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, ‘Kyɛkyɛ, saa bɛtudu adua ne a abɛlɛ ne bie bazɛkye. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Bɛmaa bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛgulu nu bɛnyi bɛhɔkpula aleɛbulɛ mekɛ ne na mebaze aleɛbuvoma ne meamaa bɛakpa adua ne bɛayela bɛ, na bɛava abɛlɛ ne bɛagua bonwole ne azo.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 13:30" /><verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31-32" />Ɛrɛlɛ bieko mɔɔ Gyisɛse vale hilele bɛ debie la ɛne: “Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ dubinli ma bie mɔɔ bɛluale ye wɔ ɛya nu la. Yemɔ a le ma nretee kpalɛ wɔ ma kosooti anu a, na ɔnyi ɔyɛ kpole wɔ mbaka avinli, na eza ɔyɛ baka mɔɔ nloma kola tɛnla zo na bɛkpondɛ bɛ dabelɛ wɔ zo la.”<verse eid="MAT 13:31-32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Ɔvale ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye noko ɔyɛle ndonwo: “Yɛfa Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne yɛto raalɛ bie mɔɔ yɛ kuma la anwo. Ɔsuzu abɛlɛ ɛdɔkɛ na ɔfa mgbɔvonle ekyii ɔfɔtɔ kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛde ɛdɔkɛ ne ɛlɛka biala la.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34-35" />Mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala Gyisɛse bule mrɛlɛ ɛhye mɔ mekɛ biala mɔɔ ɔtendɛ yeahile menli dɔɔnwo ne la. Nɔhalɛ, ɔlua kɛ ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle kɛ ɔbabu mrɛlɛ dɔɔnwo la ati, yeandendɛ yeangile bɛ ɛlɛ mgbane wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔmbu bɛ ɛrɛlɛ ko bɔbɔ a. Ɔluakɛ, bɛhanle bɛdole ye ɛkɛ ne dɛbadɛba kɛ, “Mebadendɛ wɔ mrɛlɛ nu; mebahile awozindeɛ mɔɔ vea mɔɔ sumunli mɔlebɛbo ne bɛtɛtele ɔ bo la abo.” <verse eid="MAT 13:34-35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Akee ɔgyakyile menli dɔɔnwo ne alie ne anwo, na ɔhɔle sua ne anu. Na ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zele ye kɛ ɔhile ɛrɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɔbule mɔɔ fale adua ne nee abɛlɛ ne anwo la abo ɔhile bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Ɔliele ɔdole nu na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Wioo, mede! Mame yɛɛ mele ɛyazonlɛnli ne mɔɔ dua ma kpalɛ ne la a. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Ɛya ne a le ewiade ne, yɛɛ ma ne mɔ gyi ɛkɛ ne maa belemgbunli maanle ne anu menli ne; adua ne a le menli ne mɔɔ le Abɔnsam ɛdeɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Kpɔvolɛ ne mɔɔ luale adua ne wɔ abɛlɛ ne avinli la a le abɔnsam ne; aleɛbulɛ ne a le ewiade ne awieleɛ ne; yɛɛ aleɛbuvoma ne mɔ noko a le anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />“Kɛmɔ wɔ adawu ɛhye anu bɛkpale adua ne mɔ angome bɛyelale bɛ la, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ bɛbayɛ ye wɔ awieleɛ mekɛ ne anu a: <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mebazoa me anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ meamaa bɛakpa gyegyeravoma nee ɛtaneyɛvoma amuala bɛavi belemgbunli maanle ne anu, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />na bɛagua bɛ sendɔlera kpole ne anu bɛayela bɛ. Ɛzunlɛ nee egyelehwinlɛ bara. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Na akee tenlenema bada kɛ sɛnzɛne ne wɔ bɛ Ze belemgbunli maanle ne anu. Bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ ɛnzolɛ la ɛdie!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ agyapadeɛ bie mɔɔ bɛvale bɛveale azɛlɛ bo mɔɔ nrenyia bie nwunle ye la. Ɔlua ye fɛlɛko molozo mɔɔ ɔyɛle ye la ati, ɔdɔnenle debie biala mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la amaa yeanyia ezukoa dɔɔnwo mɔɔ sa azɛlɛ ne tɔ, la, na ɔ sa hanle agyapadeɛ ne noko!<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Bieko, Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ agundeɛ guadivo bie mɔɔ anye dedɛdeda alie nwo kpondɛ agudeɛ ngɛnlɛma ngɛnlɛma la. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Ɔnwunle bie mɔɔ ye bolɛ le kpalɛ, agudeɛ mɔɔ sonle bolɛ kpalɛ la na ɔdɔnenle debie biala mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la na ɔvale ɔdɔle.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47-48" />“Bieko, Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ nwowie mɔɔ bɛdole ye nyevile nu bɛhyele fɛlɛ ngakyile la. Mɔɔ bɛhwenle bɛrale aze la, bɛkpale nuhua na bɛvale kpalɛ ne bɛguale ye ahyɛnze nu na bɛvuandinle ɛtane ne mɔ bɛguale. <verse eid="MAT 13:47-48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Kɛ awieleɛ mekɛ ne bayɛ la ɛne; anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ bara na bɛaraye menli amumuyɛvoma ne bɛavi tenlenema ne anu, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na bɛavuandi amumuyɛvoma ne mɔ bɛagua senle ne anu. Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɛzunlɛ nee egyelehwinlɛ bara a. <verse eid="MAT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Bɛde ɛhye mɔ amuala abo ɔ?” Bɛbuale ye bɛzele kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, yɛde ɔ bo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Akee ɔvale ɔzɔle zolɛ kɛ, “Kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛma mɔɔ bɛnyia ndetelɛ wɔ Anwuma maanle ne anwo la le kɛ aakomenle mɔɔ ɔfi ye ninyɛnezielɛ ɛleka ɔbaye ninyɛne dɛba nee fofolɛ kosooti ɔfinde la.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kapentanli Ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53-54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53-54" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse wiele mrɛlɛ ɛhye mɔ bu la, ɔziale ɔhɔle ye sua zo, Nazalɛte mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la, na ɔhɔhilehilele debie wɔ ɛkɛ ne ayialeka ne, na ye nrɛlɛbɛ ne nee ye nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔyɛle la zinle awie biala anwo.<verse eid="MAT 13:53-54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Menli ne bizale kɛ, “Kɛ ɔyɛ mɔɔ ɔkola ɔyɛ ɛhye mɔ ɛ? Tɛ kapentanli ne ara ɔ? Tɛ ɔ nli a le Male ɔ? Yɛɛ tɛ ɔ mediema mrenyia a le Gyemise, Dwosefi, Saemɔn, nee Dwudase mɔ ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Tɛ ɔ mediema mraalɛ a yɛ nee bɛ de la ɔ? Na kɛ ɔyɛ mɔɔ ɔkola ɔyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne zɛhae ɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Na bɛnyianle ɔ nwo ɛya. Na akee Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Kapezonli biala lɛ anyunlunyia wɔ ɛlɛka biala, na emomu, wɔ ɔdaye mumua ne ye maanle nu yemɔ ɔnlɛ anyunlunyia biala wɔ ɔdaye ye menli avinli bɔbɔ!” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ɛhye ati ɔyɛle nwanwanendeɛ ekyii bie ala wɔ ɛkɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛanlie ye bɛanli.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kɛ bɛzile bɛhunle Dwɔn la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Kenle mɔɔ Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo dele Gyisɛse nganeɛ la <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />ɔzele ye menli ne mɔ kɛ, “Ɔzɔho kɛ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛzia ɛra ngoane nu bieko. Ɛhye ati a ɔkola ɔyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ la.” <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3-4" />Ɔluakɛ, ɔlua Hɛlɔdease, ɔ diema Felepe aye dɛba ne ati ɔmaanle bɛhyele Dwɔn bɛguale ye nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ na bɛdole ye efiade, ɔboalekɛ ɛnee Dwɔn ɛha ɛhile Hɛlɔdo kɛ ɔnva mɛla nu kɛ ɔkɛgya ye. <verse eid="MAT 14:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Anrɛɛ ɔkɛhu Dwɔn, noko akee ɛnee ɔsulo kɛ basabasa kɛzi, ɔluakɛ menli ne kosooti liele lile kɛ Dwɔn le kapezonli.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Na wɔ Hɛlɔdo awolɛ kenle ɛvoyialilɛ ne anu, Hɛlɔdease ara raalɛ ne zile agole maanle ɔzɔle ɔ nye totohyia, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />ɔti ɔhanle ndane ɔbɔle ɛwɔkɛ kɛ debie biala mɔɔ ɔkpondɛ la ɔbava yeamaa ye. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Kakula bɛlɛra ne ɔ nli hyɛle ye maanle ɔbizale ɔzele kɛ: “Mekulo Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ati mɔɔ bɛpɛ na ɔla ayera apawa zo la.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ɛhye maanle nyane totohyia hanle belemgbunli ne. Na kɛmɔ ɛnee yeha ndane na ɔnrɛhulo kɛ ɔkɛbulu zo wɔ ye nyɛvolɛ ne mɔ anyunlu la ati, ɔzoanle.<verse eid="MAT 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Ɔmaanle bɛhɔpɛle Dwɔn mɔɔ ɛnee la efiade la ati, <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />na bɛdole ye wɔ apawa zo, na bɛvale bɛrɛlɛle kakula raalɛ ne na ɔdaye noko ɔvale ɔhɔmaanle ɔ nli.<verse eid="MAT 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Na akee Dwɔn ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale ravale ye funli ne na bɛhɔziele ye, na akee bɛhɔbɔle Gyisɛse amanee wɔ mɔɔ ɛzi la anwo.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse dele adawu ne ɛkɛ ne ala la, ɔvole ɛlɛne nu na ɔ ngomekye ɔhɔle ɛleka fealera bie mɔɔ awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne la. Na mɔɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne dele ɛleka mɔɔ ɔbɔle ɔ ti la bɛvi namunamu dɔɔnwo anu bɛvale aze bɛkpole ye.<verse eid="MAT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse maanle menli apenle nnu aleɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse vindele ɛnweanloa la, ɛnee menli dɔɔnwo kpalɛ de ɔ nzi ɛlɛkendɛ ye, na ɔlile bɛ nwo nyane na ɔyɛle bɛ nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛnde kpɔkɛ la ayile.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nɔsolɛ ko ne ala, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Aleɛlilɛ mekɛ ɛkpa nwo, na aleɛ biala noko ɛnle ɛsɛlɛ ye azo ɛmmaa bɛ mɔɔ bɛdi a; maa menli dɔɔnwo ɛhye mɔ ɛhɔ kɛ saa gyengyɛne nu biala bɛkenyia aleɛ wɔ namunamu ne mɔ azo bɛkɛdɔ bɛkɛli a.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Na Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhye ɛngyia; bɛmɛ bɛmaa bɛ debie bɛmaa bɛli!”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Bɛyele ɔ nloa bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛlɛ kpanwo dolɔfo ngyikyi nnu nee fɛlɛ nwiɔ pɛ ala!”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛva bɛrɛlɛ me.”<verse eid="MAT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Na akee ɔzele menli ne kɛ bɛdɛnla aze wɔ ndile ne azo; na akee ɔvale kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ne nee fɛlɛ nwiɔ ne, na ɔnleanle anwomanyunlu na ɔzɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle nyilalɛ ɔguale aleɛ ne azo, na akee ɔbubule kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ne anu na ɔvale ɔmaanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛhyɛ bɛmaa menli ne mɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Na awie biala lile bie na bɛ ko yiyile tetɛkɛɛ. Na mɔɔ bɛsesale ɔ bo zo mgbokpoleka ne amozii la, bɛnyianle ahɛndɛne tetɛkɛɛ bulu nee nwiɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Mrenyia nee mraalɛ nee ngakula mɔɔ lile aleɛ ne zɔhane kenle ne la le kɛyɛ apenle nnu. <verse eid="MAT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ɛhye anzi, Gyisɛse maanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vole bɛ ɛlɛne nu bɛpɛle azule tandane ne bɛhɔle ɔ nzi nehane, na yemɔ ɔhale ɛkɛ ne kɛ ɔnea yeamaa menli ne mɔ ahɔ bɛ azua nu.<verse eid="MAT 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23-24" />Ɛhye anzi, akee ɔhɔle awoka ne mɔ azo kɛ ɔkazɛlɛ. Aleɛ dwole, na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo hyelele bɛ wɔ azule tandane ne anye. Ɔluakɛ anwoma ne dule na bɛyiale azɛlɛkye mgbole.<verse eid="MAT 14:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Bɛbɔle aleɛbahye kɛyɛ dɔne nna la, Gyisɛse rale bɛ nwo ɛkɛ, na ɔlua azule ne anye! <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Bɛdeɛdeanle nu ɛzulolɛ nu ala, ɔluakɛ, bɛdwenlenle kɛ ɔle nwomenle.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Na ndɛndɛ ne ala, Gyisɛse dendɛlɛle hilele bɛ, na ɔmaanle bɛ arɛlekyekyelɛ ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmasulo!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Na akee Pita vɛlɛle ye na ɔzele ye kɛ: “Yɛmenle, saa ɛdawɔ amgba ɛdeɛ a ɛnee maa medame noko menlua azule ne anye membɛla ɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Awulae kponlenle zo na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Bɛla.” Ɔti Pita vale ɛlɛne ne foa ko na ɔtietiale azule ne anye ɔbikyele Gyisɛse. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Na mɔɔ ɔnwunle azɛlɛkye mgbole ne mɔ la, ye ahonle dule somaa ne ala na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔnoma. Ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Awulae! Die me!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala Gyisɛse dendenle ɔ sa na ɔzɔle ye nu. Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “O wɔ diedi le ekyi amgba! Duzu ati a ɛnlie me ɛnli a?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Na mɔɔ bɛvole ɛlɛne ne anu la anwoma ne gyakyile ɛdulɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ɔyɛle ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛha wɔ ɛlɛne ne anu la azibɛnwo, na bɛyeyɛle ye bɛzele kɛ, “Amgba wɔmɔ a ɛle Nyamenle Ra ne a!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Bɛdwule aze wɔ Gɛnɛzalɛte. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Na bɛ ɛralɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ kpondenle sua kpole ne azo ndɛndɛ ne ala, na yeangyɛ biala menli vale ɛnriandinlɛ kpɔsale nu bɔle awie biala amaneɛ kɛ ɔva ye wuliravolɛ ɔhɔ ɔmaa bɛyɛ ye ayile. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Wuliravolɛma ne bodole ye kɛ ɔmaa bɛ adenle ɔmaa bɛzɔ ye tɛladeɛ ne anloa mgbane bɔbɔ, na bɛ nwo baza, na amgba menli mɔɔ zɔle nuhua la amuala anwo zale.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛla nee mɛlazolilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Falasiima bie mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ vi Gyɛlusalɛm rabizale Gyisɛse edwɛkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛnli Dwuuma tete mɛla ne mɔ azo a? Ɔluakɛ bɛnli mɛla ne mɔɔ hyia kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛwowo bɛ sa anwo kolaa na bɛali debie la azo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Na duzu ati a bɛ amaamuo ne mɔ tia Nana Nyamenle ye mɛla ne mɔ a? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ndonwo a le kɛ, Nana Nyamenle mɛla ne se, ‘Maa ɛ nye ɛzɔ ɛ ze nee ɛ nli; awie biala mɔɔ kɛyɛ ɔ ze nee ɔ nli anwo mgbanyizonle la ɔwɔ kɛ ɔwu.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5-6" />Noko akee bɛmɛ bɛse, ‘Saa ɛ ze nee ɛ nli ɛlɛdi ehyia bɔbɔ a, ɔnva nwo kɛ emomu ɛkɛva ezukoa mɔɔ anrɛɛ ɛkɛva ɛkɛmaa bɛ la ɛkɛmaa asɔne ne.’ Ɛhye ati, ɔlua bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛ mɛla mɔɔ bɛyɛ la azo, bɛbulu Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye ye mɛla ne mɔɔ se, maa ɛ nye ɛzɔ ɛ ze nee ɛ nli na nea bɛ la azo. <verse eid="MAT 15:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Adalɛ nabalabama! Ayezaya nwunle ye ɔhanle bɛ nwo edwɛkɛ bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Menli ɛhye mɔ se, bɛdi me eni, noko akee bɛ ahonle ne mɔ wɔ moa hwehwe. <verse eid="MAT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Bɛ ɛzonlenlɛ ne le gyɛne, ɔluakɛ bɛkilehile bɛdabɛ bɛ ti anwo mɛla mɔɔ bɛhyehyɛ la, na bɛgyakyi mɔɔ vi Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ ne la.’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Akee Gyisɛse vɛlɛle menli dɔɔnwo ne na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdie mɔɔ melɛka la na bɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛde ɔ bo: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Tɛ aleɛ mɔɔ anwo ɛnde la yɛɛ bɛdi a ɔgua bɛ nwo evinli a! Na emomu, mɔɔ bɛka nee mɔɔ bɛdwenle nwo la yɛɛ agua bɛ nwo evinli a.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Akee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Wɔ edwɛke ne mɔɔ hanle la hwile Falasiima ne mɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13-14" />Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛgyakyi bɛ nzi ɛlilɛ, ɔluakɛ, baka biala mɔɔ tɛ Egya a luale la, bɛbadu ye bɛado. Bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛ nye ɛzi noko bɛkile menli adenle. Na saa anyezinliravolɛ kile ɔ gɔnwo anyezinliravolɛ adenle noko a bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛbagua kuma nu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Akee Pita zele Gyisɛse kɛ ɔhile mɔɔ ɔhanle kɛ tɛ aleɛ mɔɔ anwo ɛnde la yɛɛ agua sonla nwo evinli a la abo.<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Na Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Bɛnde ɛhye abo ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Benze kɛ aleɛ mɔɔ bɛdi la dua ɛkolɛ ne anu dedee na ɔfinde bieko ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Na edwɛkɛ ɛtane mɔɔ vi ahonle ɛtane nu la yɛɛ agua ahenle ne mɔɔ kɛha la anwo evinli a. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ɔluakɛ ahonle ne anu a adwenle ɛtane ɛtane ɛhye mɔ: sonlahunlɛ, awuvolɛvalɛ, huhunli nyɛleɛ, awuleyɛlɛ, adalɛbɔlɛ nee dumazɛkyelɛ vi ba a. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ɛhye mɔ a gua sonla nwo evinli a; na saa wɔanwowo ɛ sa anwo na ɛdi aleɛ a, ɔngua sunsum ne anwo evinli!”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Akee Gyisɛse vile ɛkɛ ne ɔhɔle Taya nee Saedɛn maanzinli ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nwanwanendeɛ dɔɔnwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Raalɛ bie mɔɔ vi Keena na ɔde ɛkɛ ne la vale modolɛ rale ye ɛkɛ na ɔzele ye kɛ, “O Awulae, Devidi Ara, nwu me anwunvɔne! Ɔluakɛ bozonle ɛva me ra raalɛ ne na ɔto ye.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Gyisɛse andɛne ye zo, yeanga edwɛkɛ kpɔkɛ ko bɔbɔ. Na ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zele ye kɛ ɔmaa raalɛ ne ɛvi ɛkɛ ne ɛhɔ, ɔluakɛ bɛzele kɛ, “ɔlɛfa ye modolɛ ne yeagyegye ye somaa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Akee ɔzele raalɛ ne kɛ, “Bɛzoanle me kɛ membamboa Dwuuma ne mɔ, Yizilayɛ mboane ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛminli la, na tɛ awie gyɛne biala ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Noko raalɛ ne rale na ɔrazonlenle ye na ɔbodole ye bieko ɔzele kɛ, “Yɛmenle, boa me!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Ɔnva adenle nu kɛ ɛkɛva ngakula aleɛ mɔɔ bɛdi la ɛkɛmaa ahwea a.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Raalɛ ne buale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, ɔle nɔhalɛ, Awulae, noko akee ahwea ne mɔ di mgbokpoleka ne mɔ mɔɔ vi bɛ menle mɔ ɛkponle ne mɔ azo kɛgua aze la.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɔmɔ, wɔ diedi le kpole, ɛhye ati wɔ ɛbizalɛdeɛ ne ɛyɛ ɛkɛ.” Na ɛkɛ ne ala ɔ ra raalɛ ne anwo zale.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Gyisɛse zɔle ye adendulɛ ne azo na ɔpɛle nu wɔ Galeli nyevile ne anloa, na ɔvole ɔhɔdɛnlanle ezukue bie azo wɔ ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Na menli dɔɔnwo bie vale bɛ abuburavolɛma, anyezinliravolɛma, kokobɛvolɛma, nee menli mɔɔ ɛngola tendɛ la, ɔ nee mɔɔ bokɛboka nwo la rale Gyisɛse anyunlu, na ɔyɛle bɛ ayile. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Na ɛhye yɛle menli ne nwanwane totohyia! Ɔluakɛ menli bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛtɛtendɛle ɛlɛ la dendɛle ahomeka nu, yɛɛ menli mɔɔ bɛ sa nee bɛ gyakɛ ne mɔ le ngoko noko la nyianle fofolɛ; abuburavolɛma diale na bɛwuluwulule ahomeka nu ala, na bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ ɛnee bɛ nye ɛzi la nwunle debie! Ɔyɛle menli dɔɔnwo ne azibɛnwo, na ɔlua zo bɛyele Yizilayɛ Nyamenle ne ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Akee Gyisɛse vɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Medi menli ɛhye mɔ anwo nyane, ɔluakɛ bɛ nee me ɛdɛnla ɛke kenle nsa kpalɛ, mɔɔ debie biala ɛnle ɛke mɔɔ bɛbali a; mengulo noko kɛ menwɔmaa bɛkɛva ɛhɔne bɛkɛhɔ a, anrɛɛ yemɔ bɛ nye zo babulubulu bɛ wɔ adenle nu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye kɛ, “Na nienwu ɛleka bɔbɔ a yɛbanyia aleɛ wɔ ɛsɛlɛ ye azo ɛke yɛava yɛamaa menli wowiakɛ ɛhye mɔ ali a?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Kpanwo dolɔfo nyɛ a bɛlɛ ye a?” Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Kpanwo dolɔfo nsuu ɔ nee fɛlɛ ekyii.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Na akee Gyisɛse zele menli ne amuala kɛ bɛdɛnla aze, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />na ɔvale kpanwo dolɔfo nsuu ne nee fɛlɛ ne, na ɔyɛle Nana Nyamenle mo, na akee ɔbubule nuhua ngyikyi ngyikyi, na ɔvale ɔmaanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ, na bɛdabɛ noko bɛhyɛle bɛmaanle menli ɛwolaa ne. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37-38" />Na awie biala lile bie maanle ɔ ko yile. Na bɛlua mrenyia apenle nna yɛɛ mraalɛ nee ngakula dɔɔnwo boka nwo. Nzinlii mɔɔ bɛsesale ɔ bo zo mgbokpoleka ne la, bɛnyianle ahɛndɛne tetɛkɛɛ nsuu!<verse eid="MAT 15:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Akee Gyisɛse maanle menli dɔɔnwo ne hɔle bɛ azua nu na yemɔ ɔvole ɛlɛne nu ɔpɛle azule tandane ne ɔhɔle Magadan maanzinli ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛkpondɛle yɛkile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Kenle ko bie Falasiima nee Sadusiima ne mɔ rale kɛ bɛbazɔ Gyisɛse bɛanlea kɛ amgba ala yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a. Na bɛzele ye kɛ ɔhile sɛkɛlɛneɛ kpole wɔ anwomanyunlu ɔhile bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2-3" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛbɔ mɔdenle wɔ anwomanyunlu mɔɔ bɛnea bɛka maanle nu edwɛkɛ la anwo. Saa anwomanyunlu yɛ kɔkɔlɛ nɔsolɛ nu a, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ aleɛ kye a maanle nu bade; na saa anwomanyunlu yɛ kɔkɔlɛ nwonlomɔ mangyee a, ɔdaye noko ɔkile kɛ maanle nu bayɛ kusuu kenle ko ne; noko akee bɛngola bɛnnwu edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bazi mekɛ ne anu a! <verse eid="MAT 16:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Menli ɛtane ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ ɛnlɛ diedi la ɛlɛbiza sɛkɛlɛneɛ ɛzulolɛ bie bɛavi anwomanyunlu, na bɛ sa ɛnrɛha sɛkɛlɛneɛ biala bieko ɛlɛ, kyesɛ nwanwanedeɛ ne mɔɔ bɛyɛle bɛhilele Dwona la.” Akee Gyisɛse gyakyile bɛ na ɔhɔle.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Mɔɔ bɛpɛle azule tandane ne la, ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hakyele kɛ bɛ rɛle ɛvi kɛ bɛkɛva aleɛ wɔ bɛ nwo.<verse eid="MAT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Gyisɛse hakyele bɛ kɛ; “Bɛnlea Falasiima ne nee Sadusiima ne mɔ boɛ! Ɔluakɛ bɛle mgbɔvonle.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Bɛdwenlenle kɛ kɛmɔ bɛ rɛle ɛvi kɛ bɛanva kpanwo la ati yɛɛ ɔleka ɛhye a.<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Ɛnee Gyisɛse noko ze deɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛdwenle nwolɛ a, ɔti ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “O bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛ diedi le ekyi a! Duzu ati a bɛ rɛle ɛbɔ bɛ nwo wɔ aleɛ mɔɔ bɛanva la anwo a? Bɛnrɛnyia ndelebɛbo ɛlɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Saa bɛngakye kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ne mɔɔ menli apenle nnu ne lile ɔ nee mgbokpoleka ne mɔɔ hale ɔ bo la a, <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />eza bɛngakye dolɔfo nsuu ne mɔɔ menli apenle nna ne lile ɔ nee ɔ nzi mgbokpoleka ne mɔɔ hale la ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Duzu ati a bɛkɛdwenle kɛ aleɛ nwo edwɛkɛ a ɛnee melɛka la ɛ? Na mesi zo bieko kɛ, ‘Bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ wɔ Falasiima ne nee Sadusiima ne mɔ anwo, ɔluakɛ bɛle mgbɔvonle.’”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Akee nzinlii bɛdele ɔ bo na bɛnwunle kɛ “mgbɔvonle” ne mɔɔ ɔhanle nwolɛ edwɛkɛ la kile Falasiima ne nee Sadusiima ne mɔ bɛ adalɛ ngilehile ne mɔ.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">“Ɛdwenle kɛ nwane a le Me?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse rale Felepe Sizalia la, ɔbizale ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a menli ka ye wɔ me nwo a?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Bie mɔ se ɛle Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne; bie mɔ se ɛle Yilaegya, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko se ɛle Gyɛlɛmaya anzɛɛ ngapezoma ne mɔ anu ko.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Akee ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Na bɛmɛ noko bɛdwenle kɛ mele nwane?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Saemɔn Pita buale ye kɛ, “Kelaese ne, Ngoanedievolɛ ne, damɛnlangoate Nyamenle ne Ara ne ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Nana Nyamenle ɛyila wɔ, Saemɔn, Dwona ara, ɔluakɛ, me Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu la mumua ne yɛɛ ɛye ɛhye ɛhile wɔ a, ɛhye ɛnvi sonla dasanli biala lɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na medame noko mese wɔ kɛ: Wɔmɔ a le Pita, bolɛ ne; na bolɛ ɛhye azo yɛɛ mebazi me asɔne sua ne a; na abɔnsam tumi kosooti ɛnrɛli zolɛ konim ɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Na mebava Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne Anlenkɛ ne azanvɛ ne meamaa wɔ; na anlenkɛ biala mɔɔ ɛkɛdo nu wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la, bɛbado nu zɔhane ala wɔ anwuma; anlenkɛ biala mɔɔ ɛkɛbuke ye wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo ɛke la, bɛbabuke ye zɔhane ala wɔ anwuma noko!”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Akee ɔbɔle ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɔkɔ kɛ bɛmmaka bɛkile awie biala kɛ yemɔ yɛɛ ɔle Ngoanedievolɛ ne a.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Ɔvi zɔhane mekɛ ne anu Gyisɛse bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔka ye edwɛkɛ ne mɔ kofee, mɔɔ fale Gyɛlusalɛm ɛhɔlɛ nwo, nee mɔɔ bazi ɔ nwo zo wɔ ɛkɛ ne la, kɛ ɔbanwu amaneɛ wɔ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne asa nu, na bɛahu ye, na ye kenle nsa ne azo bɛbadunwue ye bɛavi ewule nu maa yeara ngoane nu bieko.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Akee Pita vale ye hɔle ahanle ɔhɔdeanle ye. Ɔzele kɛ, “Anwuma ɛdua ɛhye. Ɛhye ɛnrɛzi ɛ nwo zo ɛlɛ!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Gyisɛse hakyile ɔ nwo wɔ Pita anwo ɛkɛ na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Wɔmɔ Abɔnsam, ɛvi me nwo ɛke kɔ! Ɛle ɛhane ɛzulole ɛmaa me. Wɔ adwenle ne le sonla ye nzuzuleɛ na ɔnvi Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye mumua ne Ye ɛkɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Akee Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ “Saa awie biala kulo kɛ ɔtoa me bo zo a, maa ɔkpo ɔdaye mumua ne ɔ nwo na ɔva ye meanubaka ne na ɔdoa me. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Ɔluakɛ awie biala mɔɔ kulo kɛ ɔdie ɔdaye mumua ne ye ngoane la ɔbaminli ye; na awie biala mɔɔ ɔlua me ti ɔkɛminli ye ngoane la, ɔ sa baha ye bieko. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Duzu nvasoɛ a wɔ zo a, kɛ ɛkɛnyia ewiade anu agyapadeɛ kosooti, na ɛkɛminli wɔ damɛnlangoate ngoane a? Duzu debie a sonle bolɛ mɔɔ nee damɛnlangoate ngoane sɛ a? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Ɔluakɛ Mame Sonla Ra ne, nee me anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ bara wɔ Egya anyunlunyia nu na yɛarabua sonla ko biala ndɛne mɔɔ fɛta ye gyima mɔɔ ɔlile la. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛgyi ɛke la, bie mɔ wɔ ɛke mɔɔ bɛnrɛzɔ ewule bɛnrɛnlea kolaa na bɛanwu Sonla Ra ne kɛ ɔlɛba wɔ ye Belemgbunlililɛ ne anu a.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse wɔ ye anyunlunyia nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Kenle nsia anzi, Gyisɛse vale Pita, Gyemise, nee ɔ diema Dwɔn hɔle boka tendenle koonwu bie azo. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Na mɔɔ bɛ nye gyi ɔ nwo la, ɔhakyile, na ɔ nyunlu dale kɛ sɛnzɛne na ye tɛladeɛ ne yɛle fufule nwohyee zɛhae.<verse eid="MAT 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Na nea, Mosisi nee Yilaegya rale ɛkɛ na bɛ nee ye dendɛle. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Pita zele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Awulae, yeyɛ moavolɛ kɛ yɛwɔ ɛke bie a! Saa ɛkulo a, mebabɔ kpɔda nsa, wɔ deɛ ko, Mosisi deɛ ko, yɛɛ Yilaegya noko deɛ ko.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Na mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo mɔɔ ɔka ɛhye la, amungu wienyi bie rahedale bɛ nwo zo, na ɛnelɛ bie vi amungu ne anu dendɛle zele kɛ, “Ɛhye a le me Ra ne mɔɔ mekulo ye na me nye sɔ ye la. Bɛdie ye.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dele ɛhye la, bɛ ahonle dule totohyia na bɛbutubutule bɛ nye aze. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Gyisɛse rale bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔvale ɔ sa ɔhanle bɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdwazo, bɛmmasulo!”<verse eid="MAT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Na mɔɔ bɛmaanle bɛ nye zo la, ɛnee Gyisɛse angomekye ala yɛɛ agyi bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne a.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Akee mɔɔ bɛvi boka ne azo bɛdwu aze la, Gyisɛse hyɛle bɛ kɛ bɛmmaka mɔɔ bɛnwu ye la bɛkile awie biala too kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛvi ewule nu ɔkɛdwazo la.<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ se kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ Yilaegya ba kolaa na Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɔdaye yeara ɛ?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛle nɔhalɛ. Ɔwɔ kɛ Yilaegya dumua ba na ɔbatoto debie biala pɛpɛ pɛpɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Na nɔhalɛ nu, yera dɛbadɛba bɔbɔ, na bɛannwu ye sonla holɛ, yemɔti menli dɔɔnwo ne ala noko yɛle ye ayɛkayɛkadeɛ. Na Mame, Ngoanedievolɛ ne noko mebanwu amaneɛ wɔ bɛ sa nu zɔhane ala.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Akee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dele ɔ bo kɛ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ a ɔlɛka la.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule boka ne ako abo la, ɛnee menli ekpunli ekpunli dɔɔnwo bie ɛlɛkendɛ bɛ. Na nrenyia bie rahotole Gyisɛse anyunlu ɛkɛ ne na ɔzele ye kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Yɛmenle, nwu me ra kakula nrenyia ye anwunvɔne, ɔluakɛ, ɔpɛ mgbutike, na ɔnwu amaneɛ dɔɔnwo, ɛhye ati ɔyɛ a ɔpɛ ye ɔto senle nu anzɛɛ nzule nu; <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />ɛhye ati me nee ye rale kɛ, wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛyɛ ye ayile, noko akee bɛangola.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “O, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛ nzo yɛse, na bɛnlɛ diedi biala a! Me nee bɛ ɛdɛnla ɛhɔdwu mekɛ boni bieko? Menzi bɛ nwo abotane mengɔndwu kenle nzu bieko? Bɛva ye bɛrɛlɛ me wɔ ɛke.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Akee Gyisɛse deanle abɔnsam ne mɔɔ wɔ kakula nrenyia ne nu la nu, na ɔvile ye nu ɔhɔle. Na ɔvi zɔhane mekɛ ne anu kakula nrenyia ne dele kpɔkɛ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Nzinlii, ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale Gyisɛse wɔ ahanle kɛ, “Duzu ati a yɛmɛ yɛangola yɛandu sunsum ɛtane ne yɛanvi ye nu a?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ diedi le ekyi la ati ɔ. Ɔluakɛ saa bɛlɛ diedi mɔɔ ye kpole bɔbɔ le kɛ dubinli ma la a, anrɛɛ bɛbahola bɛaze boka ɛhye kɛ, ‘Tu fi ɛkɛ kɔ nehane!’ na anrɛɛ ɔbadu noko, na debie biala ɛyɛlɛ ɛnrɛbo bɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Na sunsum ɛtane ɛhye ɛnrɛdu ɛlɛ kyesɛ ɔlua nzɛlɛlɛ nee ɛhɔnehyelɛ zo.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22-23" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee bɛtɛbɔ Galeli la, Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛbaye me bɛamaa menli mɔɔ bahu me la, na ye kenle nsa ne azo mebadwazo meara ngoane nu bieko.” Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ lile nyane totohyia wɔ bɛ ahonle ne mɔ anu.<verse eid="MAT 17:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule Kapɛnayɛm la, Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu adwuledievoma ne mɔ rale Pita anwo ɛkɛ ne na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛ menle ɛndua adwule anzɛɛ?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Pita buale bɛ kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, ɔtua.” Akee Pita hɔle sua ne anu kɛ ɔkaha yeahile Gyisɛse, mɔɔ fale ɛhye anwo la, na yeambuke ɔ nloa bɔbɔ yɛɛ Gyisɛse bizale ye ɛhye a: “Pita, kɛ wɔ adwenle se wɔ a? Nwane mɔ lɔ yɛɛ azɛlɛ ye azo arelemgbunli dielie bɛ maanle adwule fi a? Wɔ bɛ ezuavolɛ ɛkɛ, anzɛɛ wɔ maanle mɔɔ bɛho bɛva bɛ la nyɛvolɛ ɛkɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26-27" />Pita buale ye kɛ, “Nyɛvolɛ ne mɔ ɛkɛ ne ɔ.” Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Saa zɔhane a ɔde a, ɛnee ezuavolɛ ne lɛ fanwodi! Noko akee kɛmɔ yɛngulo kɛ yɛkɛha bɛ la ati, kɔ nyevile ne anloa lɔ na kɔdo koba, na buke fɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɛbalumua wɔahye ye la anloa anu, na ɛbanwu ezukoa mɔɔ sa yɛ mu nwiɔ yɛ adwule ne tua la. Fa kɔ na kɔdua maa bɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 17:26-27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛyɛ kɛ ngakula ngyikyi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Melɛ ne anu ɛdoavolema ne mɔ rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne rabizale ye kɛ: “Nwane a le kpole wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Gyisɛse vɛlɛle kakula ekyi ko ɔmaanle ɔradɛnlanle bɛ avinli <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />na ɔzele kɛ, “Kyesɛ bɛgyakyi bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ na bɛtoa Nana Nyamenle abo zo na bɛyɛ bɛ nwo kɛ ngakula la, yemɔ anrɛɛ bɛnrɛhɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ɛhye ati awie biala mɔɔ kɛbɛlɛ ɔ nwo aze kɛ kakula ɛhye la, yemɔ a le kpole wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Na bɛ nuhua ko biala noko mɔɔ kɛlie kakula mɔɔ le kɛ ɛhye la awawatuu wɔ me duma nu la ɛnee yelie medame mumua ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Na saa bɛ nuhua ko biala maa ngakula ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ die me di la nuhua biala minli ye diedi a, ɔbayɛ kpalɛ kɛ bɛkɛva ɛdibolɛ kpole bɛkɛkyekye ɔ kɔme na bɛkɛvuandi ye bɛkɛdo ye nyevile kunlu.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />“Munzule ɛha ewiade, ɔlua ye ɛtane bebelebe ɛhye mɔ ati. Ngyegyelɛ mɔɔ fa bɛ kɔ ɛtane nu la bara, na munzule ɛha sonla ne mɔɔ kɛmaa zɛhae ngyegyelɛ ne kɛra la. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ɛhye ati saa ɛ sa anzɛɛ ɛ gyakɛ maa ɛyɛ ɛtane a, pɛ ye to ye lɔ. Ɔluakɛ ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛva ɛ gyakɛ nee ɛ sa azinli ɛkɛhɔ anwuma maanle ne anu, tɛla kɛ ɛkɛva ɛ gyakɛ nee ɛ sa amuala ɛkɛhɔ abɔnsam sua zo la. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Yɛɛ saa ɛ nye maa ɛyɛ ɛtane a, tu ye to ye lɔ. Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛva ɛ nye ko ɛkɛhɔ anwuma maanle ne anu, tɛla kɛ ɛkɛva ɛ nye amu nwiɔ ɛkɛhɔ na bɛkɛvuandi wɔ bɛkɛdo Abɔnsam sua zo sendɔlɛra ne anu la. <verse eid="MAT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Bɛnlea boɛ na bɛanvo ngakula ngyikyi ɛhye mɔ anu ko bɔbɔ. Na mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu ɛhye mɔ bɛ anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ a lɛ adenle dahuu wolo Egya a. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Na Mame, Ngoanedievolɛ ne, membale kɛ mebalie menli mɔɔ bɛminli la ngoane.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Saa sonla lɛ mboane ɛya ko, na nuhua ko bɔbɔ minli a, duzu a ɔbayɛ a? Asoo ɔnrɛgyakyi abulahɔnla nee ngɔnla ne, na ɔnrɛhɔ awoka ne azo kɛ ɔkakpondɛ nuhua ko ne mɔɔ yeminli la ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Na saa ɔnwu ye a ɔdi nwolɛ fɛlɛko kpole kpalɛ ɔtɛla abulahɔnla nee ngɔnla ne mɔɔ bɛamminli la. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Zɔhane ala yɛɛ ɔnle Egya ɛhulolɛdeɛ kɛ ngakula ɛhye mɔ anu ko bɔbɔ kɛminli a.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fa kyɛ awie mɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Saa ɛ diema nrenyia yɛ ɛtane tia wɔ a, kɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne fealera nu na fa ye ɛtane ne to ɔ nyunlu. Saa ɔtie na ɔdi nyane wɔ ye ɛtane ne anwo a, ɛnee ɛ sa ɛha ɛ diema ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Na saa yeamkponle a, ɛnee fa sonla ko anzɛɛ menli nwiɔ boka ɛ nwo na sia kɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne bieko, na kile edwɛkɛ ne anu kile alasevolɛ ɛhye mɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Saa mɔɔ ɔka la ala a ɔka, anzɛɛ saa yeamkponle kɛ ɔkɛdie a, ɛnee fa wɔ edwɛkɛ ne kɔdo asɔnema ne anyunlu, na saa asɔnema ne bua edwɛkɛ ne na ɛdi benle, na ɔ nee wɔ ɛnrɛyɛ adwenle a, ɛnee akee asɔnema ne ɛye ye ɛvi bɛ avinli. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Na mese bɛ kɛ debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛkyekye ye wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la ɛnee bɛkyekye ye wɔ anwuma; yɛɛ debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛtulu nu wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la, ɛnee bɛtulu nu wɔ anwuma lɔ noko.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Mese bɛ bieko kɛ, saa menli nwiɔ yɛ ko wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo mɔɔ fale debie ɛbizalɛ nwo la a, Egya mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la bayɛ amaa bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ɔluakɛ, ɛleka mɔɔ menli nwiɔ anzɛɛ nsa kɛyia nu wɔ me duma nu ti la, mebada ɛkɛ ne wɔ bɛ avinli.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Akee Pita rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, fane nyɛ yɛɛ menva adiema mɔɔ kɛvo me la ɛtane mengyɛ ye a? Fane nsuu ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ! Fane abulasuu mɔnwo nsuu!”<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ belemgbunli bie mɔɔ zuzule kɛ ɔbu ye mgbonda pɛpɛ pɛpɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ɔlua ɛhye azo bɛ nee ye kakɛtuavoma ne mɔ ko mɔɔ tua ye kakɛ pɔne mgbe nsa la rɛlɛle ye. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Kɛmɔ yeangola ye tua la ati, belemgbunli ne zele kɛ bɛdɔne ɔdaye mumua ne, nee ɔ ye nee ɔ mra, nee debie biala mɔɔ ɔle ye la na bɛva bɛdua ye kakɛ ne.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />“Na nrenyia ne hotole wɔ belemgbunli ne anyunlu, na ɔbɔle ɔ ti aze, na ɔkpale kyɛlɛ ɔzele kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, nyia me nwo abotane, na mebadua ye kosooti.’<verse eid="MAT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />“Akee belemgbunli ne nwunle ye anwunvɔne, ɔdwulale ye na ɔvale ye kakɛ ne kosooti ɔhyɛle ye.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Na mɔɔ nrenyia ne vile belemgbunli ne ɛkɛ ne vindele la, ɔ nee nrenyia bie mɔɔ tua ye kakɛ pɔne ɛya nsuu la yiale; ɔzɔle ɔ kominza na ɔzele ye kɛ ɔdua ye kakɛ ne ɛkɛ ne ala ɔmaa ye.<verse eid="MAT 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />“Na nrenyia ne hotole ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ ne na ɔbodole ye ɔzele ye kɛ ɔmaa ye mekɛ ekyii. Ɔbodole ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Nyia abotane, na mebadua meamaa wɔ.’<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />“Na ye kakɛdavo ne amkponle. Ɔmaanle bɛhyele nrenyia ne na bɛdole ye efiade kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛwie ye kakɛ ne amuala tua la.<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />“Mɔɔ nrenyia ne agɔnwo mɔ nwunle mɔɔ ɛzi la bɛhɔdoanle ye bɛhilele bɛ menle ne, <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />na belemgbunli ne vɛlɛle nrenyia ne mɔɔ yeva ye kakɛ ne yehyɛ ye la na ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Wɔmɔ sonvolɛ atiakunlutane! Menvale wɔ kakɛ kpole ne mengyɛle wɔ, ɔboalekɛ, ɛkpale me kyɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Duzu ati a wɔmɔ wɔannwu ɛ gɔnwo mɔ anwunvɔne, kɛmɔ mame menwunle wɔ anwunvɔne la ɛ?’<verse eid="MAT 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />“Akee belemgbunli ne nyianle ɛya na ɔvale nrenyia ne ɔhɔdole ye efiade kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛhola ɔkɛdua kakɛ ne amuala la. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Na nɔhalɛ, mese bɛ kɛ, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ Egya mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la bayɛ amaa bɛ nuhua ko biala mɔɔ yeanva ɔ diema ɛtane yeangyɛ ye wɔ ye ahonle nu la.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse wiele edwɛkɛ ɛhye mɔ ka la, ɔvile Galeli na ɔpɛle Azule Dwɔdan ne na ɔziale ɔ nzi ɔhɔle Dwudiya. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne ala doale ye, na ɔyɛle nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛnde kpɔkɛ la ayile.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛkye ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Falasiima bie mɔ rabizebizale ye edwɛkɛ zɔle ye nleanle. Bɛbizale ye kɛ: “Anzɛɛ ɔfa mɛla adenle nu kɛ awie kɛbɔ ɔ ye ewuole ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛngenga Nyamedwɛkɛ ne ɔ? Bɛhɛle ye wɔ nu kɛ, alumua ne, Nana Nyamenle bɔle nrenyia nee raalɛ, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5-6" />ɔti ɔwɔ kɛ nrenyia gyakyi ɔ ze nee ɔ nli, na ɔ nee ɔ ye bɛyɛ ko bɛkɔ awieleɛ. Menli nwiɔ ne bayɛ nwonane ko, mɔɔ bɛnle nwiɔ bieko a, na emomu ko! Ɔti mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛha ɛbɔ nu la, mmamaa sonla dasanli biala kpakye nu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Akee bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a akee Mosisi se saa nrenyia bɔ ɔ ye ewuole a ɔwɔ kɛ ɔkɛlɛ ewuolebɔlɛ kɛlata ala ɔkɔmaa ye a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ ahonle ɛsesebɛ ne mɔ ati yɛɛ Mosisi maanle adenle kɛ bɛbɔ bɛ mraalɛ ewuole a, na emomu, alumua ne ɛnee ɔnle zɔ. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Na meka meahile bɛ kɛ awie biala mɔɔ kɛbɔ ɔ ye ewuole, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔtɛbɔle huhunli ɛbɛla biala na ɔkɛgya raalɛ fofolɛ la, ɔto agyalɛ ɛzɛkyelɛ mɛla ne.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Gyisɛse ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ akee zele ye kɛ, “Saa ewuolebɔlɛ ɛnle agyalɛ nu ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee noko ɔnle kpalɛ kɛ awie kɛgya raalɛ!”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Tɛ menli ne amuala a kɛhola kɛli zɛhae edwɛkɛ ɛhye azo a.” Eza ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ, “Kyesɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye ɔboa bɛ la ala. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Bie mɔ wɔ ɛkɛ a bɛanva raalɛ ɛgyalɛ nwo anwosesebɛ bɛanwo bɛ, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko le awuliravolɛ dɛba vi ɛkolɛ ne anu, yɛɛ ɔlua Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ati bie mɔ noko ɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛgya mraalɛ. Bɛmaa awie biala mɔɔ kɛhola la, ɛlie zɛhae edwɛkɛ ɛhye ɛdo nu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Bɛvale ngakula bie bɛrɛlɛle Gyisɛse kɛ ɔva ɔ sa ɔ gua bɛ ti zo na ɔzɛlɛ ɔmaa bɛ. Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ deanle menli mɔɔ vale ngakula ne mɔ rale la, na bɛzele kɛ, “Bɛmmagyegye ye.”<verse eid="MAT 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmaa ngakula ngyikyi ne mɔ ɛbikye me, na bɛmmasi bɛ adenle. Ɔluakɛ kɛ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne de la ɛne.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Na ɔvale ɔ sa ɔguale bɛ ti zo na ɔyilale bɛ kolaa na akee yeavi ɛkɛ ne yeahɔ.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nrenyia sukoavolɛ ne ziale ɔ nzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Kenle ko awie bie rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ rabizale ye kpuyia kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ kpalɛ, duzu a meyɛ a menwɔnyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati yɛɛ ɛfɛlɛ me Kilehilevolɛ a? Awie ko ala a le kpalɛ a, na yemɔ a le Nyamenle. Saa ɛkpondɛ kɛ ɛnyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la a, ɛnee di mɛla ne mɔ azo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Nrenyia ne bizale ye kɛ, “Mɛla ne mɔ anu boni ɔ?” Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Mmaku sonla, mmasɛkye agyalɛ, mmawua, mmadi daselɛ adalɛ, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />maa ɛ nye ɛzɔ ɛ ze nee ɛ nli, na kulo ɛ gɔnwo kɛ ɛdawɔ ɛ nwo la!”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Kpavolɛ ne buale ye kɛ, “Medi zɛhae mɛla ne mɔ ko biala azo dahuu. Na duzu debie bieko a ɛha mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ meyɛ a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Saa ɛkulo kɛ ɛdi munli bɔkɔɔ a, kɔ na kɔdɔne wɔ debie biala mɔɔ ɛlɛ ye la, na fa ezukoa ne maa ehyiavolɛma, na ɛ sa baha agyapadeɛ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu; na akee bɛla na bayɛ me ɛdoavolɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Mɔɔ kpavolɛ ne dele ɛhye la, ɔlile nyane totohyia wɔ ye ahonle nu na ɔhɔle, ɔluakɛ ɔle sukoavolɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Akee Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, nɔhalɛ nu, mese bɛ kɛ, ɔyɛ se ɔmaa sukoavolɛ kɛ ɔkɛhɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Mesi zo bieko kɛ, ‘Ɔnyɛ se ɔmmaa afunlumu kɛ ɔkɛwole aguyia tokule nu, tɛla kɛ sukoavolɛ kɛhɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Edwɛkɛ ɛhye zinle ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo; yemɔti bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnee akee nwane yɛɛ bɛbahola bɛalie ye ngoane a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Gyisɛse nleanle bɛ koonwu na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhye yɛse kpalɛ kpalɛ maa sonla dasanli; noko akee wɔ Nana Nyamenle anye zo debie biala: ɛnza Ye yɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Akee Pita zele ye kɛ, “Awulae, yɛgyakyi debie biala na yɛradoa wɔ. Na duzu nvasoɛ a yɛbanyia ye wɔ zo a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, ‘Wɔ Egya belemgbunli maanle fofolɛ ne anu, mɔɔ Mame, Ngoanedievolɛ ne mebadɛnla me anyunlunyia belemgbunli ebia ne azo wɔ Belemgbunli maanle ne anu la, bɛdabɛ noko, me ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɛbadɛnlɛdɛnla arelemgbunli mbia bulu nee nwiɔ azo na bɛabua Yizilayɛ abusua eku eku bulu nee nwiɔ ne ndɛne. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na awie biala mɔɔ kɛkpo ye aako, ɔ mediema mrenyia, ɔ mediema mraalɛ, ɔ ze, nee ɔ nli, ɔ ye, ɔ mra, anzɛɛ ye agyapadeɛ, na ɔkɛdoa me la ɔbanyia nwole nvasoɛ ɛya mɔnwo mɔnwo, na eza yeanyia damenlangoate ngoane mɔɔ ɔnle awieleɛ a. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Na alumuama bali amozi; yɛɛ amozi amra noko balumua.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Adawu bieko mɔɔ kile Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu la ɛne. “Kenle ko nwonlomɔ mangyee bie, aakomenle bie hɔle hɔbɔle gyimayɛvoma ɛkpa kɛ bɛhɔva ye egyinli nu aleɛ bɛmaa ye. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Ɔ nee gyimayɛvoma ne mɔ lile ɔ nloa kɛ kenle ko biala ɔbadua bɛ kakɛ pɔne nsuu; ɔ nee bɛ wiele ngyehyɛleɛ ɛhye la, akee ɔzoanle bɛ ɔmaanle bɛhɔle ye egyinli nu lɔ.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />“Bɛbɔle kɛyɛ dɔne ngɔnla nwonlomɔ ne, na ɔpɛ nu wɔ sua ne mɔɔ bɛbɔ menli ɛkpa wɔ nu la anwo la, ɔnwunle mrenyia bie wɔ ɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛkponde gyima bɛayɛ a, <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />ɛhye ati ɔvale bɛdabɛ noko ɔ nee bɛ hɔle ye egyinli ne anu lɔ, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ ɔbadua bɛ kakɛ biala mɔɔ fɛta la wɔ gyima ne awieleɛ wɔ nɔsolɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ewia ne noko ɔvale gyimayɛvoma ɔhɔle nu, yɛɛ mɔɔ bɛbɔle ewiazo kɛyɛ dɔne nsa la ɔvale gyimayɛvoma bieko noko ɔhɔle ye egyinli ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />“Bɛbɔle nɔsolɛ dɔne nnu la eza ɔhɔle sua zo bieko, na ɔnwunle mrenyia dɔɔnwo bie mɔɔ bɛnlɛ debie biala bɛyɛ na bɛgyigyi ye ngoko ngoko nee nwiɔ nwiɔ la na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, ‘Duzu ati a bɛtɛyɛle gyima biala ɛnɛ a?’<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />“Bɛbuale ye kɛ, ‘Ɔluakɛ awie biala ɛtɛbabɔle yɛ ɛkpa.’ Nrenyia ne zele bɛ kɛ, ‘Ɛnee bɛhɔ na bɛhɔboka menli mɔɔ wɔ me egyinli nu lɔ la.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Nɔsolɛ ko ne ala ɔzele kakɛtuavo kpanyinli ne kɛ ɔvɛlɛ gyimayɛvoma ne mɔ na ɔdua bɛ kakɛ, ɔbɔ ye menli mɔɔ li amozi la anwo zo ɔhɔkpula alumuama ne anwo zo. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Na mɔɔ bɛduale menli mɔɔ bɛbɔle bɛ ɛkpa dɔne nnu la kakɛ bɛwiele la, bɛ nuhua ko biala nyianle pɔne nsuu. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ɔti mɔɔ menli mɔɔ bɛbɔle bɛ ɛkpa alumua kpalɛ ne la rale kɛ bɛbalie bɛ ahatualɛ la, bɛdwenlenle kɛ bɛbanyia dɔɔnwo. Noko akee bɛdabɛ noko bɛduale bɛ pɔne nsuu nsuu.<verse eid="MAT 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11-12" />“Bɛvale ɛya na bɛdendɛle bɛ nzo abo bɛzele kɛ, ‘Menli ɛhye mɔ yɛle gyima dɔnehwele ko ala, noko akee ahatualɛ ko ne ala mɔɔ ɛvale ɛmaanle yɛdayɛ mɔɔ yɛyɛ gyima dedee yeradwu nɔsolɛ wɔ ewia kpole ɛhye anu la yɛɛ wɔva wɔmaa bɛ a.’<verse eid="MAT 20:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Nrenyia ne buale bɛ nuhua ko kɛ, ‘Agɔnwolɛ, metɛyɛle wɔ ɛtane biala! Wɔanlie wɔando nu kɛ ɛkɛyɛ gyima kenle ko ne amuala ɛkɛlie pɔne nsuu ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Die, na kɔ. Ɔle me ɛhulolɛ kɛ menwɔdua bɛ muala kakɛ ko; <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />anzɛɛ menlɛ adenle kɛ menwɔva me ezukoa mɔɔ medame mekulo la menwɔhyɛ ɔ? Anzɛɛ me atiakunlukɛnlɛma ne yɛ wɔ ɛya ɔ?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Na kɛ ɔde ala la ɛne, kɛ amozi amra balumua, na alumua amra noko ali amozi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔhyia kɛ kpanyinli sonle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse kɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la, ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne mɔ hɔle ahanle, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />na ɔhanle edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bazi ɔ nwo zo la ɔhilele bɛ zɛ: “Bɛnlea, yɛlɛkɔ Gyɛlusalɛm, na bɛbaye Me bɛamaa azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima mɔɔ ɛha la, na bɛabua me ewule fɔlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Na bɛbava me bɛamaa Wulomuma Arane ne; bɛbazi me amgbu na bɛabila me empele na akee bɛabɔ me meanubaka nu, na ye kenle nsa ne azo, Mebadwazo meara ngoane nu bieko.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Akee Zɛbɛdi amra mrenyia ne mɔ, Gyemise nee Dwɔn, nee bɛ nli mumua ne rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ bɛrahotole ye, na ɔzɛlɛle debie ɔvile Gyisɛse ɛkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Gyisɛse bizale raalɛ ne kɛ, “Duzu debie a ɛkpondɛ a?” Ɔbuale ye kɛ, “Mekulo kɛ ɛbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ kɛ ɛbamaa me mra mrenyia nwiɔ, ɛhye mɔ adɛnla ɛ sa zo, ko wɔ wɔ fema zo, yɛɛ ko noko wɔ wɔ bɛne zo wɔ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Gyisɛse buale ye zele kɛ, “Ɛnze deɛ mɔɔ ɛlɛbiza la!” Gyisɛse hakyile ɔ nye nleanle Gyemise nee Dwɔn na akee ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo bɛbahola bɛanlo bɔnyema kɔpo ne mɔɔ mebanlo nu la anu ɔ?” Bɛbuale bɛzele kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, yɛbahola!”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, bɛbahola ‘bɛanlo me kɔpo’ ne anu bɔkɔɔ; na me sa fema zo nee me sa bɛne zo ɛdɛnlanlɛ wɔ arelemgbunli mbia ne mɔ azo ɛdeɛ, yemɔ menlɛ nwolɛ tumi biala kɛ menwɔva menwɔbɔ bɛ ɛwɔkɛ, na emomu bɛbava bɛamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ me Ze ɛziezie ɛmaa bɛ la.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Na mɔɔ ɛdoavolɛma bulu ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛha la dele mɔɔ Gyemise nee Dwɔn ɛbiza la, bɛnyianle ɛya wɔ mediema nwiɔ ne anwo.<verse eid="MAT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Gyisɛse vɛlɛle bɛ ɔmaanle bɛ muala bɛrale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne, na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛze kɛ maanle maanle arelemgbunli ne mɔ fa atisesebɛ yɛɛ bu bɛ maanle ne mɔ a, yɛɛ arelemgbunli ngyikyi ne mɔ bɛdabɛ noko bɛmia bɛdabɛ mɔɔ wɔ bɛ bo la. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Na wɔ bɛ avinli ɛdeɛ, ngakyile ekyii wɔ nu. Awie biala mɔɔ ɔkpondɛ kpole anzɛɛ bedevinli yeayɛ wɔ bɛ nu la ɔwɔ kɛ yɛ bɛ akɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Na awie biala mɔɔ ɔkulo kɛ ɔdi bɛ nyunlu moa wɔ bɛ nu la, ɔbayɛ bɛ akɛlɛ nee bɛ kanranli. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Ɔwɔ kɛ bɛkakyi bɛ sa anloa kɛ me deɛ ne la, ɔluakɛ Mame, Ngoanedievolɛ ne, meamba kɛ memaa bɛazonle me, na emomu membazonlenle, na meava me ngoane meabɔ azu meamaa menli.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vile Gyɛleko sua kpole ne azo bɛkɔ la, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala doale bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ɛnee mrenyia anyezinliravolɛma nwiɔ bie dede adehanle ne, na mɔɔ bɛdele kɛ Gyisɛse ɛlɛba araze la, bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛmenle, Devidi Ara, nwu yɛ anwunvɔne!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Na menli dɔɔnwo ne bɔle bɛ nloa kɛ bɛyɛ ngungoonwu; na emomu, akee bɛdeɛdeanle nu kpole ne ala.<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32-33" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse radwule ɛleka mɔɔ bɛdede la, ɔgyinlanle adenle ne avinli na ɔvɛlɛle bɛ ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Duzu a bɛkulo kɛ meyɛ memaa bɛ a?” Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, yɛkulo kɛ yɛnwu debie!”<verse eid="MAT 20:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Gyisɛse akunlu yelɛyelale ye wɔ bɛ nwo, ɔti ɔvale ɔ sa ɔhanle bɛ nye ne mɔ, na ndɛndɛ ne ala bɛnwunle debie, na akee bɛdoale ye.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛvo Gyɛlusalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bikyele Gyɛlusalɛm, na bɛdwule Bɛtefagye sua ne mɔɔ wɔ Boka Ɔlivi ne azo la, ɔzoanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu nwiɔ wɔ namule ne mɔɔ wɔ bɛ nyunlu nehane la azo.<verse eid="MAT 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ “Mɔɔ ɔka ekyii na bɛadwu sua ne azo la, bɛbanwu afunlumu mɔɔ bɛhenda ye la kɛ ɔ nee ɔ ra bɛgyi ɛkɛ ne. Bɛzanyi bɛ na bɛva bɛ bɛrɛle me. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Na saa awie biala biza bɛ nwolɛ edwɛkɛ a, bɛze kɛ, ‘Awulae hyia bɛ nwo,’ na edwɛkɛ biala noko ɛnrɛzi wɔ nwolɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Bɛyɛle ɛhye amaa mɔɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle dole ɛkɛ dɛbadɛba la ali munli kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Bɛha bɛhile Zayɔn amra. Bɛnlea, bɛ belemgbunli ne ɛlɛba bɛ nwo ɛkɛ, ɔle mɛlɛbɛnwoazenli, na ɔde afunlumu, nee afunlumu mɔɔ soa debie la ralɛ anwo zo!”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ɛdoavolɛma nwiɔ ne yɛle mɔɔ Gyisɛse hanle la, <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />na bɛvale nane ne mɔ bɛrɛlɛle ye, na bɛvale bɛ adɛladeɛ ne mɔ bɛguale afunlumu ralɛ ne azo kɛ ɔdɛnla zo ɔha. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Na bie mɔ noko mɔɔ wɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne anu la vale bɛ adɛladeɛ ne mɔ sesɛle adenle ne anu lumuale ɔ nyunlu, na bie mɔ noko bubule mrɛlakɛ nwɔhanle bɛ lumuale ɔ nyunlu.<verse eid="MAT 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Akee menli dɔɔnwo ne bie mɔ lile ɔ nzi, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko lile ɔ nyunlu, na bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Nana Nyamenle ɛyila Belemgbunli Devidi Ara ne!” “Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ!” “Nyamenle Sonla ɛra ɛke!” “Nyilalɛ ɛha Awulae!” “Nyilalɛ ɛha Nyamenle wɔ anwuma!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Na mɔɔ ɔvole Gyɛlusalɛm la sua ne azo amuala yɛle begyebegye zɛhae. Na bɛbizale kɛ, “Nwane a le ɛhye?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Na menli dɔɔnwo ne buale kɛ, “Kapezonli Gyisɛse, mɔɔ vi Nazalɛte mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Gyisɛse hɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, na ɔdule guadivoma ne mɔ, na ɔbubule ezukoa senzavolɛma ne mɔ ɛkponle ne mɔ na ɔdudule menli mɔɔ tɔne aabule la kpɔda ne mɔ.<verse eid="MAT 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Nyamedwɛkɛ ne kile kɛ me Asɔne Sua Kpole ne le nzɛlɛlɛ ɛleka, noko akee bɛmɛ bɛhakyi ye bɛyɛ ye nwulema sua.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Na anyezinliravolɛma nee abuburavolɛma rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu na ɔyɛle bɛ ayile. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Na mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ nwunle nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ, na bɛdele kɛ ngakula ngyikyi ngyikyi ne bɔbɔ ɛlɛteɛdea nu aze kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha Devidi Ara ne” la, bɛ adwenle yɛle bɛ sesakaa zɛhae, na bɛnyianle ɛya na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Asoo ɛnde mɔɔ ngakula ɛhye mɔ ɛlɛka la ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhɛe!” Na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛtɛkengale Nyamedwɛkɛ ne ɛlɛ ɔ? Ɔluakɛ, bɛse ‘Ngakula bɔbɔ bayeyɛ ye!’”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Akee ɔziale ɔhɔle Bɛtani, na ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɔlale a.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Nwonlomɔ ne mɔɔ ɔsia yeahɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la, ɛhɔne hunle ye, <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />na ɔnwunle dɔma baka bie kɛ ɔgyi adenle ne foa ko. Ɔhɔle nwolɛ kɛ ɔkanlea kɛ saa ɔkɛnyia ma ne bie ɔkɛli a, na nya ngome a ɔnwunle ye a. Akee ɔzele baka ne kɛ, “Mmaso ma bieko!” Na yeangyɛ biala dɔma baka ne nwosonle.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ɔyɛle ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ azibɛnwo totohyia kpalɛ na bɛbizale kɛ, “Kɛ ɔyɛle mɔɔ dɔma baka ne nwosonle ɛkɛ ne ala ɛ?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Gyisɛse akee zele bɛ kɛ “Nɔhalɛ, saa bɛlɛ diedi mɔɔ le kpundii kpalɛ, na bɛnzu kpolera a, anrɛɛ bɛbahola bɛayɛ ninyɛne mɔɔ le kɛ ɛhye nee mɔɔ tɛla ye la bɔbɔ. Anrɛɛ bɛbahola bɛaze Boka Ɔlivi ne kɛ, ‘Tudu kɔgua Nyevile nu,’ na ɔbayɛ zɔ noko. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Na debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛlua diedi zo bɛkɛbiza wɔ asɔneyɛlɛ nu la, bɛ sa baha ye.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwuuma mgbanyima ɛzɔ Gyisɛse ɛnlea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Mɔɔ ɔziale ɔhɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu na ɔlɛkilehile debie la, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ bie rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Nwane tumi nu yɛɛ ɛlua ɛlɛdi zɛhae gyima ne a? Na nwane bɔbɔ yɛɛ maanle wɔ tumi ne a?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛdumua bɛye kpuyia ko mɔɔ mebabiza bɛ la anloa a, medame noko mebaye bɛ deɛ ne anloa meamaa bɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Gyisɛse akee bizale bɛ kɛ, “Nienwu yɛɛ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne vi a? Nyamenle yɛɛ zoanle ye, anzɛɛ tɛ Ye ɔ?” Bɛzule bɛ nwo kpolera dedee na bɛzele kɛ, “Saa yɛka kɛ ‘Nana Nyamenle yɛɛ zoanle ye a’ akee ɔbabiza kɛ, ɛnee duzu ati a akee yɛanlie Dwɔn yɛanli a? <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Na saa yɛanga kɛ Nana Nyamenle yɛɛ zoanle ye a, menli ne kɛdu kɛfonyia yɛ nwo zo, ɔluakɛ, bɛ kosooti bɛdwenle kɛ ɔle kapezonli.” Ɛhye ati akee bɛbuale ye bɛzele kɛ “Yɛnze!”<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Na Gyisɛse noko zele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee medame noko menrɛye bɛ kpuyia deɛ ne anloa.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Na kɛ bɛ adwenle se bɛ wɔ ɛhye anwo ɛ? Nrenyia bie mɔɔ lɛ mralɛ mrenyia nwiɔ la zele nuhua koatee ne kɛ, ‘Me ra, kɔ na kɔyɛ gyima wɔ ɛya nu lɔ ɛnɛ.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Ɔbuale ye kɛ, ‘Menrɛhɔ,’ na nzinlii akee ɔhakyile ye adwenle na ɔhɔle. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Akee selɛ ne zele ɔ ra ekyi ne kɛ, ‘Ɛdawɔ noko kɔ!’ na ɔdaye noko ɔzele ɔ ze kɛ, ‘Egya, mede, mebahɔ!’ Noko akee yeangɔ.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />“Mediema nwiɔ ɛhye mɔ anu boni a lile ɔ ze edwɛkɛ zo a?” Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Koatee ne ɔ.” Akee Gyisɛse hilele ye adawu ne abo hilele bɛ: “Nɔhalɛ, ɛtanevolɛma nee mraalɛ mɔɔ bɔ huhunli ɛbɛla la balumua adwu Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu kolaa na bɛmɛ bɛadwu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ɔluakɛ, Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne zele bɛ kɛ bɛnlu bɛ nwo na bɛkpo Nana Nyamenle abo zo, noko akee bɛanyɛ wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɛtanevolɛma nee mraalɛ mɔɔ bɔ huhunli ɛbɛla la yɛle la. Na mɔɔ bɛnwunle ɛhye mɔ bɔbɔ kɛ ɔlɛsisi la, bɛmɛ bɛkpole kɛ bɛkɛnlu bɛ nwo, na ɛhye noko ati bɛanlie bɛanli.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />“Akee bɛdie adawu ɛhye ɛ: Azɛlɛmenle bie yɛle ye nwanye tola na ɔhyele nwolɛ ɛhane, na ɔzile kpɔda ɔmaanle sinzavolɛ ne mɔɔ banlea zo la, na akee ɔvale ɔmaanle ɛkpavoma mɔɔ bayɛ na ɔ nee bɛ ahyɛ la, na akee ɔdule ɔhɔdɛnlanle maanle gyɛne nu.<verse eid="MAT 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />“Na mekɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛte ma dwule la, ɔzoanle ye menli mɔɔ gyi ɔ gyakɛ anu la wɔ ɛkpavoma ne anwo lɔ kɛ bɛhɔlie ye afoa nu deɛ bɛrɛlɛ ye. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Na ɛkpavoma ne mɔ tetale ye menli ne mɔ ɛkɛ ne, bɛbole ko, na bɛhunle ko, na bɛzile ko noko awolɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />“Akee ɔzoanle ye menli ne ekpunli kpole kpalɛ ko kɛ bɛhɔlie ye afoa nu deɛ bɛrɛlɛ ye, noko akee ɔla dɛba ne ɛdeɛ ne anwo. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Amozi ye, azɛlɛmenle ne zoanle ɔdaye mumua ne ɔ kunlu ralɛ nrenyia, na ɔdwenlenle kɛ amgba bɛkɛbu ye bie.<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />“Na mɔɔ ɛkpavoma ɛhye mɔ nwunle nrenyia ne ara ne kɛ ɔlɛba la, bɛzele bɛ nwo kɛ, ‘Se koliagya ne a ɛlɛba la; bɛrɛla, bɛmaa yɛhu ye na yɛ sa aha ye agyapadeɛ ne!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ɔti bɛhwilele ye aze bɛvile nwanye tola ne anu na bɛhunle ye.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Akee saa azɛlɛmenle ne ba a duzu debie a bɛdwenle kɛ ɔbava yeayɛ ɛkpavoma ɛhye mɔ a?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ buale kɛ, “Ɔbamaa zɛhae menli amumuyɛvoma ɛhye mɔ awu ayɛkayɛkadeɛ ewule, na yeava nwanye tola ne yeamaa menli mɔɔ kɛva ye afoa nu deɛ kɛmaa ye ndɛndɛ la.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Akee Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛtɛkengale ye wɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ ne anu ɛlɛ kɛ, ‘Bolɛ ne mɔɔ suasivoma ne kpole ye la, yemɔ yɛɛ akee rayɛle ayia zo bolɛ mɔɔ akee hyia tɛla awolɛ ne mɔ amuala la ɔ?’ Ɛhye le Awulae nyɛleɛ; na ɔyɛ nwanwane wɔ yɛ nye zo!<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Mɔɔ meka meahile bɛ la a le kɛ, bɛbalie Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne bɛavi bɛ ɛkɛ ne, na bɛava bɛamaa maanle mɔɔ kɛva Nana Nyamenle ye ɛya ne anu ninyɛne ne afoa nu ɛdeɛ kɛmaa ye la. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Awie biala mɔɔ kɛfofo zɛhae nɔhalɛ bolɛ ye azo la ɔbabubu, na bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ ɔkɛbubu ɔkɛgua bɛ nwo zo la bɛbazande kɛ munlutu la.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ nwunle kɛ bɛ nwo edwɛkɛ a Gyisɛse ɛlɛka kɛ bɛmɛ a bɛle ɛkpavoma ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛwɔ ye adawu ne anu la, <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />bɛnyianle adwenle kɛ bɛkye ye, noko akee bɛzulole kɛ bɛkɛhye ye ɔlua menli dɔɔnwo ekpunli ekpunli ne ati, ɔluakɛ, bɛliele Gyisɛse bɛdole nu kɛ ɔle kapezonli.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Anwuma Maanle ne sɔhovolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1-2" />Gyisɛse bule mrɛlɛ dɔɔnwo vale hilele kɛ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne si de la. “Ndonwo a le ɛhye” Ɔse, “Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ belemgbunli bie mɔɔ liele atɔfolɛ kpole bie maanle ɔ ra nrenyia la. <verse eid="MAT 22:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Ɔdole ɛsalɛ ɔvɛlɛle menli dɔɔnwo, na mɔɔ ɛkponledolɛ ne dwule zo la, ɔzoanle ye ɛzoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛhɔbɔ awie biala amaneɛ kɛ yedwu mekɛ mɔɔ awie biala fa ba a. Na bɛ muala bɛkpole kɛ bɛkɛra! <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Ɛhye ati ɔzoanle ye sonvolɛma ne mɔ bie noko kɛ bɛhɔze bɛ kɛ, ‘Debie biala di munli; mehu me nlankɛ nee me nyɛmoa. Ɛhye ati bɛha bɛ nwo bɛrɛla atɔfolɛ ne abo!’<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />“Na menli ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔdole ɛsalɛ ɔvɛlɛle bɛ la zelele ye ala na bɛhɔle bɛ gyima ɛyɛlɛ, ko hɔle ye ɛya nu, ko noko hɔle hɔnleanle ye efiade; <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />bie mɔ noko bolɛ ye ɛzoavolɛma ne mɔ kpalɛ na bɛguale bɛ nyunlu nyiane aze, na bɛhunle bie mɔ bɔbɔ.<verse eid="MAT 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />“Akee belemgbunli ne nyianle ɛya; na ɔzoanle ye sogyama ne ɔmaanle bɛhɔhunle ahodiawu ɛhye mɔ, na bɛyelale bɛ suakpole ne wee kpalɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Akee ɔzele ye sonvolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, ‘Atɔfolɛ ɛkponledolɛ mekɛ ne ɛdwu, na menli noko mɔɔ mendole ɛsalɛ menvɛlɛle bɛ la anwo ɛmfɛta zɛhae anyunlunyia ɛhye. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Ɔti bɛhɔ awɔlɔne ne mɔ azo na bɛvɛlɛ awie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛnwu ye la bɛmaa ɔrɛla ɛkponledolɛ ɛhye abo.’<verse eid="MAT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />“Yemɔti sonvolɛma ne mɔ yɛle ɛhye, na bɛvɛlɛle awie biala mɔɔ bɛnwunle ye la, kpalɛ nee ɛtane muala; na ɛkponledolɛ ne abo yɛle nyɛvole ngome. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Na mɔɔ belemgbunli ne rale kɛ ɔbanlea nyɛvolɛ ne mɔ la, ɔnwunle nrenyia bie mɔɔ yemɔ ɔnwula atɔfolɛ tɛladeɛ ne mɔɔ bɛvale bɛmaanle ye la a. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Ɔbizale ye kɛ, ‘Agɔnwolɛ, na kɛ ɔyɛ mɔɔ wɔmɔ ɛnwula atɔfolɛ tɛladeɛ ne bie ɛ?’ Na nrenyia ne dɔle mumule.<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />“Akee belemgbunli ne zele ye boavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, ‘Bɛkyekye ɔ sa nee ɔ gyakɛ na bɛvuandi ye bɛdo awozinli kabikabi ne anu, ɛlɛka ne mɔɔ ɛzunlɛ nee egyelehwinlɛ wɔ la.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Ɔluakɛ, bɛvɛlɛle menli dɔɔnwo, na nuhua ekyi bie yɛɛ bɛkpale bɛ a.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Akee Falasiima ne mɔ yiale nu vale adwenle kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na bɛ sa aha Gyisɛse bɛahye ye wɔ ye ɛdendɛlɛ nu la. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ɔlua zo bɛzoanle bɛ menli ɛdeɛ ne bie nee belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo asa azo ne mɔ bie kɛ bɛhɔbiza ye zɛhae kpuyia ne: “Yɛmenle, yɛze kɛ wɔmɔ ɛdi nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ, na ɛkilehile nɔhalɛ ne na ɛnzulo ɔ nzi edwɛkɛ biala, ɛnzulo ɛhwee yɛɛ ɛnzulo ɛnyelɛ noko. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Akee ka kile yɛ, ɔfa adenle nu kɛ yɛkɛdua adwule yɛkɛmaa Siza anzɛɛ ɔnva adenle nu ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Gyisɛse nwunle bɛ adwenle na ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛmɛ Adalɛ nabalabama! Nwane a bɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛfa bɛ agyiba kpuyia ɛhye mɔ bɛyɛ ye koasea a? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Bɛva adwule ezukoa ne bie bɛhile me.” Na bɛvale kapɛlɛ ko bɛmaanle ye.<verse eid="MAT 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Nwane nvoninli a wɔ zo la? Yɛɛ nwane duma a wɔ nvoninli ne abo a?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Siza ɛdeɛ ɔ.” Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Saa ɔle zɔhane ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee mɔɔ ɔle Siza ɛdeɛ la, bɛva bɛmaa ye, yɛɛ debie biala noko mɔɔ ɔle Nana Nyamenle ɛdeɛ la, bɛva bɛmaa ye.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ye nyelebɛnloa ne yɛle bɛ azibɛnwo totohyia na ɔlua zo bɛvile ɛkɛ ne bɛhɔle.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Na kenle ko zɔhane ala, Sadusiima ne mɔ bie, mɔɔ se kɛ ewuledwazolɛ ɛnle ɛkɛ la, rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ na bɛrabizale ye kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Awulae, Mosisi hanle kɛ, saa nrenyia mɔɔ gya raalɛ la wu na yeangyakyi mralɛ a, ɔwɔ kɛ ɔ diema nrenyia gya kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne amaa bɛ ngakula ne mɔ asa aha nrenyia ne mɔɔ wule la agyapadeɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Saa ɔle zɔhane ɛdeɛ a ɛnee yɛlɛ abusua bie mɔɔ mediema mrenyia nsuu a wɔ nu la. Mɔɔ lumua lɛ gyale raalɛ ne na ɔ nee ye anwo yɛɛ ɔwule a, ɛhye ati ye kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne yɛle ɔ diema ne mɔɔ li ɔ nzi la deɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Adiema ɛhye noko nee ye anwo yɛɛ ɔwule a, na raalɛ ne yɛle bɛ diema ne mɔɔ doa bɛ la aye, na bɛlɛ ye zɔ dedee la ɔyɛle bɛdabɛ mediema nsuu ne ko biala aye. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Na akee raalɛ ne ɔdaye ɔwule. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ɛnee nwane a bagya zɛhae raalɛ ne wɔ ewudwazo mekɛ ne anu a? Ɔluakɛ mediema nsuu ɛhye nuhua ko biala gyale ye bie!”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛvo, ɔluakɛ bɛnze Nyamedwɛkɛ ne nee Nana Nyamenle ye tumi ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ɔluakɛ, wɔ ewudwazo ne anu agyalɛ biala ɛnle ɛkɛ; awie biala bayɛ kɛ anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔɔ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu la. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Na mɔɔ fale ewudwazo ne anwo la, bɛtɛkengale mɔɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ ne ka ye wɔ Nwolɛ la ɔ? Bɛngakye edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle hanle zile bɛ nyunlu kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Mame a le Ebileham, Ayezeke nee Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne la ɔ?’ Nana Nyamenle ɛnle mɔwuamra Nyamenle, emomu ɔle menli mɔɔ de aze la bɛ Nyamenle.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne nyianle ye nyelebɛnloa ne mɔ anwo ahomeka totohyia <verse eid="MAT 22:33" /><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34-35" />noko akee tɛ Falasiima ne mɔ ɔ! Mɔɔ bɛdele kɛ ye nyelebɛnloa ne ɛdudu Sadusiima ne mɔ ahonle la, bɛdwenlenle bɛdabɛ bɛ kpuyia ɛdeɛ fofolɛ nwo mɔɔ bɛfa bɛabiza ye a.<verse eid="MAT 22:34-35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />Bɛ nuhua ko mɔɔ le lɔya la bizale kɛ: “Awulae, mɛla ne boni a hyia kpole kpalɛ wɔ Mosisi mɛla ne mɔ anu a?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Fa wɔ ahonle ne, nee wɔ sonlabaka ne nee wɔ adwenle ne amuala kulo wɔ Awulae Nana Nyamenle.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38-39" />Ɛhye a le mɛla ne mɔɔ lumua na eza ɔhyia kpole kpalɛ a. Mɔɔ tɔ zo nwiɔ mɔɔ ɔdaye ɔhyia na ɔdaye noko ɔngakyi kpole biala la a le ɛhye: “Kulo ɛ gɔnwo kɛ ɛdawɔ ɛ nwo la.” <verse eid="MAT 22:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Mɛla ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛha la amuala nee ngapezoma ne mɔ ɛdeɛ ne mɔ amuala abo vi mɛla nwiɔ ɛhye mɔ anu. Di ɛhye mɔ ala azo na ɛbanwu kɛ ɛlɛdi mɛla ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛha la azo.<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Akee mɔɔ Falasiima ne mɔ bɔle ye mgbɔlɛka yiale la, ɔbizale bɛ kpuyia ɛhye: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Na Ngoanedievolɛ ne noko ɛ? Nwane ara a le ye?” Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Devidi Ara ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee akee duzu ati a Devidi, ɔlua Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne anwosesebɛ zo ɔtendɛ la ɔvɛlɛle ye ‘Awulae’ ɛ? Ɔluakɛ Devidi zele kɛ,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“ ‘Nana Nyamenle zele me Awulae kɛ, Tɛnla me sa fema ne azo, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔva wɔ akpɔvolɛ amuala menwɔwula ɛ gyakɛ abo la.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Na saa Devidi vɛlɛle ye ‘Awulae’ a, ɛnee kɛ ɔyɛ mɔɔ ɔkola ɔyɛ ɔ ra ɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Bɛannyia nwolɛ nyelebɛnloa biala bɛammaa ye. Na ɛhye anzi, awie biala bɔbɔ ambiza ye kpuyia bieko.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Adenle mɔɔ Falasiima ne mɔ vonle la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Akee Gyisɛse zele menli dɔɔnwo ne nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Dwuuma mgbanyima ɛhye mɔ nee Falasiima ɛhye mɔ a de Mosisi ebia ne azo a! <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Zɔhane ati bɛli mɔɔ bɛkɛha la biala azo! Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ bɛkɛli debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛha la azo, na emomu, bɛmmanea bɛ nyɛleɛ ne mɔ azo bɛyɛ bie. Ɔluakɛ bɛnli mɔɔ bɛka bɛkile bɛ kɛ bɛyɛ la azo. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bɛfa adesoa mgbole mgbole bɛsoa bɛ, mɔɔ bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɔbɔ bɛmbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛzɔ nu a.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />“Debie biala mɔɔ bɛyɛ la le ɛnyelɛ zo yekile ala. Bɛfa nzɛbɛ mɔɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ wɔ nu la bɛkendɛhenda bɛ awane ne mɔ azo, bɛyɛ kɛ asɛɛ bɛ nwo te, na bɛyɛ bɛ patakali ne mɔ huhuhaa. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Na bɛkulo mgbanyinli tɛnlabelɛ wɔ ɛkponledolɛ bo, ɔ nee mgbanyinli mbia zo ɛdɛnlanlɛ wɔ ayialeka ne! <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Bɛkulo gua zo ahyebizalɛ, nee kɛ menli kɛzi kɛvɛlɛ bɛ ‘Rabbi’ nee ‘Yɛmenle’ la! <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Na bɛmɛ, bɛmmamaa awie biala fɛlɛ bɛ zɔhane, ɔluakɛ, Nyamenle angomekye a le bɛ ‘Rabbi’ anzɛɛ bɛ Kilehilevolɛ a, na bɛ muala bɛle mediema. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Bɛmmafɛlɛ awie biala wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo ɛke kɛ ‘Egya’, ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la angomekye yɛɛ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfɛlɛ ye zɔhane a. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Bɛmmamaa bɛfɛlɛ bɛ ‘Yɛmenle mɔ’, ɔluakɛ, sonla ko ala a le bɛ menle a, na yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne.<verse eid="MAT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />“Wɔ kpoleyɛlɛ ne wɔ kɛsi mɔɔ ɛsonle menli la anu. Saa ɛkulo kɛ ɛyɛ kpole a, ɛnee yɛ ɛ nwo akɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Ɔluakɛ awie biala mɔɔ kɛmemaa ɔ nwo zo la bɛkɛbɛlɛ ye aze; yɛɛ biala noko mɔɔ kɛbɛlɛ ɔ nwo aze la bɛkɛmaa ye zo anwuma anwuma.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13-14" />“Munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ Falasiima ne mɔ, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ asɔne mgbanyima mɔɔ bɛha la. Adalɛ nabalabama! Bɛnrɛmaa menli mɔɔ ɛha la ɛnrɛhɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu, yɛɛ bɛdabɛ mumua ne noko bɛnrɛhɔ nu bie ɛlɛ. Noko akee bɛyɛ nzɛlɛlɛ ndendenle bagua nu wɔ awɔlɔne ne mɔ azo kɛ asɛɛ bɛ nwo te, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ bɛfoa kunlavolɛma bɛfi bɛ aako ne mɔ anu la. Adalɛ nabalabama! <verse eid="MAT 23:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Ɛhɛe, munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ adalɛ nabalabama. Ɔluakɛ bɛfa adenle tendendenlenle bie anu a bɛkakyi ɛtanevolɛ ko a, na akee bɛahakyi ye bɛayɛ ye abɔnsam sua zo ara fane nwiɔ kɛmɔ bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛde la. <verse eid="MAT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Anyezinliravoma adekilevoma! Munzule ɛha bɛ! Ɔluakɛ bɛ ngyehyɛleɛ a le kɛ saa ɛfa ‘Nana Nyamenle Asɔne Sua’ ne ɛka ndane a ɔnyɛ ɛhwee, bɛkola bɛbulu zo, na emomu saa bɛfa ‘nvutuke ne mɔɔ wɔ Asɔne sua’ ne anu la bɛka ndane a yemɔ ɔbadɔ bɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Anyezinliravolɛma ahoasea! Nvutuke ne nee Asɔne Sua ne boni a hyia kpalɛ a, anzɛɛ Asɔne Sua ne mɔɔ te nvutuke ne anwo la ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Na bɛmɛ bɛse saa ɛfa ‘azukponle ne’ ɛka ndane a, ɛkola ɛbulu zo, na emomu saa ɛfa ‘ahyɛlɛndeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ gua azukponle ne azo’ la ɛka ndane a, yemɔ ɔtɔ ɛ nwo zo! <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Anyezinliravolɛma ahoasea! Boni a hyia kpalɛ a, ahyɛlɛndeɛ ne mɔɔ gua azukponle ne azo la, anzɛɛ azukponle ne mɔɔ maa ahyɛlɛndeɛ ne anwo yɛ nwuanzanwuanza la ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Saa ɛfa ‘Azukponle’ ne ɛka ndane a, ɛnee wɔva azukponle ne nee debie biala mɔɔ gua zo la amuala wɔha ndane, <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />yɛɛ saa ɛfa ‘Asɔne Sua’ ne ɛka ndane a, ɛnee wɔva Asɔne Sua ne nee Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ de nu la wɔha ndane ne. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Na saa ɛfa ‘anwuma anwuma’ ɛka ndane a, ɛnee wɔva Nana Nyamenle ye Belemgbunli Ebia ne nee Ɔdaye mumua ne wɔha ndane.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Ɛhɛe, munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ Falasiima ne mɔ, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ, adalɛ nabalabama! Ɔluakɛ debie biala mɔɔ awie biala kɛnyia ye, la bɔbɔ tola nu aleɛ, bɛkyɛ nu bulu na bɛdie bɛ deɛ ko ne, noko akee bɛbu bɛ nye bɛgua ninyɛne mɔɔ hyia mɔɔ le kɛ pɛpɛlilɛ nee anwunvɔnezelɛ nee diedi la azo. Ɛhɛe, ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdie, na emomu, ɔnle kɛ bɛgyakyi ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ hyia la zɔhane ala. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Anyezinliravolɛma adekilevoma! Bɛtwe akowule ye mogya ne bɔkɔɔ na akee bɛame afunlumu ye mumua ne.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ Falasiima ne nee bɛdabɛ asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ, adalɛ nabalabama! Bɛkpuda kanrɛlɛ ne anwo bɔkɔbɔkɔ zɛhae, na akee bɛagyakyi ɔ kunlu ne mɔɔ evinli ne wɔ la bɛazie ye ɛkɛ, ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ mɛlɛbɛlavoma nee adidikpokuvoma ne mɔ veɛvea a. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Falasiima anyezinliravolɛma! Anrɛɛ bɛlumua bɛwowo kanrɛlɛ ne akunlu ne kolaa, na kanrɛlɛ mumua ne ɛleka biala bayɛ bɔkɔbɔkɔ zɛhae.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ Falasiima ne mɔ, nee bɛdabɛ asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ! Bɛle kɛ azɛka mɔɔ bɛhwi nwolɛ ngɛnlɛma na bɛ nuhua a avunli mbowule nee ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛzekye la gua la. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Bɛyɛ bɛ nwo kɛ asɛɛ bɛ nwo te la, noko akee wɔ bɛ nu ɛdeɛ, adalɛbɔlɛ nee amumuyɛyɛlɛ kosooti ɛyi bɛ tɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29-30" />“Ɛhɛe, munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ Falasiima ne mɔ, nee bɛdabɛ asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ, adalɛ nabalabama! Ɔluakɛ, bɛsi ngakyelɛdeɛ bɛmaa ngapezoma ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛ ze mɔ hunle bɛ la, na bɛfa felawɔse bɛgua menli mɔɔ sonle Nyamenle mɔɔ bɛ ze mɔ hunle bɛ la azɛka ne mɔ azo, na bɛaze kɛ, ‘Saa yɛ mekɛ zo a anrɛɛ yɛnrɛyɛ mɔɔ yɛ ze mɔ yɛle la bie.’<verse eid="MAT 23:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />“Ɛhye kile kɛ bɛlɛdi daselɛ kɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛhunle kapezoma ne mɔ la amra a le bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Ɔti akee bɛva bɛ gyakɛ, na bɛlɛyɛ bɛ nyɛleɛ ɛtane ne mɔ bie. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Nwɔlɛ Bɔna mralɛ! Kɛ bɛkɛyɛ na bɛanli fɔlɛ wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ne anu, na bɛangɔ abɔnsam sua zo ɛ?<verse eid="MAT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />“Ɛhye ati, bɛnlea, mebazoa ngapezoma nee nrɛlɛbɛvolɛma, nee kɛlɛvolɛma wɔ bɛ ɛkɛ, na bɛbahu bɛ nuhua bie mɔ, na bɛabɔ bɛ meanumbaka nu; bɛbabila bɛ nuhua bie mɔ noko empele wɔ bɛ ayiasua ne mɔ anu, na bɛawula bɛ ateetee bɛavi sua zo bɛahɔ sua zo, <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />amaa mogya tenlene mɔɔ bɛha bɛgua azɛlɛ ye azo amuala la agua bɛ nwo zo, ɔbɔ ye tenlenenli Ebulu mogya zo mɔɔ kɔkpula Bɛlakaya ara Zɛkalaya, mɔɔ bɛhunle ye wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu wɔ azukponle ne nee anwoziezielɛleka ne bɛ avinli la mogya ne mɔ anwo zo. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nɔhalɛ, bɛbava ɛvolɛ ɛya ɛhye amuala anu ndɛnebualɛ ne amuala bɛakpolo ɛlɔne ɛhye ati.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“O Gyɛlusalɛm, Gyɛlusalɛm, wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛku ngapezoma ne mɔ, na ɛkpa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛzoa bɛ wɔ ɛ nwo la awolɛ a! Fane nyɛ a mengulole kɛ menwɔboɔboa ɛ mra anloa kɛmɔ akɔlɛ ɛrɛladane kuohua ɔ mra anloa wɔ ɔ ndɛba abo ɔkeda bɛ nwo zo a. Noko akee bɛangulo. Bɛammaa me adenle. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Na yemɔ noko a kɛkala bɛ sua ne ɛdɔ mgbane la. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Na mese bɛ kɛ, bɛnrɛnwu me bieko ɛlɛ, kɔkpula kɛ bɛkɛyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ bɛkɛlie ahenle ko ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛzoa ye wɔ bɛ lɔ la.”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse hanle kenle bie edwɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse vi Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu ɔfinde la, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale kɛ bɛbava ye bɛahɔ akpɔsa wɔ Asɔne sua ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Azua ɛhye mɔ amuala babubu dwɔkɔdwɔkɔ, mɔɔ bolɛ ko bɔbɔ ɛnrɛla ko bɔbɔ anwo zo a!” Na mɔɔ ɔde Boka Ɔlivi ne ndololeɛ ne anu la ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ nzinlii bizale ye kɛ:<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />“Kenle nzu a ɛhye bazi a? Duzu sɛkɛlɛndeɛ a bahile mekɛ mɔɔ ɛbava wɔazia wɔara bieko nee ewiade awieleɛ a?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmamaa awie biala bɛlɛbɛla bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Ɔluakɛ menli dɔɔnwo badwazo kɛ bɛdabɛ a bɛle Ngoanedievolɛ ne a, na bɛbamaa menli dɔɔnwo aminli nɔhalɛ adenle ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Saa bɛte kɛ konle konle ɛbɔ ɔ bo a, ɛnee ɛhye ɛngile me ɛzialɛ ne; ɛhye mɔ bazi, noko akee ɛnee awieleɛ mekɛ ne ɛtɛdwule. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Maanle maanle badwazo bɛ gɔnwo mɔ akɔme zo, na ɛhɔne nee azɛlɛ ɛkpusulɛ asisi wɔ ɛleka dɔɔnwo. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Noko akee ɛhye mɔ amuala bayɛ amaneɛnwunlɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ bara la mɔlebɛbo ala.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Ɔlua me ti, bɛbayɛ bɛ ayɛkayɛkadeɛ na bɛahu bɛ na eza bɛakpɔ bɛ wɔ ewiade anu ɛlɛka biala, <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />na bɛ nuhua bie mɔ dɔɔnwo ne ala bazia ahɔ ɛtane nu na bɛayeye bɛ nwo ngoko bɛamaa na bɛakpɔ bɛ nwo. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Na ngapezoma adalɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala bara na bɛamaa menli dɔɔnwo aminli nɔhalɛ adenle ne mɔɔ bɛlua nu la. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Ɛtaneyɛlɛ bayɛ dɔɔnwo wɔ ɛleka biala, na yeaha menli dɔɔnwo bɛ ɛhulolɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ ye la aze. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛhɔ zo bɛkɛli nɔhalɛ ne bɛkɛhɔ awieleɛ ne la yɛɛ bɛbalie bɛ ngoane a.<verse eid="MAT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />“Na bɛbabɔ Belemgbunli maanle ne anwo Edwɛkpa ne nolo bɛahile ewiade amra amuala amaa maanle maanle kosooti ade, na akee nzinlii, awieleɛ mekɛ ne ara.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ɛhye ati, saa bɛnwu deɛ ɛzulolɛ ne mɔɔ kapezonli Daneɛle hanle nwolɛ edwɛkɛ la kɛ ɔgyi ɛleka ne mɔɔ anwo te la a (kengavolɛ ne ɛde ɔ bo) <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />ɛnee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ Dwudiya la ɛnriandi ɛhɔ Dwudiya awoka ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ bɛ abenlana nu la mmaka kɛ bɛkaboɔboa bɛ nwo kolaa na bɛariandi bɛahɔ Dwudiya awoka ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ ɛbɔ nu la mmaka kɛ bɛsia bɛahɔ bɛ azua nu bɛahɔva bɛ ndanlɛ<verse eid="MAT 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />“Na mraalɛ mɔɔ bɛva ɛkolɛ, nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛvievia nlɔma na bɛlɛmaa bɛ nyɛfonlɛ wɔ zɔhane kenle ne anu la bɛ gyakɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Na bɛzɛlɛ, na bɛ ɛnriandinlɛ ne anyia ɛyɛlɛyɛlɛ mekɛ, anzɛɛ yeanzi wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne anu. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Na mekɛ zɔhane, anwongyelelɛ kpole mɔɔ ɔvi ewiade mɔlebɛbo ne bakpula kenle ne bie ɛtɛbale ɛlɛ, na eza ɔnrɛra ɛlɛ la, bara.<verse eid="MAT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />“Na saa nɔhalɛ nu, bɛampɛ mekɛ ne azo sikalɛ a, yemɔ dasanli biala ɛnrɛnyia ngoane. Na ɔlua menli mɔɔ Nyamenle ɔdaye yekpa bɛ la ati, bɛbapɛ mekɛ ne azo sikalɛ.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Akee saa awie se bɛ kɛ, ‘Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɛra, na ɔwɔ ɛke, anzɛɛ bɛnwu ye wɔ ɛke, anzɛɛ ɔwɔ namule ne mɔɔ wɔ bɛ nyunlu la azo a,’ bɛmmadie bɛdi. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Ɔluakɛ, Kelaese adalɛma, nee ngapezoma adalɛma badwazo, na bɛayɛ nwanwane ninyɛne dɔɔnwo, amaa saa ɔkɛyɛ boɛ bɔbɔ a, Nana Nyamenle ye menli mɔɔ yekpa bɛ bɔbɔ la bɛbabɛlɛbɛla bɛ muala. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mekakye bɛ, bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Ɛhye ati saa awie se bɛ kɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɛzia ɛra, na ɔwɔ ɛsɛlɛ ne azo a, bɛmmapele kɛ bɛkɔ bɛahɔnlea. Anzɛɛ saa bɛka kɛ ɔvea ɛlɛka bie a bɛmmadie bɛdi! <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kɛmɔ maanle nu fedevede memeamemea wɔ anwomanyunlu, na ɛsɛlɛmanye tudu sɛnzɛne aduduleɛ kɔtɔ sɛnzɛne adɔleɛ la, zɔhane noko ala yɛɛ medame Sonla Ra ne, me maleɛ ne noko bayɛ a, <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Na ɛlɛka biala mɔɔ debie funli la la, ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ mgbɔtɛ ne mɔ bahuohua bɛ nloa a.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Wɔ anwubɛnyunlu ɛhye mɔ kosooti anzi kenle ko demua ne ala, sɛnzɛne ne bayɛ awozinli kabii, na siane ne noko ɛnrɛda, na nwɔlɛra ne mɔ vi anwuma badudu aragua aze, na anwuma tumi kosooti bawozo gyigyi gyigyi zɛhae ala.<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />“Na ɛhye mɔ amuala anzi, amozii, Sonla Ra ne maleɛ ne anwo sɛkɛlɛneɛ bavinde avi anwomanyunlu, na awolɛyelɛ kpole kpalɛ bara wɔ aleɛabo amuala. Na ewiade maanle maanle kosooti banwu kɛ melɛ tumi nee anyunlunyia totohyia mevi anwuma amungu ne anu melɛba. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Na mebazoa me anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ meamaa bɛabɔ aweɛne totohyia ne anu; na bɛbaboɔboa me menli ne mɔ mɔɔ meyɛ bɛ nzonlɛ la anloa bɛavi maanle ti nee maanle bo nee anwuma anwuma.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Akee bɛva ɛzukoalɛdeɛ bɛvi dɔma baka ne anu. Saa ye ngane ne mɔ wula nya a, ɛnee bɛze kɛ wuluwulu mekɛ anzɛɛ wawaa ɛbikye. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Zɔhane ala yɛɛ saa bɛnwu kɛ ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ ɛbɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɔsisi a, ɛnee bɛnwu ye kɛ me maleɛ ne ɛbikye, bɔbɔ, megyi bɛ nlenkɛ ne mɔ anloa a. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Na akee amozi ye, mekɛ ɛhye bara ye awieleɛ.<verse eid="MAT 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />“Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne nee aze bapɛ nu aze, na me nloa edwɛkɛ ɛdeɛ, yemɔ ɔnrɛpɛ nu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Na awie biala noko ɛnze mekɛ ne nee dɔnehwele holɛ ko ne mɔɔ awieleɛ ne bara a, anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ bɔbɔ ɛnze. Kyɛkyɛ, anzɛɛ Nyamenle Ra ne bɔbɔ. Egya angomekye a ze a.<verse eid="MAT 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37-38" />“Na kɛmɔ Nowa mekɛ zo ɔyɛle la, zɔhane ala a Sonla Ra ne ɛralɛ noko bayɛ a. Kɛmɔ kenle ne mɔɔ li azuyilɛ ne anyunlu, bɛlile aleɛ aleɛ, na bɛnlonle, bɛyɛle agyalɛ nwuanzanwuanza bɛhɔkpulale kenle ne mɔɔ Nowa hɔwolole ɛlɛne-sua ne anu, <verse eid="MAT 24:37-38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />na bɛannwu ye dedee kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ azule ne yile na ɔrapianle bɛ kosooti ɔhɔle la, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ Sonla Ra ne ɛralɛ ne bayɛ a.<verse eid="MAT 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />“Menli nwiɔ bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛlɛyɛ gyima wɔ ɛya nu la, bɛbava ko na bɛagyakyi ko ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Mraalɛ nwiɔ bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛti ɛdɔkɛ la bɛbava ko, na bɛagyakyi ko ne.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Ɛhye ati bɛnlea boɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛnze kenle ne mɔɔ bɛ Awulae bava ara a.<verse eid="MAT 24:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />“Bɛnwu ye kɛ saa aako ne amenle ze aledwolɛ nu mekɛ mɔɔ awule kɛva kɛra a anrɛɛ ɔnrɛgyakyi ye sua ɔnrɛmaa bɛnrɛrabu ye bɛnrɛwua ye. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Zɔhane ala a ɔwɔ kɛ bɛsiezie bɛ nwo wɔ me arɛlevilɛnu ɛralɛ ne anwo a.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Asoo ɛle Awulae sonvolɛ mɔɔ ɛdi nɔhalɛ na ɛze nrɛlɛbɛ ɔ? Kakye kɛ meva gyima mewula ɛ sa kɛ ɛnlea me aako ne azo, na ɛmaa me ngakula ne mɔ aleɛ alehyenlɛ biala. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Saa mesia meba na mebato wɔ kɛ ɛgua gyima ne mɔɔ menvale memaanle wɔ la azo a, nyilalɛ dɔɔnwo ɛha wɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Mebava nɔhalɛdivoma ɛhye mɔ meazie me debie biala mɔɔ melɛ bɛ la ati!<verse eid="MAT 24:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />“Saa ɛdi ɛtane na ɛse ɛ nwo kɛ, ‘Me Awulae ɛtɛnyianle ɛtɛbale’, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />na ɛbɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɛyɛ ɛ gɔnwo mɔ sonvolɛma ne amumuyɛ, na wɔabɔ wɔ abɔfo wɔanlo wɔ nza wɔabo a, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />wɔ Awulae bara arɛlevilɛ nu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛ nye ɛnla, la, <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />na yeabila wɔ mbaka, na yeabua wɔ ndɛne yeaboka adalɛ nabalabama ne mɔ anwo, na ɛkɛ ne a ɛzunlɛ nee egyelehwinlɛ bara a.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Anwuma Maanle ne anwo adawu ngakyile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ avoanlema bulu bie mɔɔ bɛvale bɛ ngɛnlaneɛ kɛ bɛkayia atɔtolɛ nrenyia ne la. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2-4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2-4" />Na bɛ nuhua nnu ala a nwunle nrɛlɛbɛ na bɛvale nwole bɛguale bɛ ngɛnlaneɛ deɛ ne mɔ anu a, na nnu ne mɔɔ hale la yɛle ahoasea na bɛ rɛle vile bɛ nwo.<verse eid="MAT 25:2-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5-6" />“Ɔti mɔɔ atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne hyɛle wɔ ye ɛralɛ nu la, bɛ kosooti bɛdedale kɛ bɛdie bɛ ɛnwomenle bie kɔkpula alevinli mu nwiɔ avinli; na mɔɔ bɛdele ɛdeanlɛ kɛ, ‘Atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne ɛlɛba! Bɛrɛla na bɛrayɛ ye akoaba! la, bɛ muala bɛ nye dele.’<verse eid="MAT 25:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7-8" />“Ngakula mraalɛ ne mɔ amuala dwazole na bɛyɛle bɛ ngɛnlaneɛ ne mɔ boɛ. Na akee ngakula mraalɛ nnu ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ nwole ne bie la kpale ɛhendeɛ ne mɔ kyɛlɛ kɛ bɛmaa bɛ bɛ deɛ ne bie, ɔluakɛ bɛ ngɛnlaneɛ ne mɔ ɛnee ɛlɛnu.<verse eid="MAT 25:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />“Na bɛbuale bɛ kɛ, ‘Yɛnlɛ ye dɔɔnwo. Ɔti bɛhɔ gua ne azo na bɛhɔdɔ bie.’<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />“Na melɛ mɔɔ bɛhɔle la, atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne rale, na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛboɔboa bɛ nwo bɛwie la nee ye hɔle atɔfolɛ ɛkponledolɛ ne abo, na akee bɛdole anlenkɛ ne anu.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Nzinlii, mɔɔ avoanle nnu ne ziale rale la, bɛhale anlenkɛ nzi, bɛvɛlɛle na bɛzele atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, buke ye anlenkɛ ne!’<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />“Na ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, ‘Bɛhɔ nehane! Mekɛ ne ɛkpa nwolɛ! Menze bɛ hweledede!’<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />“Ɔti bɛzinza, na bɛboɔboa bɛ nwo, ɔluakɛ, bɛnze kenle ne nee dɔnehwele holɛ ko ne mɔɔ mebazia meara a.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Bieko, Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le kɛ adawu ne mɔɔ fale nrenyia bie mɔɔ ɛlɛtu adenle ahɔ maanle gyɛne bie anu, na ɔvɛlɛle ye sonvolɛma ne mɔ amuala bɛyiale, na ɔbɔle bɛ bosea kɛ bɛva bɛzi kongo wɔ melɛ mɔɔ yemɔ yehɔ la.<verse eid="MAT 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />“Na ɔmaanle bɛ nuhua ko talɛnte nnu, ko noko nwiɔ, yɛɛ ko noko ko, kɛmɔ bɛ muala bɛ anwosesebɛ de la, na akee ɔdule ye adenle ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Nrenyia ne mɔɔ asa hanle talɛnte nnu ne la ndɛndɛ ne ala hɔle, na ɔvale ɔhɔlile gua, na ɔnyianle nwolɛ nvasoɛ talɛnte nnu bieko. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ mɔɔ nyianle talɛnte nwiɔ ne la, noko nyianle nwolɛ nvasoɛ talɛnte nwiɔ a.<verse eid="MAT 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />“Na nrenyia ne mɔɔ nyianle talɛnte ko ne la, yemɔ ɔhɔle na ɔhɔvunvunle azɛlɛ nwo, na ɔvale ɔ menle ne ezukoa ne ɔziele ɛkɛ ne twele.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Nzinlii mɔɔ melɛ ne hɔle bie la, bɛ menle ne ziale rale na ɔvɛlɛvɛlɛle bɛ kɛ bɛrabu ye ezukoa ne anwo mgbonda bɛmaa ye. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɔmaanle ye talɛnte nnu ne la yɛle mgbonda talɛnte bulu maanle ye.<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />“Ɔ menle ne yele ye ayɛlɛ kpole wɔ ye gyima kpalɛ ne mɔɔ ɔyɛle la anwo na ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Sonvolɛ kpalɛ, wɔli nɔhalɛ wɔ ezukoa ekyi ɛhye mɔɔ menvale memaanle wɔ la anwo, ɛhye ati mebava gyima mgbole dɔɔnwo meawula ɛ sa. Yɛ gyima fɛlɛko ɛhye mɔɔ meva mewula ɛ sa nu la.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Nzinlii nrenyia ne mɔɔ nyianle talɛnte nwiɔ ne la ɔdaye ɔrabule ye mgbonda ɛdeɛ ne, na ɔzele kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, ɛmaanle me talɛnte nwiɔ kɛ menva menli gua, na menyia ye mɔnwo bɔbɔ.’<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />“Ɔ menle ne yɛle ye mo na ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Ɛle sonvolɛ kpalɛ na eza ɛdi nɔhalɛ. Wɔli nɔhalɛ wɔ ezukoa ekyi ɛhye mɔɔ menvale memaanle wɔ la anwo, ɛhye ati mebamaa wɔ dɔɔnwo.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24-25" />“Akee nrenyia ne mɔɔ nyianle talɛnte ko ne la rale, na ɔrazele ye kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, kɛmɔ meze kɛ ɛ ti anu yɛ se la ati, na mesulo kɛ ɛkɛsisi me wɔ me nvasoɛ mɔɔ mebanyia ye la anwo la ati, menvunle kuma na menvale wɔ ezukoa ne menveale nu; ɔti wɔ ezukoa ne ɛne, die!’<verse eid="MAT 25:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Na ɔ menle ne buale ye kɛ, ‘Nrenyia atisesebɛvo! Sonvolɛ mgbovonle! Kɛmɔ ɛze kɛ mebaza wɔ mealie wɔ nvasoɛ ne la, <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />anrɛɛ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛnwu nrɛlɛbɛ ɛfa me ezukoa ne ɛkɔsie ezukoaziele ɛleka ne, amaa meanyia mpaefoa ekyi bɔbɔ wɔ zolɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Bɛza nrenyia ɛhye bɛlie ye ezukoa ne na bɛva bɛmaa nrenyia ne mɔɔ lɛ talɛnte bulu ne la. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ɔluakɛ mɔɔ kɛnlea mɔɔ bɛkɛva bɛkɛmaa ye la boɛ la, yemɔ yɛɛ bɛbava dɔɔnwo bɛamaa ye, na yeanyia dɔɔnwo kpalɛ a. Na nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛnli nɔhalɛ la, yemɔ ekyii ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔnea zo la, bɛbaza ye bɛalie. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Akee bɛbavuandi sonvolɛ sonlamgbane ɛhye mɔɔ anwo ɛnlɛ nvasoɛ la bɛado ye awozinli kabikabi ne anu: ɛleka ne mɔɔ ɛzunlɛ nee egyelehwinlɛ wɔ la.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Na mekɛ mɔɔ mame, Sonla: Ra ne mebara wɔ me anyunlunyia nu, na me anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ amuala boka me nwo la, yɛɛ akee mebadɛnla me anyunlunyia belemgbunli ebia ne azo a. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Bɛbaboɔboa maanle maanle kosooti anloa wɔ me nyunlu. Mebakpakyekpakye bɛ nu kɛmɔ boaneneavolɛ kpakyekpakye mboane fi mbɔkye nu la; <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />na akee mebava mboane ne mɔ meagua me sa fema zo, na meava mbɔnkye ne mɔ noko meagua me sa bɛne zo.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />“Akee mame, Belemgbunli ne, mebaze bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ me sa fema zo la kɛ, ‘Bɛmɛ mɔɔ me Ze ɛyila bɛ a, bɛrɛla bɛrava belemgbunli maanle ne mɔɔ bɛzieziele bɛmaanle bɛ ɔvi ewiade mɔlebɛbo ne la na bɛdɛnla nu. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Ɔluakɛ ɛhɔne hunle me la bɛmaanle me aleɛ; nzuhɔne hunle me la bɛmaanle me nzule menonle; menyɛle ɛyɛvolɛ la bɛvale me bɛhɔle sua nu; <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />me nwo lale zo la bɛhedale me ɛdanlɛ; me nwo dole me la bɛrakpɔlale me; menlale efiade la bɛrale me nwo ɛkɛ.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Akee tenlenema ɛhye mɔ babiza kɛ, ‘Awulae, kenle nzu a yɛmaanle wɔ aleɛ a? Anzɛɛ kenle nzu a yɛnwunle kɛ nzuhɔne hunle wɔ mɔɔ yɛmaanle wɔ nzule a? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Anzɛɛ kenle nzu a ɛrale ɛyɛvolɛ mɔɔ yɛboale wɔ a? Anzɛɛ kenle nzu a ɛ nwo lale zo mɔɔ yɛhedale wɔ ɛdanlɛ a? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Kenle nzu a yɛnwunle kɛ ɛnde kpɔkɛ mɔɔ yɛrakpɔlale wɔ a? Kenle nzu a ɛlale efiade mɔɔ yɛrakpɔlale wɔ a?’<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />“Na Mame, Belemgbunli mumua ne, mebaze bɛ kɛ, ‘Wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ bɛyɛle ɛhye mɔ bɛmaanle me mediema ɛhye mɔ la, ɛnee bɛlɛyɛ bɛamaa me!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Akee mebahakyi me nye wɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛgua me sa bɛne ne azo la, na meaze bɛ kɛ, ‘Bɛmɛ munzuvoma, bɛhɔ damɛnlangoate senle ne mɔɔ bɛhuanle bɛmaanle abɔnsam nee ye awozonlema ne mɔ la anu. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ɔluakɛ, mɔɔ ɛhɔne hunle me la, bɛammaa me aleɛ; nzuhɔne hunle me, na bɛammaa me nzule meanno; <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />membale ɛyɛvolɛ la, bɛammaa me ɛleka meanla; me nwo lale zolɛ, na bɛangeda me ɛdanlɛ; me nwo dole me, na menlale efiade, noko akee bɛambamkpɔla me na bɛara me nwo ɛkɛ.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Akee bɛbabua kɛ, ‘Awulae, kenle nzu a yɛnwunle kɛ ɛhɔne hunle wɔ, anzɛɛ nzuhɔne hunle wɔ, anzɛɛ ɛrale ɛyɛvolɛ anzɛɛ ɛ nwo lale zo, anzɛɛ ɛ nwo dole wɔ, anzɛɛ ɛlale efiade, mɔɔ yɛamboa wɔ a?’<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />“Na mebabua bɛ kɛ, ‘Wɔ mekɛ ala mɔɔ bɛdule bɛ gye kɛ bɛkɛboa me mediema ɛhye mɔ la, ɛnee bɛlɛtu bɛ gye kɛ bɛkɛboa me.’<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />“Na ɛhye mɔ bahɔ ɔnlɛ-awieleɛ amaneɛnwunlɛ ne anu; na tenlenema ne mɔ bahɔ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛye Gyisɛse bɛmaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse wiele ye edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔka yeahile ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ka la, ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ,<verse eid="MAT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Kɛmɔ bɛdabɛ bɛze la, Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne babɔ ɔ bo wɔ ɛhyema anzi, na bɛbaye me bɛamaa na bɛabɔ me meanubaka nu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Mekɛ ko ne ala anu ɛnee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ wɔ ayia wɔ Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli Kayafase aako nu, na <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />bɛlɛdwenledwenle adenle mɔɔ bɛdua nu a bɛ sa kɛha Gyisɛse bɛkɛhye ye fealera nu, na bɛkɛhu ye la. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Bɛliele bɛdole nu kɛ, bɛnrɛhye ye wɔ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne anu, ɔluakɛ anrɛɛ basabasa kɛzi.<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Gyisɛse akee hɔle Bɛtani, na ɔhɔzokoɛle Saemɔn, kokobɛvolɛ ne sua nu. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Na melɛ mɔɔ ɔkpula ɔ sa la, raalɛ bie vale alufuanlɛ evuanlɛ bie mɔɔ wɔ toba nu na ye bolɛ yɛ se kpalɛ la rale, na ɔwolale ɔguale ɔ ti zo.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8-9" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ nyianle ɛya. Na bɛzele kɛ, “Duzu ezukoa ɛzɛkyelɛ a le ɛhye? Duzu ati a yeandɔne ye yeannyia ezukoa kpole na yeanva yeammaa ehyiavolɛma a?”<verse eid="MAT 26:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Gyisɛse ze mɔɔ ɛnee bɛlɛdwenle nwolɛ a, na ɔzele kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛmmaa raalɛ ye ɛnnyia ɔ nwo adenle a? Ɔluakɛ yeyɛ debie kpalɛ yemaa me. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Bɛmɛ bɛ nee ehyiavolɛma a de a, na Mame bɛ nee me ɛnde dahuu ne ala. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Yewola alufuanlɛ ɛhye yegua me nwo amaa yeaziezie me nwonane ne wɔ me ɛzielɛ nwo. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Na dahuu noko bɛbahakye ye wɔ deɛ ɛhye ati. Ɛleka biala mɔɔ bɛbabɔ Edwɛkpa ne nolo la bɛbaha deɛ ɛhye mɔɔ yeyɛ la anwo edwɛkɛ bɛahɔ maanle ti nee maanle bo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Akee Dwudase Yesekaleɔto, mɔɔ le ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne mɔ anu ko la, hɔle azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛkɛ hɔbizale bɛ kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />“Saa meye Gyisɛse memaa bɛ a bɛkɛdua me ɛzɛ?” Na bɛmaanle ye dwɛtɛ fufule mralɛ abulasa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Ɔvi zɔhane mekɛ ne anu, Dwudase kpondɛle adenle mɔɔ ɔdua nu a ɔ sa kɛha Gyisɛse ɔkɛye ye ɔkɛmaa bɛ la.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Wɔ kenle ne mɔɔ lumua wɔ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne anyunlu la anu, ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne rabizale ye kɛ, “Nienwu ɛleka a yɛbaziezie yɛ nwo na yɛali Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia aleɛ ne a?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛhɔ suakpole ne azo bɛhɔnwu nrenyia bie, na bɛze ye kɛ, ‘Awulae se, ye mekɛ ɛdwu, ɔti ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ barali bɛ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia aleɛ ne wɔ wɔ sua nu.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Ɛhye ati ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ yɛle mɔɔ ɔhanle ɔhilele bɛ la, na bɛbɔle bɛ aleɛ ne anwo mgbɔlɛka wɔ ɛkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20-21" />Nɔsolɛ zɔhane ala mɔɔ ɔ nee Bulu Nee Nwiɔ ne bɛkpula bɛ sa la, ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛ nuhua ko baye me amaa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Bɛlile nyane totohyia wɔ bɛ ahonle nu, na bɛ nuhua ko biala bizale kɛ, “Awulae, ɛnee mame ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Ɔbuale kɛ, “Yemɔ a le ahenle ne mɔɔ me nee ye yɛmu nwiɔ yɛto ɛsalɛ ko wɔ ɛyɛba nu yɛdi aleɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Na kɛmɔ ngɛlɛlera ne se la, ɔwɔ kɛ mewu, na munzule ɛha ahenle ko ne mɔɔ ɔlua ɔ nwo zo bɛbaye me bɛamaa la. Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ anrɛɛ bɛanwo ye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Dwudase, ɔdaye noko ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Rabbi, ɛnee mame a le ahenle ko ne ɔ?” Na Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ mumua ne wɔha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Na melɛ mɔɔ bɛdi aleɛ ne la, Gyisɛse vale kpanwo dolɔfo ekyi bie, na ɔyilale zolɛ na ɔbubule nu na ɔhyɛle ɔmaanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛlie ɛhye na bɛli, ɔluakɛ, ɛhye a le me nwonane ne a.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Akee ɔvale nwanye kanrɛlɛ ko na ɔlale ase wɔ nwolɛ, ɔvale ɔmaanle bɛ na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛ nuhua ko biala ɛnlo bie, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />ɔluakɛ ɛhye a le me mogya ne a, na ɔsɔ Ngyehyɛlɛ Fofolɛ ne anloa a. Ɛhye a bɛbahwi bɛagua wɔ menli ɛtane ti a. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Bɛyɛ me edwɛkɛ agbɔkɛ ne mɔ nzonlɛ. Menrɛnlo nwanye ɛhye bieko kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ me nee bɛ yɛbanlo ye fofolɛ wɔ Me Ze Belemgbunli maanle ne anu la.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Na mɔɔ bɛdole edwɛne bɛwiele la bɛvindele bɛhɔle Boka Ɔlivi azo.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Akee Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Nɔe bɛ muala bɛbakpo me. Ɔluakɛ, bɛhɛlɛle ye wɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ ne anu kɛ, Nana Nyamenle babɔ Boaneneavolɛ ne, na mboane ne mɔ babɔ asande. <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Na saa mevi ewule nu medwazo meba ngoane nu bieko a, mebahɔ Galeli, na meayia bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ ne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Pita zele kɛ, “Saa awie biala kɛkpo wɔ bɔbɔ a, mame menrɛyɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ ne a le kɛ, ɛnɛ nɔe ala, kolaa na akɔlɛ kabɔ aleɛbahye la, ɛnee wɔkpo me fane nsa!”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Pita eza zele ye kɛ, “Saa ɔba ye kɛ me nee wɔ kɛwu bɔbɔ a, menrɛkpo wɔ!” Na ɛdoavolɛma ne amuala bɛdabɛ bɛhanle zɔhane ala.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse hɔzɛlɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Akee Gyisɛse nee bɛ hɔle Gɛtesɛmani tola ne mɔɔ mbaka dɔɔnwo wɔ nu la anu, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ bɛdɛnla ɛkɛ ne bɛhendɛ ye na ɔkɔ ɔ nyunlu yeahɔzɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ɔ nee Pita ne Zɛbɛdi amra mrenyia nwiɔ ne, Gyemise nee Dwɔn a bɛhɔle a. Na ɔbɔle ɔ bo ɔlile nyane totohyia wɔ ye ahonle nu na ye adwenle yɛle ye sesakaa bie.<verse eid="MAT 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Me ɛkɛla ne ɛlɛdi nyane nee alɔbɔlɛ ahɔ ewule nu bɔbɔ. Bɛdɛnla ɛke na bɛ nee me ɛzinza.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ɔhɔle ɔ nyunlu ekyii, na ɔbutule ɔ nye aze na ɔzɛlɛle kɛ, “Egya! saa ɛyɛ na ɔkɛyɛ boɛ a, ɛnee maa bɔnyema dwora ɛhye ɛkpa me ti. Na saa ɔnrɛyɛ boɛ noko a ɛnee wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ ɛyɛ ɛkɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Akee ɔziale ɔrale ɛdoavolɛma nsa ne mɔ anwo ɛkɛ, na ɔranwunle bɛ kɛ bɛdeda. Ɔvɛlɛle Pita na ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Ɔti wɔangola ɛ nee me anzinza dɔnehwele ko bɔbɔ ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Bɛzinza, na bɛzɛlɛ, ammaa bɛangɔ ngyegyelɛ nu. Ɔluakɛ; Sunsum ne kulo, na sonlabaka ne ala a ɛnlɛ anwosesebɛ a.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Ɔgyakyile bɛ ɛkɛ ne bieko ɔhɔzɛlɛle kɛ, “Egya! Saa bɔnyema dwora ɛhye ɛnrɛkpa me ti ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ ɛyɛ ɛkɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ɔziale ɔrale bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne bieko, na ɔradole bɛ kɛ bɛdeda, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee nafelɛ ɛzi bɛ nye soo, <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />ɛhye ati ɔhɔyɛle ye nzɛlɛlɛ ne mɔɔ tɔ, zo nsa ne la, na eza ɔhanle edwɛkɛ ko ne ala.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Akee ɔrale ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo ɛkɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛhɔ zo bɛlafe na bɛlie bɛ menle. Bɛnlea! Mekɛ ne ɛdwu! Bɛye Sonla Ra ne bɛwula ɛtanevolɛma asa anu. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Bɛdwazo! Bɛmaa yɛhɔ! Bɛnlea! Mɔɔ baye me amaa la a ɛlɛba la!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Mekɛ ko ne ala mɔɔ ɛnee ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔlɛtendɛ la, Dwudase, mɔɔ le Bulu Nee Nwiɔ ne anu ko la, nee menli dɔɔnwo bie mɔɔ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ zoanle bɛ na bɛdedɛ ahoholombaka nee dadeɛ la rale. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Dwudase zele bɛ kɛ bɛhye nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɔbabiza ye ahye la, ɔluakɛ yemɔ a le ahenle ne mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ ye la a. <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ɛhye ati Dwudase hɔle Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne ndɛndɛ ne ala na ɔzele kɛ, “Yɛmenle, akoaba!” na akee ɔvole ɔ nloa.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Me gɔnwo, kɔ deɛ mɔɔ yemɔti ɛrale kɛ ɛbayɛ la azo ɛ.” Akee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛhale la noko tetale ye.<verse eid="MAT 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Menli mɔɔ ɛnee boka Gyisɛse anwo la ko hwenle ye dadeɛ ne na ɔpɛle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne akɛlɛ ne mɔ ko anzo.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Fa wɔ dadeɛ ne wula ye boa ne anu. Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtwe dadeɛ la bɛwu dadeɛ nloa. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Anzɛɛ bɛnze kɛ mekola mɛsɛlɛ Egya memaa ɔmaa anwumabɔvolɛma apenle apenle basinza me ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Noko akee saa meyɛ ɛhye a, kɛ ɔkɛzi ɔkɛyɛ na ngɛlɛlera ne ali munli ɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Akee Gyisɛse dendɛle hilele menli ɛwolaa ne. Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee bɛdwenle kɛ mele kodiawu anwo ɛzulolɛ bie ati a bɛdedɛ dadeɛ nee ahoholombaka bɛ sa nu kɛ bɛbahye me la ɔ? Me nee bɛ ɛdɛnla na mehilehile bɛ debie wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu dahuu biala na bɛangye me. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Na ɛhye mɔ kosooti ɛlɛsisi amaa ngapezoma ne mɔ edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ bɛhɛlɛle ye wɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ ne anu la ali munli.” Mekɛ ɛhye anu, akee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ amuala kpole ye na bɛnriandinle bɛhɔle.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ɛya kpole hunle menli ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛhyele ye la, na bɛ nee ye hɔle Kayafase, mɔɔ le Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne la sua nu, ɛleka mɔɔ ɛnee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛhɔ ayia la. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Pita lile bɛ nzi nanamogya nanamogya na ɔhɔle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne aako ne anu edwɛkɛlilɛ ɛleka ne na ɔhɔdɛnlanle aze wɔ sogyama ne mɔ anwo ɛkɛ, kɛ ɔnea debie mɔɔ bɛbava bɛayɛ Gyisɛse a.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma edwɛkɛdivoma nee mɔɔ wɔ Kɔɔto totohyia ne anu amra ne yiale ɛkɛ ne, kɛ bɛkpondɛ alasevolɛ mɔɔ kɛli daselɛ adalɛ kɛtia Gyisɛse, amaa bɛeanyia edwɛkɛ mɔɔ kɛva ye kɛhɔ ewule nu la. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60-61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60-61" />Na bɔbɔ, bɛnyianle menli dɔɔnwo mɔɔ kɛli daselɛ adalɛ zɛhae la ɛdeɛ, noko akee anloanzɛlɛ amba bɛ nu ɛkɛ wɔ bɛ daselɛlilɛ ne anu. Na nzinlii, bɛnyianle mrenyia nwiɔ bie mɔɔ zele kɛ, “Nrenyia ɛhye hanle kɛ, ‘Mekola mebubu Nana Nyamenle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne na mefa kenle nsa mesi ye fofolɛ.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:60-61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Akee Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne dwazole na ɔbizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a ɛlɛ ye ɛka wɔ ɛhye anwo a? Hanle ye zɔ ɔ, anzɛɛ wɔanga ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Na Gyisɛse ambuke ɔ nloa bɔbɔ. Akee Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne zele ye kɛ, “Wɔ damɛnlangoate Nyamenle ne duma nu, ka kile yɛ, saa amgba ala ɛse Ɛdawɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne mɔɔ le Nana Nyamenle Ara ne a.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ “Ɛhɛe! Ɛdawɔ wɔha. Na mese wɔ kɛ, ɔvi ɛnɛ mɔɔ kɔ la, bɛbanwu Mame, Sonla Ra ne kɛ mede Nana Nyamenle asa fema zo, na melɛsia meara wɔ anwuma amungu ne mɔ anu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65-66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65-66" />Akee Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne suanle ye tɛladeɛ ne vile ɔ nwo na ɔdeanle nu kɛ, “Yeha munzule edwɛkɛ! Yɛngyia alasevolɛ nwo bieko. Bɛ muala bɛde mɔɔ yeha la! Kɛ bɛ adwenle se bɛ ɛ?” Bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Ɔfɛta ewule! Ɔfɛta ewule! Ɔfɛta ewule!”<verse eid="MAT 26:65-66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Akee bɛtotole nyɛlɛ ɔ nyunlu na bɛzile ye abotokuma, na bie mɔ bɔle ɔ nzo nu, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />na bɛzele kɛ, “Ka edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bazi la kile yɛ, wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛle Ngoanedievolɛ la! Nwane a bɔle wɔ a?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita ɛkpo kɛ ɔnze Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Na mɔɔ Pita de edwɛkɛlilɛ ɛleka ne la, kakula raalɛ bie rale ɛkɛ, na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ noko ɛnee Gyisɛse mɔɔ vi Galeli la a lua a.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Na Pita maanle ɔ ne zo, na ɛya nu ala ɔzele ye kɛ, “Mɔɔ ɛlɛka bɔbɔ la menze nwolɛ bie hweledede.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Nzinlii mɔɔ ɔvindele anlenkɛ ne anzi la, kakula raalɛ bieko nwunle ye, na ɔzele menli mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la kɛ, “Nrenyia ɛhye nee Gyisɛse mɔɔ vi Nazalɛte la a lua a.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Pita eza zale ɔ ne bieko, na ɔlile amonle ɔzele kɛ, “Menze nrenyia ɛhye bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Na nzinlii mɔɔ mekɛ ekyii zenle la, menli mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne, na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛze ye wienyi kɛ ɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko, ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛdendɛlɛ ne bɔbɔ kile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Pita bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔwa amonle na ɔka ndane kɛ, “Menze nrenyia ɛhye bɔbɔ.” Na ɛkɛ ne ala akɔlɛ bɔle. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Akee Pita hakyele Gyisɛse edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle la kɛ, “Mɔɔ akɔlɛ kabɔ la, ɛnee wɔkpo me fane nsa.” Na ɔvindele na ɔhɔzunle nyane ɛzunlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ndɛnebualɛ nee ɛhunlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Mɔɔ aleɛ hyenle la azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ yiale nu bieko dwenledwenlenle adenle mɔɔ bɛdua nu a ɛnee bɛkɛli bɛkɛwula Wulomuma Arane ne bɛkɛmaa ɔkɛbua Gyisɛse ewule fɔlɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Akee bɛguale ye nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ na bɛvale ye bɛhɔmaanle Paelɛte, mɔɔ le Wulomuma Amɛnlado ne.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Mekɛ ko ne ala anu, Dwudase, mɔɔ yele ye maanle la nwunle kɛ bɛbua Gyisɛse ewule fɔlɛ la, ɔhakyile ye adwenle na ɔlile nyane totohyia kpole wɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ la anwo, na ɔziale ɔvale ezukoa ne ɔhɔmaanle azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Na ɔzele kɛ, “Meyɛ ɛtane, ɔluakɛ meye sonla mɔɔ ɛnze nwolɛ bie la memaa.” Bɛbuale ye ɛkɛ ne ala bɛzele kɛ, “Ɛhye le wɔ edwɛkɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Akee ɔvuandinle ezukoa ne ɔguale Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu azɛlɛ ne anwo na ɔhɔle ɔhɔzɔle ɔ kɔme nyɛma. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ sesale ezukoa ne, na bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛfa ezukoa ɛhye yɛgua yɛ gya ezukoa ne anu a ɔnyɛ boɛ, kɛmɔ yɛ mɛla tua kɛ yɛkɛlie ezukoa mɔɔ bɛkɛdua ye wɔ sonla ɛhunlɛ nwo la.”<verse eid="MAT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Bɛdwenlenle nwo na bɛbɔle ye kpɔkɛ na bɛhɔdɔle azɛlɛ ne mɔɔ mbuakɛnwovoma ne te ɛkɛ ne ndɛtɛlɛ nwo bɛ ninyɛne la kɛ bɛfa bɛayɛ azie bɛamaa nyɛvolɛ mɔɔ kɛwu Gyɛlusalɛm la. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ɛhye ati a ɛnɛ nee ɛnɛ ala bɛfɛlɛ azie ne “Mogya Azɛlɛ” la a.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ɛhye maanle Gyɛlɛmaya kapezo edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ se, “Bɛvale ezukoa fufule mralɛ abulasa ne, bolɛ ne mɔɔ bɛdɔnenle Ye la ɔyɛle wɔ Yizilayɛma anye zo la, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />na bɛvale bɛhɔdɔle azɛlɛ bɛvile mbuakɛnwovoma ne mɔ ɛkɛ, kɛmɔ Nana Nyamenle zele me la.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse gyi Paelɛte anyunlu ɛkɛ ne la, Paelɛte bizale ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ a ɛle Dwuuma Belemgbunli ne la ɔ?” Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Na mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ lile daselɛ adalɛ dɔɔnwo tiale ye la, Gyisɛse ambua bɛ bɔbɔ; ɔyɛle koonwu.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Paelɛte bizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnde mɔɔ bɛlɛkeha la ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Noko akee Gyisɛse andendɛ ɔ nwo bɔbɔ; na ɛhye zinle Amɛnlando ne anwo totohyia.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Wɔ ɛvolɛ biala Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne anu, ɔle Amɛnlado ne amaamuo anzɛɛ Dwuuma mɛla kɛ ɔkɛye Dwuunli ko mɔɔ menli ne mɔ bɛdabɛ bɛkɛze kɛ bɛye ye la, ɔkɛvi efiade ne. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Na wɔ ɛvolɛ ɛhye anu noko, ɛnee kodiawu anwo ɛzulolɛ anwo ɛvɛlɛ bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Balabase la, la efiade, <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />ɔti mɔɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne yiale wɔ Paelɛte aako ne anu nwonlomɔ mangyee ne la, ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Menli nwiɔ ɛhye anu boni yɛɛ bɛkulo kɛ meye ye memaa bɛ a. Balabase anzɛɛ Gyisɛse, mɔɔ le bɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne la ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɔze ye wienyi kɛ, Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛhye Gyisɛse wɔ diedi kpole ne mɔɔ menli ne mɔ ɛnyia ye wɔ ye nu la anwo ɛkpɔlɛ ti.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Mɔɔ Paelɛte de ebia nu ɔtie edwɛkɛ ne la, ɔ ye vale nrɛlaleɛ bie rɛlɛle ye mɔɔ se: “Gyakyi nrenyia ɛhye mɔɔ ɛtɛyɛle ɛtane biala la maa ɔhɔ; ɔluakɛ menganle ɛlalɛ ɛzulolɛ bie mɔɔ fale ɔ nwo la anoma nɔe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Akee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ lile wulale menli ɛwolaa ne amuala kɛ, bɛbiza Balabase ɛyelɛ, na Gyisɛse, yemɔ bɛhu ye. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Ɛhye ati mɔɔ Amɛnlado ne bizale bɛ bieko kɛ, “Menli nwiɔ ɛhye mɔ nuhua ne boni a menye ye memaa bɛ a” la, menli ɛwolaa ne zele kɛ, “Balabase!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Paelɛte bizale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee akee duzu debie a menva menyɛ Gyisɛse, mɔɔ le bɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne la a?” Bɛ muala bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Bɔ ye meanubaka nu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Paelɛte bizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati ɔ? Duzu ɛtane a yeyɛ a?” Noko akee bɛhɔle zo bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ; “Bɔ ye meanubaka nu! Bɔ ye meanubaka nu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Mɔɔ Paelɛte nwunle kɛ somaa ne mɔɔ ɔlɛka la le gyɛne la, na basabasa kpondɛ abɔ ɔ bo la, ɔzoanle ɔmaanle bɛhɔzale nzule kyɛnze nu bɛrɛlɛle ye, na ɔwowole ɔ sa anwo wɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne anyunlu, na ɔzele kɛ, “Menli fɔlɛ wɔ nrenyia ɛhye mɔɔ ɛtɛyɛle ɛtane biala la mogya ne anwo. Ɛzonle ne zo bɛ nee bɛ mra!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Na menli dɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ ɛya ɛyi bɛ tɛkɛɛ la yele ɔ nloa zele kɛ, “Ye mogya ne ɛgua yɛdayɛ nee yɛ mra ati zo!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Akee Paelɛte yele Balabase maanle bɛ. Na mɔɔ ɔbilale Gyisɛse empele ɔwiele la, ɔvale ye ɔmaanle Wulomu sogyama ne mɔ kɛ bɛ nee ye ɛhɔ bɛhɔbɔ ye meanubaka nu. <verse eid="MAT 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Bɛlumuale bɛvale ye bɛhɔle ɛleka ne mɔɔ bɛfa konlendeɛ ne mɔ bɛsie la na bɛvɛlɛle bɛ sogya ɛlɔne ekpunli ne amuala. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bɛkpolole ye tɛladeɛ ne na bɛvale tɛladeɛ kɔbenle bɛwulale ye, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />na bɛvale mbowule bɛyɛle abotile bɛkpolole ɔ ti, na bɛvale kpɔma bɛwulale Ɔ sa fema ne anu kɛ belemgbunli sɛkɛlɛneɛ bie la, na bɛhotole ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ ne bɛzile ye amgbu bɛzele kɛ, “Akoaba, Dwuuma Belemgbunli!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Na akee bɛtotole nyɛlɛ ɔ nyunlu na bɛzale ye bɛliele kpɔma ne na bɛvale bɛbɔle ɔ ti avinli penyi!<verse eid="MAT 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Bɛzile ye amgbu bɛwiele la bɛyele bɛ tɛladeɛ kɔbenle ɛdeɛ ne, na bɛvale ɔdaye mumua ne ye tɛladeɛ ɛdeɛ ne bɛwulale ye bieko, na bɛvale ye bɛdɔle adenle zo kɛ bɛkabɔ ye meanubaka nu. <verse eid="MAT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Na mɔɔ bɛdɔle adenle zo kɛ bɛkɔ ɛhunlɛ ɛleka ne la, bɛyiale nrenyia bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Saemɔn, mɔɔ vi Saelini mɔɔ wɔ Abibile Maanle nu la, na bɛhyele ye bɛmaanle ɔzoale Gyisɛse meanubaka ne. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Akee bɛhɔle ɛleka bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Gɔlogɔta, mɔɔ ɔ bo a le “Etile kanrɛlɛ Boka” la. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Ɛkɛ ne a sogyama ne mɔ maanle ye nwanye mɔɔ bɔnyema wɔ nu la kɛ ɔnlo a; na mɔɔ ɔhanle ɔ nloa ɔnleanle la yeanno.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Mɔɔ bɛbɔle ye meanubaka nu bɛwiele la, sogyama ne mɔ dole ye tɛladeɛ ne anwo nzeleba na bɛhyɛle bɛvale. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Akee bɛdɛnlanle aze na bɛnleanle ye wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔhenda meanubaka ne azo la. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Na bɛvale ngɛlɛlera bie bɛbɔle ye meanubaka ne ati zo mɔɔ se, “Ɛhye a le Gyisɛse, Dwuuma ne bɛ Belemgbunli ne.”<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Bɛbɔle nwule nwiɔ bie noko meanumbaka nu nwonlomɔ zɔhane, ko wɔ ɔ sa fema zo, yɛɛ ko wɔ ɔ sa bɛne zo. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Na menli mɔɔ pɛ nu ahɔ la zile ye amgbu, na bɛkpusukpusule bɛ ti bɛzele kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Wio! Tɛ wɔmɔ a ɛse ɛkola ɛbubu Nyamenle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne na ɛfa kenle nsa ala ɛsi la ɔ? Saa ɔle zɔ ɛdeɛ a ɛnee ɛvi meanubaka ne azo dwu aze na kile kɛ amgba ɛle Nyamenle Ra!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41-43" />Na azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ noko zile ye amgbu na bɛzele kɛ, “Ɔdie awie mɔ ngoane, noko akee ɔngola ɔnlie ɔdaye mumua ne ye ngoane! Wio! Na tɛ wɔmɔ a ɛse ɛle Yizilayɛma Belemgbunli ne la ɔ? Ɛvi meanubaka ne azo dwu aze na yɛbalie wɔ yɛali! Ɔdie Nana Nyamenle ɔdi, ɔti bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle ɛlie ye na ɔhile kɛ ɔle zɔ amgba. Yeanga kɛ, ‘Ɔle Nyamenle Ra’ ɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 27:41-43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Na nwule ne mɔ noko golole ɔ nwo bie.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kenle ko ne ewia ne, awozinli kabii hedale azɛlɛ ye amuala azo dedee dɔnehwele nsa, ɔvi ewiazo bulu nee nwiɔ hɔkpulale ewiazo dɔne nsa.<verse eid="MAT 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Na mɔɔ bɛbɔle kɛyɛ dɔne nsa la, Gyisɛse deanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Eli, Eli, lama sabaketani” mɔɔ abo a le kɛ, “Me Nyamenle, Me Nyamenle, duzu ati a wɔkpo me a la?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Menli mɔɔ ɛnee gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la bie mɔ dele ɛhye la bɛ adwenle yɛle bɛ kɛ ɔlɛfɛlɛ Yilaegya. <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Bɛ nuhua ko vale ɛnriandinlɛ hɔle hɔvale emiane bɔle nwanye ɛnwonle nu na ɔvale ɔduale baka ti na akee ɔvale ɔmaanle ye kɛ ɔnlo. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Na menli mɔɔ hale la zele ye kɛ, “Bɛgyakyi ye koonwu. Bɛmaa yɛnlea kɛ saa amgba Yilaegya bara aralie ye a.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Na akee Gyisɛse deanle nu bieko, na ye sunsum ne vile ye nu, na ɔwule. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Na nea, ɛdanlɛ ne mɔɔ pɛ Anwodelɛ Ɛleka ne anyunlu wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la anu suanle vile anwuma radwule aze; na azɛlɛ kpusule, na awolɛ, nee awoka kpukekpukele, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />na azɛka bukebukele, na anwodelɛma mrenyia nee mraalɛ mɔɔ bɛwuwu la ziale rale ngoane nu bieko. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Nzinlii mɔɔ Gyisɛse vi ewule nu dwazole la, bɛvile azie ne azo na bɛhɔle Gyɛlusalɛm, na bɛyele bɛ nwo bɛhilele menli dɔɔnwo ne ala wɔ ɛkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Sogyama ne mɔ nee bɛ mgbanyima mɔɔ hɔle meanubaka nu ɛbɔlɛ ne, na bɛlɛsinza ye la ahonle dule totohyia wɔ azɛlɛ ɛkpusulɛ ne nee ninyɛne mɔɔ sisile la anwo. Bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, Nrenyia ɛhye le Nyamenle Ra.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Na mraalɛ dɔɔnwo mɔɔ nee Gyisɛse vi Galeli rale kɛ bɛbazonle ye la gyinlanle amozi nleanle ninyɛne mɔɔ zile la bie. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mraalɛ ɛhye mɔ boka mraalɛ mɔɔ rale la anwo: Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la nee Male, mɔɔ ɔ mra a le Gyemise nee Dwosefi la, ɔ nee Gyemise nee Dwɔn mɔɔ bɛ ze a le Zɛbɛdi la bɛ nli ne.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yewu bɛzie Ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Mɔɔ nɔsolɛ dwule la, nrenyia sukoavolɛ bie mɔɔ vi Arelematia, mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Dwosefi na ɔle Gyisɛse ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ko la, <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />hɔle Paelɛte anwo ɛkɛ hɔzɛlɛle Gyisɛse funli ne. Na Paelɛte maanle adenle maanle bɛvale bɛmaanle ye. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Dwosefi vale selekye mɔɔ anye le bɔkɔbɔkɔ la bebale funli ne anwo, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />na ɔhɔziele ye wɔ ɔdaye ye sɛka fofolɛ mɔɔ yepɛ la anu, na ɔhundole bolɛ totohyia bie ɔnyinle sɛka ne anloa na ɔhɔle. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Ɛnee Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la nee Male ɛhendeɛ ne amu nwiɔ de sɛka ne anzi ɛkɛ ne bɛlɛsinza ye.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Aleɛ hyenle na ye nɔsolɛ nu mɔɔ asɛɛ kenle ne mɔɔ lumua wɔ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne anu la ɛwie la, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Falasiima ne mɔ hɔle Paelɛte anwo ɛkɛ <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />hɔzele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, nrenyia adalɛ ne de aze la, ɔhanle kɛ, ‘Kenle nsa pɛ nu a, mebazia meara ngoane nu bieko.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ɛhye ati maa bɛzinza sɛka ne kɔkpula kenle nsa ne, yemɔ anrɛɛ ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛhɔwua ye kɛhɔ na akee bɛkɛze menli kɛ, ɔvi ewule nu yedwazo. Saa ɛhye si a yɛkɛnwu yɛ nyunlu yɛkɛdɛla dɛba ne bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Paelɛte zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmaa bɛdabɛ bɛ Asɔne agbolisi ne mɔ ɛzinza. Bɛkola bɛsinza ye bɔkɔɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ɛhye ati bɛhɔle na bɛhɔyɛle sɛka ne nzonlɛ. Bɛzɔle bolɛ ne anloa, na sinzavolɛma ne mɔ noko bokale bɛ nwo bɛmaanle bɛzinzale.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yedwazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Na wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne, kenle ne mɔɔ li dapɛne ne anyunlu aleɛbahye, mɔɔ le Molɛ la, Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la nee Male ɛhendeɛ ne hɔle kɛ bɛkanlea sɛka ne.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Na nea, azɛlɛ kpusule kpole kpalɛ; ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle ye anwumabɔvolɛ ko vi anwuma dwule aze, na ɔrale ɔrahundole bolɛ ne ɔvile sɛka ne anloa, na ɔdɛnlanle zolɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Na ɔ nyunlu dale wienyi kɛ ezule mɔɔ defedevede la, na ye tɛlɛdeɛ le fufule nwohyee kɛ asukɔntweaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Na ɔ nwo ɛzulole ti, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛsinza sɛka ne la anwo wozole bɛ, na bɛyɛle kɛ mɔwuamra.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Na anwumabɔvolɛ ne dendɛle hilele mraalɛ ne mɔ, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmasulo! Meze kɛ bɛlɛkpondɛ Gyisɛse, mɔɔ bɛbɔle ye meanubaka nu la, <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />na emomu, ɔnle ɛke! Ɔvi ewule nu yedwazo kɛmɔ ɔhanle ye la. Bɛrɛla sɛka ne anloa na bɛranlea ɛleka mɔɔ bɛdole ye la. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Na akee bɛhɔ ndɛndɛ ne ala na bɛhɔha bɛhile ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, ɔvi ewule nu yedwazo, na ɔlɛdumua bɛ nyunlu yeahɔ Galeli yeahɔyia bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ ne. Me nrɛlaleɛ mɔɔ melɛ ye mefa memaa bɛ la ɛne.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Mraalɛ ne mɔ vile sɛka ne anloa ndɛndɛ ne ala vindele, na bɛvale ɛzulolɛ nee fɛlɛkolilɛ kpole ne ala bɛnriandinle bɛhɔle kɛ bɛkaha bɛahile ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Na mɔɔ bɛnriandi la, arɛlevilɛ nu ala bɛnwunle kɛ Gyisɛse gyi bɛ nyunlu ɛkɛ, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ muala bɛli fɛlɛko.” Na bɛ muala bɛrale bɛrasosɔle ɔ gyakɛ, na bɛhotole ye na bɛyeyɛle ye.<verse eid="MAT 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Na akee Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmasulo! Bɛhɔ bɛhɔha bɛhile me mediema ne mɔ kɛ, bɛhɔ Galeli ndɛndɛ zo, na ɛkɛ ne a bɛbanwu me a.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Mɔɔ mraalɛ ne mɔ lua adenle nu bɛkɔ la, Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu sinzavolɛma ne anu bie mɔ rale sua ne azo na bɛrahanle ninyɛne mɔɔ zile la amuala bɛhilele azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12-13" />Na bɛ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ yiale nu na bɛvale akpame la, bɛmaanle sogyama ne ndoloboa kpole bie, na bɛzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛha ye kɛ, nɔe mɔɔ yɛlale la ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale rawuale ye funli ne.<verse eid="MAT 28:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />“Na saa Amɛnlado ne te a yɛbali bɛ ti edwɛkɛ yɛamaa bɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Ɔti sinzavolɛma ne mɔ liele ndoloboa ne, na bɛhanle mɔɔ bɛzele bɛ kɛ bɛha la bɛhilele Dwuuma ne mɔ. Bɛ adawu ɛhye kpondenle kpole kpalɛ wɔ Dwuuma avinli, na ɛnɛ nee ɛnɛ ala bɛdie bɛdi ye bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Akee ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee ko ne zile nu hɔle Galeli, wɔ boka ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse hilele bɛ kɛ bɛbanwu ye wɔ ɛkɛ la azo. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ bɛyiale ye na bɛzonlenle ye a, noko akee bɛ nuhua bie mɔ zule nwolɛ kpolera, ɔluakɛ, bɛanlie bɛanli kɛ amgba ɔdaye Gyisɛse ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Na Gyisɛse rale na ɔrazele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛva tumi kosooti mɔɔ wɔ anwuma nee aze la bɛwula me sa nu. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Ɛhye ati bɛhɔ bɛhɔyɛ maanle kosooti me ɛdoavolɛma na bɛzɔne bɛ wɔ Selɛ ne, nee Ralɛ ne, nee Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne duma nu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Na bɛhilehile ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛhye: kɛ bɛli mɛla mɔɔ mehyehyɛ la amuala azo; na bɛnlea ɛhye boɛ, me nee bɛ de dahuu dahuu, kɔkpula ewiade awieleɛ ne.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>